<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Tarüa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tarüa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tarüa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tarüa</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Mosi chekhai, now arui khin dow 1,406 <char style="w">BC</char> khe chekhai. Mami bowih dow Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi kowh tali lawmbawr mih chekhai. Mami bowih dow Thurai khamah mih pren kowi nakup kown mih Israel chenchapuüa vüi Mosi rui pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi dow Tarüa bowih pahai tekah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow 1 hai 26 lawng kowi dow rüa maru mih lawnguan kowi arui uowi chekhai. Mami bowih kowi dow rüa maru mih klen kowi akeng mih lawnguan paw arui uowi chekhai. Hebrai lai hown mami bowih dow “Süngrüp süngkangma kowi” pahai tekah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami bowih kowi mih 38 ning mowr süngrüp süngkangma kowi Israeluüa cham krawi uowila mih lawnguan kowi arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih ming Tarüa bowih pahai chap pe ming chepaw mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih lawnguan dow lup chang, lümla iuksownra hai lümla piakra lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi dow aiung aiungma mih sangchia uowi ahuma chekhai. Naiawngün sangchia dow kowkumü Kanan pren mih (13-14 lawng), Kora kingküa CHAKRAMANG mih (16 lawng), Arawn kowh raitua hownia pau awr phaw mih (17 lawng), kri rua (21:1-22:1), Balam hai aia kowh kawrnga (22:2-25:18) ün chekhai. Mami bowih hailawm Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi dow ari arow bowih pahai Hebraiuüa tek pe khai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Tamkhuown: Tamkhuown pami dow pren mat müa chekhai. Nami dow uanpowngchow iawng chekhai. Bangla lai hown nami dow tek pe pawtaka mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Süngrüp süngkangma: Süngrüp süngkangma pami dow singh kau hai tui uowi dowi mih süng chekhai. Naiawng mih süng dow sephung kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Nazaret: Nazaret pami dow Thurai vüi kowi kowh tape mih maru chekhai. Naiawng mih maru dow grep tui hai grep tui taraw mih chakkham ia cha dowi chekhai, now sam paw ia kep dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Tangbung: Tangbung pami dow alai chowng khe kowh Israeluüa kowh kim chekhai. Nami dow uan hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Dumiow: Dumiow pami dow kukpa chang lup mih maru chekhai. Naiawng mih maru dow mami maru kowh ransu tawng ngai chow chang mih hai kamrüt mih natukla kownkow kukpa tawi uowi hanow nami lawnguan kowi mami maru kowi uang phowng pe reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Sinai hungh hownia namang kownkow Israeluüa kamrüt mih 1:1-9:23</para>
  <para style="io2">Rüa maru mih 1:1-4:49</para>
  <para style="io2">Achaing achaing ari aiang hai ari arow 5:1-8:26</para>
  <para style="io2">Takat pawi 9:1-23</para>
  <para style="io1">Sinai hungh hownia Moab 10:1-21:35</para>
  <para style="io1">Moab kowi kowh phaw mih lawnguan 22:1-32:42</para>
  <para style="io1">Aigupta hownia Moab prakowi mang mih lawnguan 33:1-49</para>
  <para style="io1">Pown Jawrdan aw dowi rawn kowh ana 33:50-36:13</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Mosi rüa Israeluüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt mih pre ning kowi kowh pre la kowi lacher pani khe <char style="w">taklowp taklangra te</char> lak kowi Mosi hown CHAKRAMANG uang taklang khai. Nakhowk khe Israeluüa uowi mih dow Sinai hungh uowi mih <char style="w">süngrüp süngkangma</char> kowi chekhai. Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2-3" />“Enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi tasen uangh khowk mih kachakuüa mün iachow uowi mih natukla kownkow Arawn enchi natang pe ming kown. Pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh tasen uangh khowk mih kachakuüa nget kowi chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowi akra akrachow enchi narüaah kown. <verse eid="NUM 1:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Nami lup nachang kownkow bowkbowk <char style="w">krungchak</char> hownia nakhowng enchi lowk ia chi kown. Nakhowng enchi kown miuüa dow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow mih naown kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Nakhowng enchi kownkow nauang kown mih aluchowuüa dow Reuben krungchak hownia Sedeur kowh chapa Elizur, <verse eid="NUM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Simiawn krungchak hownia Zurisadai kowh chapa Selumiel. <verse eid="NUM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />Juda krungchak hownia Aminadab kowh chapa Nasawn. <verse eid="NUM 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />Isakar krungchak hownia Zuar kowh chapa Nethanel. <verse eid="NUM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />Zebulun krungchak hownia Helawn kowh chapa Eliab. <verse eid="NUM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Josef kowh chapauüa pungmadawng kowi dow Efraim krungchak hownia Amihud kowh chapa Elisama. Manase krungchak hownia Pedazur kowh chapa Gamaliel. <verse eid="NUM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Benjamin krungchak hownia Gideawni kowh chapa Abidan. <verse eid="NUM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Dan krungchak hownia Amisadai kowh chapa Ahizer. <verse eid="NUM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Aser krungchak hownia Okran kowh chapa Pakiel. <verse eid="NUM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Gad krungchak hownia Deuel kowh chapa Eliasaf. <verse eid="NUM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Naptali krungchak hownia Enan kowh chapa Ahira büah chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />“Naiawngünuüa dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia kowh kloah mih aluchowuüa chekhai. Amatni bowkbowk dow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17-18" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih naiawngün aluchowuüa kowi hawla now Mosi hai Arawn iüah mih Israeluüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai bowt. Nami dow Aigupta pren hownia amatni uang lawt mih pre ning hown pre la khe kowh lacher pani khe chekhai. Israeluüa mih chowlowkkow krungchak ming tekla now aluchowuüa mih amatni kowh ming tang pe khai; amatni kowi dow pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh tasen uangh khowk mih kachakuüa ming maten lowkchow lowkchow aluchowuüa tang pe khai. <verse eid="NUM 1:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />CHAKRAMANG <char style="w">ana pek</char> iawng Sinai hungh uowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi Mosi mih Israeluüa kowi rüaah khai.<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20-46" />Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh tasen uangh khowk mih kachakuüa nget kowi dow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi akra akrachow aluchowuüa tang pe ming khai. Jakawb kowh chapa lang ta mih Reuben krungchak dow 46,500 ia, Simiawn krungchak dow 59,300 ia, Gad krungchak dow 45,650 ia, Juda krungchak dow 74,600 ia, Isakar krungchak dow 54,400 ia, Zebulun krungchak dow 57,400 ia, Efraim krungchak dow 40,500 ia, Manase krungchak dow 32,200 ia, Benjamin krungchak dow 35,400 ia, Dan krungchak dow 62,700 ia, Aser krungchak dow 41,500 ia, Naptali krungchak dow 53,400 ia. Bowkbowk kowi 603,550 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 1:20-46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leviuüa kowi rüala dowi mih auan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Naiawngünuüa pungmadawng kowi Levi krungchakuüa kowi tarapchedow rüala büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />“En rüa maru iun khe Levi krungchakuüa kowi dow en narüala kown nadowi, now akeng mih Israeluüa hown paw en nabawngla kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50-51" />Leviuüa kowi dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh tawngah kengah mih uanh maten en nape mingkhetah kown. Naiawngün naming nakhet kown mih <char style="w">kurdik</char> dow amatni napaw kown takla. Amatni dow cham süt <char style="w">tangbung khup rah</char> mih khin khe taklowp taklangra te napiakah hanow nakowi kowh tawngah kengah mih uanh maten nacham kawtla kown, now akeng kowi cham plan khup taklowp taklangra te khe paw amatni chowtaih nakhup kown. Now taklowp taklangra te riaret kowi tavir lut nakhup tangbung hanow nauowi kown mih paw amatni chowtaih. Akeng mih maru che taklowp taklangra te ria kowi kowtawi tatawn hanow nami maru kowi dow nakowngta kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 1:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Akeng mih Israeluüa dow chowlowkkow thumchakuüa arasang nakhup tangbung kown. Amatni dow chowlowkkow <char style="w">tamkhuown</char> krüa kowi nauowi büah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Tawkchedow taklowp taklangra te riaret kowi tawi ia tatawn büah kown nadowi. Amatni che tawi tatawn hanow nakowng büah kown. Naiawng rakowi Leviuüa mih taklowp taklangra te riaret kowi tavir lut nakhup tangbung hanow nauowi kown, now taklowp taklangra te mih namingkhet büah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih maten iawng rowprowp Israeluüa mih chang khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="ms">Nakhup tangbung kown mih krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Nami kung kowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />“Israeluüa dow amatni chowlowkkow thumchakuüa kowh tamkhuown hai krungchakuüa kowh tamkhuown re-e nakhup tangbung büah kown takla. Amatni mih taklowp taklangra te tapat lut nakrawi khup tangbung kown. Tawkchedow taklowp taklangra te hownia alak sangrum re-e nakhupah büah kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda thumchak: Juda, Isakar hai Zebulun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3-4" />“Taklowp taklangra te satlawt prakowi dow Juda thumchak nakhup tangbung kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 2:3-4">“Juda krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Aminadab kowh chapa Nasawn chekhai. Juda krungchakuüa maru iun dow 74,600 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5-6" />“Juda krungchakuüa papra kowi dow Isakar krungchakuüa nakhup tangbung kown. Isakar krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Zuar kowh chapa Nethanel chekhai. Isakar krungchakuüa maru iun dow 54,400 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7-8" />“Now Juda krungchakuüa akeng prakowi dow Zebulun krungchakuüa nakhup tangbung kown. Zebulun krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Helawn kowh chapa Eliab chekhai. Zebulun krungchakuüa maru iun dow 57,400 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />“Juda thumchak kowi kowh maru iun mut dow 186,400 ia chekhai. Akeng mih arah kowi Israeluüa cham süt mih khin khe narik lawt kown takla mih dow Juda thumchakuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reuben thumchak: Reuben, Simiawn hai Gad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10-11" />“Taklowp taklangra te mrawkphak prakowi dow Reuben thumchak nakhup tangbung kown. Reuben krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Sedeur kowh chapa Elizur chekhai. Reuben krungchakuüa maru iun dow 46,500 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12-13" />“Reuben krungchakuüa papra kowi dow Simiawn krungchakuüa nakhup tangbung kown. Simiawn krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Zurisadai kowh chapa Selumiel chekhai. Simiawn krungchakuüa maru iun dow 59,300 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14-15" />“Now Reuben krungchakuüa akeng prakowi dow Gad krungchakuüa nakhup tangbung kown. Gad krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Deuel kowh chapa Eliasaf chekhai. Gad krungchakuüa maru iun dow 45,650 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />“Reuben thumchak kowi kowh maru iun mut dow 151,450 ia chekhai. Akeng mih arah kowi cham süt mih khin khe Reuben thumchakuüa dow Juda thumchakuüa kung kowi nakrawi lawt kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leviuüa thumchak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />“Reuben thumchakuüa kung kowi dow kawtla taklowp taklangra te now Leviuüa nakrawi lawt kown. Israeluüa dow amatni khup tangbung khe kowh taken iawng akeng mih arah kowi cham süt kownkow lawt khe paw alowk kung kowi alowk nataken kown takla. Now amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowh tamkhuown paw napawla büah kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efraim thumchak: Efraim, Manase hai Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18-19" />“Taklowp taklangra te satkup prakowi dow Efraim thumchak nakhup tangbung kown. Efraim krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Amihud kowh chapa Elisama chekhai. Efraim krungchakuüa maru iun dow 40,500 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20-21" />“Efraim krungchakuüa papra kowi dow Manase krungchakuüa nakhup tangbung kown. Manase krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Pedazur kowh chapa Gamaliel chekhai. Manase krungchakuüa maru iun dow 32,200 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22-23" />“Now Efraim krungchakuüa akeng prakowi dow Benjamin krungchakuüa nakhup tangbung kown. Benjamin krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Gideawni kowh chapa Abidan chekhai. Benjamin krungchakuüa maru iun dow 35,400 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />“Efraim thumchak kowi kowh maru iun mut dow 108,100 ia chekhai. Akeng mih arah kowi cham süt mih khin khe Efraim thumchakuüa dow Levi thumchakuüa kung kowi nakrawi lawt kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dan thumchak: Dan, Aser hai Naptali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25-26" />“Taklowp taklangra te tawngphak prakowi dow Dan thumchak nakhup tangbung kown. Dan krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Amisadai kowh chapa Ahizer chekhai. Dan krungchakuüa maru iun dow 62,700 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27-28" />“Dan krungchakuüa papra kowi dow Aser krungchakuüa nakhup tangbung kown. Aser krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Okran kowh chapa Pakiel chekhai. Aser krungchakuüa maru iun dow 41,500 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:27-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29-30" />“Dan krungchakuüa akeng prakowi dow Naptali krungchakuüa nakhup tangbung kown. Naptali krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Enan kowh chapa Ahira chekhai. Naptali krungchakuüa maru iun dow 53,400 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />“Dan thumchak kowi kowh maru iun mut dow 157,600 ia chekhai. Akeng mih arah kowi cham süt mih khin khe Dan thumchakuüa dow achur kowi nata lawt kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Naiawngün dow Israel krungchakuüa chekhai; amatni kowi dow krungchak taken iawng rüaah mih chekhai. Bowkbowk thumchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 603,550 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng Israeluüa kowi rüaah mih khin khe Levi krungchakuüa kowi dow rüala dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih rowprowp Israeluüa mih chang khai bowt. Amatni dow amatni chowlowkkow thumchak re-e khup tangbung khai, now akeng mih arah kowi cham süt kownkow lawt mih khin khe paw amatni krungchak hai kimchak taken iawng lawt büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Arawn kowh chapauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Mami laiklow Sinai hungh kowi Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih khin khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowh kimchakuüa dow maiawng chekhai: <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2-3" />Arawn kowh chapauüa dow Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar hai Ithamar büah chekhai. Amatni tali ia kowi lang ta mih dow Nadab chekhai. Amatni kowi dow ap pe <char style="w">uamow</char> rah khowk chowdiah. <verse eid="NUM 3:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Nachenganchepaw Nadab hai Abihu iüah dow Sinai hungh uowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi reng tak khe CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng nadowi kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi awr towk maikhük iüah khe kowng khai. Amatchi kowh chauüa uowi dowi rakowi Arawn sing uowi reng tak khe ta chang uamow lup mih dow Eleazar hai Ithamar iüah chowtaih.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi krungchakuüa kowh lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />“Levi krungchakuüa kowi hawah now Arawn tut-e ap pe diah. Amatni dow Arawn kowi pacham tawi khowngah lah. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Amatni dow Israeluüa pachenma vüi taklowp taklangra te kowi Arawn nimkrüa kowi nachang lup kown. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Israel pachenma vüi kowi taklowp taklangra te naming nakhet kown mih hai nakowi kowh lup maten nachang kown mih dow amatni chowtaih. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Leviuüa maten kowi dow Arawn hai achapauüa rut kowi ap-ah diah. Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia Arawn hai achapauüa kowi nakhowngah lup chang kown mih dow amatni chowtaih. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Nachang uamow lup kownkow Arawn hai achapauüa kowi dow ap pe arah diah. Amatni klen kowi taklowp taklangra te re-e tawi tatawn miuüa kowi dow nakowngta kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12-13" />“Aigupta prenchakuüa kowh chapa ta maten kowi ang saita pe mih khin khe Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh chapa ta maten hai tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala maten dow ang matia vüi ang towah khai. Amatni dow ang matia kowh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh chapa ta maten takcha Leviuüa kowi ang pawta mih chowbowt. Leviuüa dow ang matia kowh towbowt. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 3:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi krungchakuüa kowi rüaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Sinai hungh uowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />“Leviuüa kowi dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchak hai kimchak iawng akra akrachow rüaah diah. Amatni kowi dow palachow chih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa maten kowi rüaah diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Now Mosi mih CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Leviuüa kowi rüaah khai.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Levi kowh chapauüa dow Gersawn, Kohat hai Merari büah chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Gersawn kowh chapa Libni hai Simei iüah pre ia dow amatchi chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Kohat kowh chapa Amram, Izhar, Hebrawn hai Uziel büah tali ia dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Merari kowh chapa Mali hai Musi iüah pre ia paw amatchi chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gersawn krungchakuüa kowh maru iun hai lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Libniuüa hai Simeiuüa kowi prekah cheah miia dow Gersawn chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Gersawn krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh palachow chih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa nget dow bowkbowk kowi 7,500 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23-24" />Gersawn krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Lael kowh chapa Eliasaf chekhai. Gersawn krungchakuüa kowi dow taklowp taklangra te satkup prakowi pe khupah tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 3:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Amatni kowh lup dow taklowp taklangra te, taklowp taklangra te luk müa rua pawi hown kowh kawngah mih uan, nami luk kowi kowh lüpah mih uan pre theng, taklowp taklangra te plawt uaniang, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />taklowp taklangra te viadawng ping müa uaniang, viadawng plawt kowi kowh uaniang, taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh leng maten mingkhet mih chekhai. Amatni kowh lup dow naiawngün uanh hown taklowp taklangra te nacham plan thawp iawk kown, now apiak khe paw amatni napiak iawk kown.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kohat krungchakuüa kowh maru iun hai lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Amramuüa, Izharuüa, Hebrawnuüa hai Uzieluüa kowi prekah cheah miia dow Kohat chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28-30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28-30" />Kohat krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh palachow chih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa nget dow bowkbowk kowi 8,600 ia chekhai. Kohat krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Uziel kowh chapa Elizafan chekhai. Kohat krungchakuüa kowi dow taklowp taklangra te mrawkphak prakowi pe khupah tangbung khai. Amatni kowh lup dow taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih naming nakhet kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:28-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Amatni dow <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm</char> tawkpla, pawitang, <char style="w">maibu towngh</char>, phuchuara, taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih kowi kowh tawngah kengah mih uanh hai Lang Chimsai mih Arah kra müa uaniang naming nakhet kown. Amatni kowh lup dow naiawngün uanh mih taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh atowk rah kowi nakrawi tow kown mih chekhai, now cham süt khe paw amatni nacham plan pawla kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Leviuüa kowh lang kri mih aluchow dow uamow Arawn kowh chapa Eleazar chekhai. Taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih mingkhet miuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Eleazar luk kowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Merari krungchakuüa kowh maru iun hai lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Maliuüa hai Musiuüa kowi prekah cheah miia dow Merari chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Merari krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh palachow chih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa nget dow bowkbowk kowi 6,200 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Merari krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Abihail kowh chapa Zuriel chekhai. Amatni kowi dow taklowp taklangra te tawngphak prakowi pe khupah tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Amatni dow taklowp taklangra te ping müa phen, akep müa lawng, achüng, akhawk rup rah hai akeng mih uanh ün, <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />viadawng ping müa kowi kowh <char style="w">achüng</char> hai akhawk rup rah ün, viadawng uaniang tük müa chung hai aleng ün naming nakhet kown. Amatni kowh lup dow naiawngün uanh hown taklowp taklangra te nacham plan thawp iawk kown, now apiak khe paw amatni napiak iawk kown.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Taklowp taklangra te satlawt prakowi dow Mosi, Arawn hai Arawn kowh chapauüa kowi pe khupah tangbung khai. Amatni kowh lup dow Israel chen pachenma vüi taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh lup chang maten nakruitown kown mih chekhai. Amatni klen kowi taklowp taklangra te re-e tawi tatawn miuüa kowi dow nakowngta kown mih laiklow uowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Leviuüa kowi dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowi akra akrachow Mosi hai Arawn iüah rüaah khai. Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh palachow chih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa nget dow bowkbowk kowi 22,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapa ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh uang rik dia mih kachakuüa chah nget kowi rüaah diah. Amatni kowi dow palachow chih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa nget kowi tang pe ming diah. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Israel chen pachenma kowh chapa ta takcha Leviuüa dow ang kowh pahai nadowkah kown, now Israeluüa kowh tawncher kowi rik pen mih ala maten takcha Leviuüa kowh tawncher maten ang kowh pahai nadowkah kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Now CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh uang rik dia mih kachakuüa nget kowi Mosi rüaah khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Uang rik dia mih kachakuüa nget kowi palachow chih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa nget kowi dow tang pe ming khai. Tang pe ming mih maru iun dow bowkbowk kowi 22,273 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />“Israel chen pachenma kowh chapa ta takcha Leviuüa dow ang kowh pahai nadowkah kown, now Israeluüa kowh tawncher kowi rik pen mih ala maten takcha Leviuüa kowh tawncher maten ang kowh pahai nadowkah kown. Leviuüa dow ang kowh naown kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46-47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46-47" />Leviuüa kowh maru iun lak-e Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh chapa tauüa lang chüt 273 ia chekhai. Naiawng rakowi chüt miuüa maten kowi naklanta kownkow lowk ia kowi tai tanga iun chi en napaw pe kown. (Tai paiun kowi dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khai now hamüt gram chi chekhai). <verse eid="NUM 3:46-47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />Naiawngün klanla maru mih tai maten dow Arawn hai achapauüa rut kowi en napeah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Naiawng rakowi Leviuüa hown klanah kung kowi kowh ta lat mih Israeluüa kowh chapa ta maten kowi dow taklan müa tai Mosi paw pe khai. <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />Aia dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh chapa ta taklan müa tai nget 1,365 iun ka khai. (Tai paiun kowi dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khai now hamüt gram chi chekhai). <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Mosi mih taklan miuüa kowh tai Arawn hai achapauüa kowi peah khai.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Kohat krungchakuüa kowh lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />“Levi chenchap pungmadawng kowi Kohat kowh krungchak hai kimchak kowi rüaah iüa diah. <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi nachang lup kownkow amatni kowi mih 30 ning hownia 50 ning mowr mih kachakuüa kowi enchi narüaah kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />“Amatni kowh lup dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh lang chimsai mih uanh naming nakhet kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Akeng mih arah kowi cham süt kownkow Israeluüa piak tangbung kown mih khin khe Arawn hai achapauüa mih taklowp taklangra te lak kowi nakowkup kown. Now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla re-e kowh iangah mih uaniang nalutta hanow nami uaniang hown namumla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla büah kown. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Nami uaniang luk kowi dow chak pik aiungma mih hown naplan mumah palüp büah kown. Nami chak pik luk kowi paw aruama mih uan hown naplan mumah palüp iawk kown. Now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawtlawng dow akli kowi nasowrah büah kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />“Chimsaima mih kawm towk rah <char style="w">pawitang</char> dow aruama mih uan hown namumah büah kown. Nami uan luk kowi dow bia, biatum hai lawngpan ün natow pe büah kown, now khamah mih <char style="w">uanap</char> chang müa kowi kowh tuikawng paw natow pe kown. Nami klen kowi pawitang luk kowi kowh aiawng uowi mih chimsaima mih kawm paw nauowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Naiawngün uanh luk kowi dow aringma mih uan naplan mum pe kown. Nami uan luk kowi paw chak pik aiungma mih hown naplan mumah palüp iawk kown. Now pawitang kawtlawng dow akli kowi nasowrah kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />“Maibu towngh hai maibu ün, bawthi kep müa kaingkep hai maidim towk rah lawngpan, now sau towk müa puh dow aruama mih uan hown amatni namumah kown. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Naiawngün uanh luk kowi dow chak pik aiungma mih hown naplan mumah palüp iawk kown. Now naiawngün dow akrowng müa phen luk kowi natowah kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />“Kuh hown kowh <char style="w">phuchuara</char> luk kowi dow aruama mih uan hown namumah kown. Nami uan luk kowi paw chak pik aiungma mih hown naplan mumah palüp iawk kown. Now phuchuara kawtlawng dow akli kowi nasowrah kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />“Taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih kowi kowh tawngah kengah mih akeng mih uanh maten dow aruama mih uan hown amatni namumah kown. Nami uan luk kowi paw chak pik aiungma mih hown naplan mumah palüp iawk kown. Now naiawngün dow akrowng müa phen luk kowi natowah kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />“Kri hown kowh phuchuara luk kowi kowh plawi maten dow nakuakta büah kown. Now nami phuchuara luk kowi dow arikma mih uan namum pe kown. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Nami uan luk kowi dow chang phuchua khe kowh tawngah mih puh bia aikam, maih chang müa puh, chaknga khowng müa chuk, kep hai tawncher vi towk müa biatum ün natowah kown. Naiawngün luk kowi dow chak pik aiungma mih hown namumah kown. Now phuchuara kawtlawng dow akli kowi nasowrah kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />“Akeng mih arah kowi cham süt kownkow Israeluüa piakta tangbung mih khin khe Arawn hai achapauüa ki mumta mih chimsaima mih uanh hai taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh tawngkengah mih uanh nauang kawt kownkow Kohat krungchakuüa dow taklowp taklangra te kowi nauang kown. Taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh uowi mih uanh maten dow Kohat krungchakuüa nakawtla kown. Tawkchedow naiawngün chimsaima mih uanh kowi nakak büah kown nadowi. Amatni che kak khai hanow amatni dow nakowng kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />“Uamow Arawn kowh chapa Eleazar luk kowi dow taklowp taklangra te hai alak kowi kowh uanh maten naming nakhet kown mih kurdik nauowi kown. Aia dow maibu towk müa sau ün, anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than, atungma changah mih kawmdi uanap hai <char style="w">nümnap</char> müa sau naming nakhet kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Nami kung kowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18-20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18-20" />“Arawn hai achapauüa mih lang chim lang sai mih uanh ki mumta dowi mowr dow achimsaima mih uanh re-e Kohat krungchakuüa naia kowi kown nadowi, now mü paw kownowng mü kown nadowi. Amatni che kowkak hai kowmü khai hanow nakowng büah kown. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow Arawn hai achapauüa mih taklowp taklangra te kowi nakowpawla kown, now tawng mih chow nakawtla kown mih amatni kowi nakhowm nabowk pe büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 4:18-20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gersawn krungchakuüa kowh lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />“Levi chenchap pungmadawng kowi Gersawn kowh krungchak hai kimchak kowi rüaah diah. <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi nachang lup kownkow amatni kowi dow 30 ning hownia 50 ning mowr mih kachakuüa kowi enchi narüaah kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24-25" />“Amatni nakawtla kown mih uanh dow taklowp taklangra te luk müa adipükchow mih uan, nami uan luk kowi kowh lüpah mih rua pawi hown kawngah mih uan, rua pawi hown kowh kawngah mih uan luk kowi kowh lüpah mih ruapur pik, chak pik aiungma mih hai taklowp taklangra te plawt kowi kowh uaniang ün chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 4:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />Nami klen kowi taklowp taklangra te hai phuchuara tavir lut pingla viadawng mih uaniang ün, viadawng plawt kowi kowh uaniang ün, taklowp taklangra te tük müa leng ün, now taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh tawngah kengah mih uanh srui paw amatni nakawtla kown takla. Taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akawt takla mih uanh maten dow Gersawn krungchakuüa nakawtla kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Amatni dow Arawn hai achapauüa tek iawng nachang kown. Nami dow akawt takla mih lup chepaw, akeng mih lup chepaw amatni nachang kown takla. Amatni nakawtla kown mih lup bak maten dow Gersawn krungchakuüa kowi Arawn hai achapauüa natek pe kown. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Naiawngün dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh Gersawn krungchakuüa nachangah kown mih lup chekhai. Nami maru-uüa kowh lup naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow uamow Arawn kowh chapa Ithamar luk kowi nauowi kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Merari krungchakuüa kowh lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />“Levi chenchap pungmadawng kowi Merari kowh krungchak hai kimchak kowi rüaah diah. <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi nachang lup kownkow amatni kowi dow 30 ning hownia 50 ning mowr mih kachakuüa kowi enchi narüaah kown.<verse eid="NUM 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />“Amatni nakawtla kown mih dow taklowp taklangra te ping müa phen ün, akep müa lawng ün, achüng hai akhawk rup rah ün chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />Nami klen kowi taklowp taklangra te viadawng kowi kowh achüng hailawm akhawk rup rah ün, taklowp taklangra te tükra chung ün, pingla viadawng mih uaniang tük müa leng hai lakke mih uanh srui paw amatni nakawtla kown takla. Now tawng mih uanh chow nakawtla kown mih amatni lowkkowlowk kowi Arawn hai achapauüa nakhowm nabowk pe kown. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Naiawngün dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh Merari krungchakuüa nachangah kown mih lup chekhai. Nami maru-uüa kowh lup naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow uamow Arawn kowh chapa Ithamar luk kowi nauowi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi chenchap kowh maru iun mut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Mosi, Arawn hai Israel aluchowuüa dow Kohat krungchakuüa kowi amatni kowh krungchak hai kimchak taken iawng rüaah büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35-36" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi nachang lup kownkow Kohat krungchakuüa kowi dow 30 ning hownia 50 ning mowr mih kachakuüa kowi rüaah khai bowt. Naiawngün maru iun dow 2,750 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 4:35-36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Naiawngün dow Kohat krungchakuüa kowh maru iun mut chekhai. Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih iawng Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow amatni kowi rüaah khai.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Gersawn krungchakuüa kowi paw amatni kowh krungchak hai kimchak taken iawng rüaah khai. <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39-40" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi nachang lup kownkow Gersawn krungchakuüa kowi rüaah büah khai. Tawkchedow 30 ning hownia 50 ning mowr mih kowi kowh ming tang uowi khowk miuüa kowi chowtaih rüaah büah khai. Naiawngün maru iun dow 2,630 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 4:39-40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Naiawngün dow Gersawn krungchakuüa kowh maru iun mut chekhai. Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih iawng Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow amatni kowi rüaah khai.<verse eid="NUM 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Merari krungchakuüa kowi paw amatni kowh krungchak hai kimchak taken iawng rüaah khai. <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43-44" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi nauang chang lup kownkow 30 ning hownia 50 ning mowr mih Gersawn krungchakuüa hownia uang mih kachakuüa kowi dow rüaah khai. Naiawngün maru iun dow 3,200 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 4:43-44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Naiawngün dow Merari krungchakuüa kowh maru iun mut chekhai. Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih iawng Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow amatni kowi rüaah khai.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Naiawng hai Levi krungchakuüa kowi mih amatni kowh krungchak hai kimchak taken iawng Mosi, Arawn hai Israel aluchowuüa rüaah khai. <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi nauang chang lup kownkow hai nakawtla uanh kownkow 30 ning hownia 50 ning mowr mih uang mih kachakuüa maten kowi dow rüaah khai. <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />Naiawngün maru iun dow bowkbowk kowi 8,580 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih iawng tawng lup ngai chow chang takla mih hai kawt takla mih amatni lowkkowlowk kowi khowm pe bowk pe khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 4:49">Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih iawng Levi krungchakuüa kowi mih rüaah büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s">Asür alawkma miuüa kowi lang lawtta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />“Mami ang kowh ana pek Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Asür alawkma mih maru maten kowi dow tangbung khup rah uat kowi nalawtta kown takla. Pik rawka ngak phaw mih kowi, khampha uanh tui towk mih kowi, cham kakta uak kowh tasür talawk mih kowi dow tangbung khup rah uat kowi enni nacham towah kown. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Masiuüa chepaw, kachakuüa chepaw tasür talawk mih kowi dow tangbung khup rah uat kowi nalawtta kown takla. Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi ang tawi uowi reng rakowi tasür talawk mih maru kowi dow tangbung khup rah uat kowi enni nacham towah kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih asür alawkma mih maru maten kowi tangbung khup rah uat kowi cham lawtta khai bowt. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana iawng chang büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Changta angak khe kowh naiaw kown mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6-7" />“Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Masiuüa chepaw, kachakuüa chepaw CHAKRAMANG ana pek chün dowi kowi lowkkowlowk luk kowi changta angak khai hanow chang angak mih maru nataphuang ngengche kown takla. Now ari kowi uowi iawng aia changah angak mih maru tut-e aia naiaw kown takla. Nami klen kowi ari uowi mih kowi changah tanga bak now pabak sung aia nachüt pela kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 5:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Napaw aiawk kownkow aia changah angak mih maru kowh che aia hai aia kowh tasin taken mih miapaw uowi dowi hanow nami iawk tangka dow CHAKRAMANG kowh nachowng kown; nami tangka dow uamow kowi aia napeah kown. Nami klen kowi aia kowh angak nalawtta pe kownkow angak lawt lük müa ruapurla paw uamow tut-e aia nauang pawla papum kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Uamow tut-e kowh Israeluüa uang pawla mih chimsaima mih uanh maten dow uamow kowh nachowng kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Uamow rut kowi kowh uang apta khowk mih uanh srui dow uamow kowh chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masi chang iang khe kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11-15" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Laiuan kowi, masi chang iang khai. Tawkche ka khümah dowi, saksi paw uowi dowi kowh chalow hanow amasi kowi uamow tut-e ahua nakowpawla kown. Nami klen kowi iakmow hown kowh thawpah mih kawmdi paw aia napawla aset hown 400 gram kown takla. Nami kawmdi kowi dow kanrawn sau hai anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa <char style="w">than</char> nathe pe kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow khowrbown uanap chekhai. Nahanow amasi chang iang mih chang iang dowi mih natuk kown towbowt.<verse eid="NUM 5:11-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />“Nami masiuüa kowi dow uamow napawla hanow phuchuara ria kowi nape iowngah kown. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Now uamow nauang pawla pe chimsaima mih tui hanow bawn hown kowh bia kowi natowah kown, now taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih lak kowi kowh dinchow napawah ditchow now nami bia kowi kowh tui kowi napruiah kown. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18-22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18-22" />Nami kung kowi dow nami masiuüa kowh sam uamow naiiata pe kown, now nami masiuüa rut kowi naap pe khowrbown uanap kown. Now natek pe kown mih, ‘En che chang iawt chang iang dowi hanow mami tui khak kham chepaw tawngpaw en naown kown nadowi. Tawkchedow en che chang iawt chang iang khai hanow mami tui khak khamta now CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh <char style="w">piati</char> en pacham kaah; en kowh mu pacham taphawah, now en kowh siri kowng hanow chah mih hang pacham kaah. Now maru cham tape piati towng pacham rükla en ming lah,’ napape kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 5:18-22">“Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa natek kown mih, ‘Ang che chang iawt chang iang khai hanow en tek iawng ang luk kowi pacham phawah,’ napa kown.<verse eid="NUM 5:18-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />“Now nami piati laiklow dow chak pik kowi uamow naruiah now tui khak kowi nasauah kown. <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24-26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24-26" />Now nami masiuüa rut kowi kowh khowrbown uanap dow uamow napawah now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nakrowngah kown, now phuchuara re-e nakowpawla kown. Now nami khowrbown uanap hownia nachawmah pachawm now phuchuara luk kowi uamow natikah kown. Nami kung kowi dow nami masiuüa kowi nami tui khak uamow nape khamah kown. <verse eid="NUM 5:24-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Nami masiuüa che chang iawt chang iang khai hanow nami tui khamta hown krowksang mu nataphaw kown, now aia kowh siri paw nakowng kown towbowt. Now maru cham tape piati towng paw nami masiuüa kowh ming narükla kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Nachenganchepaw aia che chang iawt chang iang dowi hanow nami tui kham chepaw tawngpaw naown kown nadowi. Aia dow naia ka chah reng kown taih.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29-30" />“Mami dow takhowr tabown khe kowh rirow chekhai. Laiuan kowi, amasi chang iang naown padow ahua ka tuak khai. Tawkche ka khümah dowi, saksi paw uowi dowi. Nakhowk khe amasi luk kowi mami rirow kowi uowi iawng ahua nachang pe kown: Owm masi dowi kowh chalow now amasi kowi uamow tut-e ahua nakowpawla kown. Now mami rirow iawng nami masiuüa luk kowi uamow nachang pe kown. <verse eid="NUM 5:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Amasi chang iang dowi kowi naiawng ahua changah chepaw ahua dow naka <char style="w">ripra</char> kown nadowi. Tawkche amasi che chang iang khai nowm hanow aia mih naka ripra kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">Chowng Nazaret kown mih laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />“Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Masiuüa chepaw, kachakuüa chepaw CHAKRAMANG vüi tape kownkow chowng <char style="w">Nazaret</char> kown mih enni che takham khai hanow <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />takham mih maru dow arak lah, grep tui lah naia kham kown nadowi. Naiawng mih maru dow arak hai grep tui hown kowh thawpah mih tui sur paw naia kham kown nadowi. Nami klen kowi grep uih sing hai grep uih keu paw naiung cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />CHAKRAMANG vüi tape kownkow chowng Nazaret mowr dow grep uih hown kowh thawpah mih tawng chap paw naiung cha kown nadowi; grep uih pia hai anuk khowm padow naiung cha kown nadowi.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />“Nazaret maru-uüa kowh sam dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi chimsaima chekhai. Naiawng rakowi chowng Nazaret mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG vüi aia tape mowr mih naia khai sam kown nadowi, now kep paw naia kep kown nadowi. CHAKRAMANG vüi tape mowr dow aia mih narai sam kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />“Now aia tape mowr dow uak uowi rah re-e paw tawi ia tatawn kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />Aia kowh lu kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tape pami amat müa sam uowi khai. Naiawng rakowi u-pa, tainau-uüa hai tuamowuüa kowng khe paw aia dow natawi ia tasür talawk kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Naiawng hai aia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tape mowr mih chimsaima nauowi kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />“Mingmang dowi khe aia pur kowi maru kowng khai hanow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh aia raiah mih sam natasür natalawk kown. Nahanow ranit ni mowr asür alawkma hai aia nauowi kown takla. Nami ranit ni mih ni kowi aia tachim tasai khe aia kowh sam dow nakhaita kown. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Now raiat ni mih ni khe dow kimtawn uatur chepaw, kaurawng uatur chepaw aia napawla pachum hanow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e uamow tut-e nakowkowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Kaurawng uatur chepaw, kimtawn uatur chepaw lowk mih hown dow uamow nachangla angak lawt lük müa uanap kown, now alowk mih hown dow tikah mih uanap nachangla kown. Nami dow uak uowi rah re-e uowi kowh aia tasür talawk rakowi aia kowh sürlawk mih nakhu pe kownkow chekhai. Nami ni hownia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi asar hown aia naplan rai sam iawk kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />Nakhowk khe paw aia rik takham khe kowh iawng CHAKRAMANG vüi tape kown mih laikham natakham iawk kown takla. Nami klen kowi nachangla <char style="w">aprek</char> sung uanap kownkow paningchow mih ruapurla chah nauang pawla papum kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia rik takhamta mih kowi dow aia sürlawkta khai bowt rakowi CHAKRAMANG vüi aia rik tape mih ni maten tabat khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />“CHAKRAMANG vüi tape kownkow chowng Nazaret mih khin chur khowk hanow maiawng nachang pawi kown takla: Aia dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e nakowkowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />Nakowi aia kowkowi mih khin khe paningchow mih ruapurla chah apum, paningchow mih ruapur iia apum hai ruapurla apum nakowpawla kown takla. Naiawngün ruapur kowi dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. Ruapurla powrchow hown dow nachangla tikah mih uanap kown, ruapur iia hown dow nachangla angak lawt lük müa uanap kown, now ruapurla hown dow taking tasangra uanap nachangla kown. <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />Nami klen kowi paw kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap kowi kowh uanh nauang pawla kown, now the pe <char style="w">tuah</char> dowi mih kawm paw nauang pawla akharang kown takla. Nami kharang kowi dow kawmdi lang iung mih hown kowh thawpah mih kawm nauowi pre chap kown takla. Pachap mih dow atatma panow lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawm naown kown, now pachap mih dow apalachow panow plik pe kanrawn sau mih kawm naown kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />Naiawngün uanap srui dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow nakowtowah kown takla. Now angak lawt lük müa uanap hai tikah mih uanap aia nachang kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Now taking tasangra uanap chang müa kowi kowh ruapurla dow nangenah hanow aia nachangla phuchua kown. Nami khin khe the pe tuah dowi mih kawm, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap paw naphuchuala kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />Nami kung kowi dow nami chowng Nazaret mih maru kowh sam CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh raiah mih dow nakhaita pe kown. Nami sam dow taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh maih kowi nanawmta kown. <verse eid="NUM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh raiah mih sam ki khaita kung kowi dow ruapurla pang nga butia, kharang kowi kowh the pe tuah dowi mih kawm hai apalachow ngaiah mih kawm apah chi nami chowng Nazaret mih maru rut kowi uamow naap pe kown. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün uanh mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi amülüngma mih uanap uamow nachangla kown. Naiawngün uanh dow chimsaima chekhai, naiawngün dow uamow kowh kakbak naown kown. Nami klen kowi amülüngma mih uanap kowi kowh sakowuh hai apah mih athung paw uamow kowh kakbak naown kown. Naiawngün ki changta prowng kung kowi dow nami chowng Nazaret mih maru naia kham grep tui kown towbowt.<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />“Naiawngün dow chowng Nazaret mih maru-uüa kowh rirow chekhai. CHAKRAMANG vüi tape kownkow takham mih maru dow nami rirow kowi uowi iawng nachang uanap pawi kown takla. Nami klen kowi aia ia pe mowr nape kown mih aia takham khai hanow nami uanh paw aia nape kown takla. CHAKRAMANG vüi nape kownkow aia takhamta mih dow rirow kowi uowi iawng nape bowk kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa natekah kown mih prasi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />“Arawn hai achapauüa kowi mami laiklow kowtek pe diah. Amatni mih maiawng Israeluüa kowi pacham peah prasi lah:<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />‘CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe en prasi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:24">aia dow pacham mingkhet en lah;<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />CHAKRAMANG dow pacham sakrau en lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:25">aia dow pacham saksing sana en lah.<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe en iungra lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:26">aia dow pacham pe en thaulangra lah’ napape kown.<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />“ uamowuüa mih ang ming hown Israeluüa kowi napeah prasi kown, nahanow ang matia ngengche Israeluüa kowi napeah prasi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te uow pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Taklowp taklangra te ki khup mih ni khe dow taklowp taklangra te mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e Mosi ap-ah khai. Aia dow taklowp taklangra te hai alak kowi kowh uanh maten kowi klai pe nümnap müa sau hanow chimsaiah khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Nami kung kowi Israel chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow CHAKRAMANG vüi uang pawla <char style="w">awmrawm sung</char> khai. Naiawngün aluchowuüa kowh kurdik dow rüata khowk mih maru-uüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />Amatni dow lowk ia kowi chiala apum chi, now pre ia kowi aluk uowi mih chia kari lowk chi uang pawla khai. Amatni uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow bowkbowk kowi chiala laipre pum, now aluk uowi mih chia kari taruk klüng chekhai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung maten dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uang towah büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leviuüa kowi bak pe awmrawm sung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />“Aluchowuüa uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow taklowp taklangra te hai nami lak kowi kowh uanh pawk müa naia tawngkengah kownkow hawt paw pe diah. Naiawngün uanh dow Levi krungchakuüa kowi amatni kowh lup bak uowi iawng ret pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Naiawng rakowi Mosi dow naiawngün chia kari hai chiala mih Leviuüa kowi ret pe khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Aia dow Gersawn krungchakuüa kowi amatni kowh lup bak uowi iawng nachangla lup kownkow chia kari pre buk hai chiala tali pum peah khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />Now Merari krungchakuüa kowi paw amatni kowh lup bak uowi iawng nachangla lup kownkow chia kari tali klüng hai chiala raiat pum Mosi peah khai. Gersawn hai Merari krungchakuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow uamow Arawn kowh chapa Ithamar luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Nachenganchepaw Kohat krungchakuüa kowi dow tawngpaw Mosi pela dowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Kohat krungchakuüa kowh kurdik dow chimsaima mih uanh naming nakhet kown mih chekhai; chimsaima mih uanh dow pangkawt hown kowh kawtah kown mih chaing chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10-11" />Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang vüi kowi naapla phuchuara kownkow ni towng aluchow lowk ia chi pauang pawla awmrawm sung lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 7:10-11">Naiawng rakowi klai pe nümnap müa sau hanow ap phuchuara mih ni hownia dow aluchowuüa mih uang pawla awmrawm sung büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 7:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Auown ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Juda krungchak aluchow Aminadab kowh chapa Nasawn chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa dow chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum aia uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa dow aia uang pawla ruala papum khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />Nami klen kowi taking tasangra uanap chang müa dow chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Aminadab kowh chapa Nasawn uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isakar krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Pre ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Isakar krungchak aluchow Zuar kowh chapa Nethanel chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum aia uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Zuar kowh chapa Nethanel uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zebulun krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Sum ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Zebulun krungchak aluchow Helawn kowh chapa Eliab chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum aia uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Helawn kowh chapa Eliab uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reuben krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Tali ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Reuben krungchak aluchow Sedeur kowh chapa Elizur chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum aia uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Sedeur kowh chapa Elizur uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simiawn krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Tanga ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Simiawn krungchak aluchow Zurisadai kowh chapa Selumiel chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum aia uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Zurisadai kowh chapa Selumiel uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gad krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Taruk ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Gad krungchak aluchow Deuel kowh chapa Eliasaf chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum aia uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum; <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Deuel kowh chapa Eliasaf uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efraim krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Ranit ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Efraim krungchak aluchow Amihud kowh chapa Elisama chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Amihud kowh chapa Elisama uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manase krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Raiat ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Manase krungchak aluchow Pedazur kowh chapa Gamaliel chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum aia uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Pedazur kowh chapa Gamaliel uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Taku ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Benjamin krungchak aluchow Gidiawni kowh chapa Abidan chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum aia uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Gidiawni kowh chapa Abidan uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dan krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Hamüt ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Dan krungchak aluchow Amisadai kowh chapa Ahizer chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Amisadai kowh chapa Ahizer uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aser krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Lailowk ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Aser krungchak aluchow Okran kowh chapa Pakiel chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum aia uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Okran kowh chapa Pakiel uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naptali krungchakuüa kowh awmrawm sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Laipre ni khe kowh uang pawla awmrawm sung mih dow Naptali krungchak aluchow Enan kowh chapa Ahira chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />Aia uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai bia lowk, tai lawngpan lowk chekhai. Nami bia dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now adik aset hown 470 gram, now tai lawngpan dow 790 gram ngia chekhai. Nami bia hai lawngpan kowi dow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi atekma kangowh chekhai. Nami kanrawn sau lawkia kawmdi dow nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />Nami klen kowi adik 100 gram ngia mih kuh lawngpan chah paw uang pawla lowk chekhai. Nami lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than tek mawp chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala papum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah papum uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa ruala papum, <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />taking tasangra uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla tanga pum, ruala tanga pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah tanga pum uang pawla khai. Naiawngün awmrawm sung dow Enan kowh chapa Ahira uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aluchowuüa uang pawla mih awmrawm sung mut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84-88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84-88" />Klai pe nümnap müa sau hanow ap phuchuara mih auown ni hownia achur ni mowr aluchowuüa uang pawla mih awmrawm sung dow tai lawngpan lowk kowi adik aset hown 470 gram chi mih laipre buk. Bowkbowk kowi adik lairaiat set ngia chekhai. Tai bia lowk kowi adik 790 gram chi mih laipre buk. Bowkbowk kowi adik taku set hown 600 gram chekhai. Kuh hown kowh lawngpan chah lowk kowi adik 100 gram ngia chi mih laipre buk. Bowkbowk kowi aset hown 200 gram ngia chekhai. Naiawngün kuh lawngpan chah kowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than atekma kangowh chekhai. Tikah mih uanap chang müa kowi kowh pe mih dow Chiala, ruapurla hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah laipre pum chi chekhai. Naiawngün hown dow kawmdi uanap paw uang pawla büah khai. Angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh pe mih dow ruala laipre pum chekhai. Taking tasangra uanap chang müa kowi kowh pe mih dow Chiala 24 pum, ruapurla 60 pum, ruala 60 pum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah 60 pum chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:84-88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Nami kung kowi dow Mosi mih CHAKRAMANG hown nataklang kownkow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowkup khai. Nami khin khe sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm luk kowi kowh <char style="w">Cherup</char> pre buk mih takra hownia dow CHAKRAMANG klow Mosi ta khai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG mih Mosi hown taklang reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Maibu towk krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Mami laiklow Arawn kowi kowtek pe diah: Maibu towng purdowng prakowi nowi bowk iawng maibu towng kowi kowh ranit klüng mih maibu dow natowah kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Nahanow Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng rowprowp Arawn mih chang khai bowt. Aia dow maibu towng purdowng prakowi nowi bowk iawng maibu towng kowi kowh ranit klüng mih maibu dow towah khai. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Maibu towng dow achowm müa hownia achem kowi kowh apau mowr achangma mih kuh akluchow hown kowh phengah now thawpah mih chekhai. Nami maibu towngh dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tüng pe akuh mih iawng rowprowp thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG vüi Leviuüa kowi ap-ah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Akeng mih Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia Leviuüa kowi pawla now lang kraah diah. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Amatni kowi dow maiawng en nasawk nasauah kown: Amatni kowi dow tachim tasai müa tui en nathet pe kown. Nami kung kowi dow pabuk pakowma pawi amatni kowi en nape khaita kown, now en nape chuta dawnguan hanow amatni dow natasawk natasau kown. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Nami kung kowi dow chiala papum hai nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow kawmdi aiungma mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawm nauang pawla büah kown. Now nachangla angak lawt lük müa uanap kown mih chiala paw en nauang pe pawla papum kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />“Nami kung kowi dow taklowp taklangra te re-e Leviuüa kowi en nauang pawla kown, now Israeluüa maten kowi paw nami re-e en nakua nalawmah kown. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Leviuüa kowi dow ang pur kowi en nauang pawla kown, now amatni luk kowi dow Israeluüa natang pe rut kown. <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia kowh amülüngma mih uanap iawng hai Leviuüa kowi dow ang pur kowi Arawn naap-ah kown. Nahanow Leviuüa dow ang kowh lup naia chang kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />Nami kung kowi dow chiala pre pum mih luk kowi Leviuüa natang pe rut kown. Now chiala papum mih hown dow ang tut-e angak lawt lük müa uanap en nachangla pe kown, now alowk mih chiala hown dow tikah mih uanap en nachangla pe kown. Naiawng hai amatni kowh angak dow nalawtta pe kownkow en nachang pe kown. <verse eid="NUM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />Leviuüa kowi dow Arawn hai achapauüa pur kowi en nape iowngah kown, now amatni kowi dow amülüngma mih uanap iawng hai ang tut-e en naap-ah kown. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Naiawng hai akeng mih Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia Leviuüa kowi dow en nalang kraah kown, nahanow amatni dow ang kowh maru nachowng kown towbowt.<verse eid="NUM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />“Naiawng hai chimsaiah hanow amülüngma mih uanap iawng hai ang tut-e ap-ah kung kowi dow Leviuüa mih taklowp taklangra te kowi nauang chang lup bowt kown. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia Leviuüa dow ang kowh chekhai. Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh chapa ta maten takcha Leviuüa kowi dow ang matia vüi ang pawta mih chowbowt. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Aigupta prenchakuüa kowh chapa ta maten kowi ang saita pe mih khin khe Israeluüa kowh chapa ta maten dow ang matia vüi ang lang towah khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowh chapa ta maten hai tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala maten dow ang matia kowh chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow Israeluüa kowh chapa ta maten takcha Leviuüa kowi ang pawta mih chowbowt. <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />Leviuüa kowi dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia Arawn hai achapauüa kowi natawi khowngah kownkow awmrawm sung iawng hai ang peah mih chowbowt. Leviuüa dow taklowp taklangra te kowi Israeluüa takcha nakowchang lup kown, now angak hownia Israeluüa naka alawt kownkow nachang pe lup kown. Nahanow taklowp taklangra te re-e Israeluüa uang tatawn chepaw amatni luk kowi dow phih nauang kla kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Now Leviuüa lawnguan kowi kowh Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih iawng Mosi, Arawn hai Israeluüa maten dow Leviuüa kowi changah khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Leviuüa dow tachim tasai khai bowt, now amatni dow chuta dawnguan khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi amülüngma mih uanap iawng hai amatni kowi Arawn ap-ah khai, now amatni kowh angak dow nalawtta pe kownkow Arawn chang pe lup khai. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih iawng rowprowp Leviuüa kowi changah khai. Nami kung kowi dow taklowp taklangra te kowi Arawn hai achapauüa nimkrüa kowi Leviuüa uown chang lup khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leviuüa kowh lup chang ning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Mami dow Leviuüa nachünah kown mih rirow chekhai: Amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh 25 hownia 50 ning takra kowi kowh kachakuüa chowtaih taklowp taklangra te kowi nauang chang lup kown. <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />Nachenganchepaw 50 ning chih khowk mih maru dow nami lup chang hownia natanai kown takla; amatni dow natawi chang lup kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Nakhowk khe dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh chang lup miuüa kowi natawi ia mingkhet büah kown. Tawkche tawng lup paw natawi ia chang büah kown nadowi bowt. Mami rirow kowi uowi iawng Leviuüa kowi en nakhowm bowk pe lup kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">Takat Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt mih pre ning hown pala khe Sinai hungh uowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Takat Pawi dow khowmta bowkta mih khin kowi Israeluüa pacham sunah lah. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Amatni dow ning towng kowh mami la kowi lacher laitali ni khe sat kup khowk now ari arow kowi uowi mih maten iawng nami pawi nasunah büah kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Nami laiklow tata hanow nachang Takat Pawi kownkow Israeluüa kowi Mosi tek pe khai. <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />Amatni dow ning uown kowi kowh lacher laitali ni khe sat kup khowk now Sinai hungh uowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi nami Takat Pawi sun büah khai. Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih iawng rowprowp Israeluüa dow changta bowk khai.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia maru pre sum ia dow cham kakta uak khai rakowi Takat Pawi tawi ka sun büah dowi. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nami ni kowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah tut-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />Now amatni tek pe Mosi mih, “Cham kakta uak khai rakowi anging dow tasür talawk khai bowt. Naiawng anging tasür talawk khai pache akeng mih Israeluüa hown khowmta bowkta mih khin kowi tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG vüi anging tawi ia phuchua dowi kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Chawng büa diah. Nami lawnguan kowi tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG natek kown mih ang lüntaah tak,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Nakhowk khe Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />“Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Enni hai enni kowh krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi cham kakta uak kowh tasür talawk khai chepaw, khari kowi rah la lai rakowi uang ia mang dowi chepaw CHAKRAMANG vüi Takat Pawi enni naia sun kown taih. <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />Pre la kowi kowh lacher laitali ni khe sat kup khowk now mami Takat Pawi mih enni naia sun kown. Mami Takat Pawi kowi kowh chaknga dow the pe tuah dowi mih kawm hai akhakma mih pram kan hown enni nachaah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Nami chaknga dow rau-e mowr ditchow paw enni naia towah kown nadowi, now ahut paw enni naia klowkah kown nadowi. Takat Pawi sun mih khin khe ari arow kowi uowi mih maten enni nachünah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Tawkche tasür talawk paw tasür talawk dowi, khari alakma kowi paw cham kowi dowi mih maru che Takat Pawi tawi sun dowi hanow nami maru kowi dow aia chen hownia enni nabatta kown takla. Aia dow aia kowh angak sung naka kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow khowmta bowkta mih khin kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi Takat Pawi tawi sun dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />“Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa che CHAKRAMANG vüi Takat Pawi tawi sun kown nau khai hanow ari arow kowi uowi iawng nasunah kown takla. Nami dow Israeluüa chepaw, akeng chenchapuüa chepaw arisang nasunah kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te luk kowi uangnim uowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15-16" />Ki khupta taklowp taklangra te mih ni khe taklowp taklangra te luk kowi dow uangnim uang tamum klum khai. Nami uangnim dow sat kup hownia rau-e mowr chi ni towng taklowp taklangra te luk kowi uang tatüng khai. Iak-e khe dow nami uangnim mih maih iawng uang tatüng khai. <verse eid="NUM 9:15-16" /><verse number="17-19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17-19" />Now taklowp taklangra te hownia uangnim cham süt mih khin khe dow Israeluüa mih tarowng mang khai. Now nami uangnim cham iowng rah re-e dow amatni mih khup tangbung reng chekhai. Naiawng hai amatni dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng mang büah khai, now CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng khup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 9:17-19" /><verse number="20-22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20-22" />Nami uangnim che taklowp taklangra te luk kowi hing uowi hüah hanow pre ni sum ni chepaw, pre la sum la chepaw, paning chepaw uangnim uowi mowr dow nami re-e khup tangbung büa khai; nami hownia amatni dow cham süt dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw nami uangnim che cham süt hanow amatni dow plan tarowng mang khai. <verse eid="NUM 9:20-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng khup tangbung hai mang büah khai. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana chün büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Tai hown kowh thawpah mih baw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Tai hown phengah now thawp <char style="w">baw</char> pre buk büa diah. Nami baw dow kuala Israeluüa kownkow hai tangbung khup rah nacham sütta kown khe uamowuüa kowi en nape tumah kown. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Israeluüa maten kowi taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e en kuaah kown en nau khe nami baw pre buk trui aiatma uamowuüa natumah kown. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa ngetchow kowi en kuaah kown en nau khe dow baw lowkchow aiatma uamowuüa kowi en nape tumah kown. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Now nacham sütta tangbung khup rah kown khe dow atownchow en nape tumah baw kown. Naiawng uamow rik tum khe dow taklowp taklangra te satlawt pra kowh khup tangbung miuüa narik tarowng mang kown. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Nami kung kowi atownchow plan tum baw iawk khe dow taklowp taklangra te mrawkphak pra kowh khup tangbung miuüa natarowng mang kown. Nacham süt tangbung khup rah kown khe dow naiawng atownchow uamowuüa natum baw kown. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Nachenganchepaw amülüngma mih takua talawm khin khe dow arasang maru kawmuüa nauangla kownkow aiatma uamowuüa kowi en nape tumah baw kown.<verse eid="NUM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />“Nami baw pre buk mih dow uamow Arawn kowh krungchakuüa chowtaih naia tum kown. Nami dow enni hai enni kowh krungchakuüa vüi chowngchowng saksakma ari arow chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />Enni matia pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe chang enni nowng mih ransu-uüa hown enni tasen natakla kown. Naiawng rakowi enni cham tarü tasen kown chowbowt khe baw pre buk trui atownchow uamowuüa natumah kown. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow natuak enni kown towbowt, now aia dow ransu-uüa rut hownia nalawng enni kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Nami klen kowi chang pawi kowh enni piaw mih khin khe paw uamowuüa natum enni baw kown. Khowm bowkta enni mih uanap pawi khe, la uown kowi tikah mih uanap pawi khe hai taking tasangra uanap pawi khe amatni natum enni baw kown. Nami baw tün hown dow Thurai natuak enni kown towbowt. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sinai hungh hownia Paran prakowi süt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Aigupta pren hownia amatni uang lawt mih pre ning hown pre la khe kowh lacher pirmi ni khe dow taklowp taklangra te luk hownia uangnim tatowng khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa dow Sinai hungh uowi mih süngrüp süngkangma hownia lawt büah khai. Now Paran pami süngrüp süngkangma re-e uangnim iowng dowi mowr dow mang büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana iawng amatni cham süt tangbung mih dow nakhe tak chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda thumchak lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Auown kowi rik mang mih thumchak dow Juda thumchak chekhai. Amatni dow amatni thumchak kowh tamkhuown ruangla se rik mang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:14">Juda krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Aminadab kowh chapa Nasawn chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Isakar krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Zuar kowh chapa Nethanel chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />Zebulun krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Helawn kowh chapa Eliab chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Nami kung kowi dow Levi krungchak Gersawnuüa hai Merariuüa tawi lawt khai. Amatni dow taklowp taklangra te lutla hanow nami uanh kawtla büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reuben thumchak lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Kowbüah kung kowi kowh krawi ta mang miuüa dow Reuben thumchak chekhai. Amatni paw amatni thumchak kowh tamkhuown ruangla se krawi ta mang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:18">Reuben krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Sedeur kowh chapa Elizur chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Simiawn krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Zurisadai kowh chapa Selumiel chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Gad krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Deuel kowh chapa Eliasaf chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Nami kung kowi dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh chimsaima mih uanh kawtla now Levi krungchak Kohatuüa krawi ta mang khai. Tangbung khup rah sar kowi Kohat krungchakuüa kowting dowi rawn taklowp taklangra te dow rik ki changta kown mih laiklow uowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efraim thumchak lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Kowbüah kung kowi kowh krawi ta mang miuüa dow Efraim thumchak chekhai. Amatni paw amatni thumchak kowh tamkhuown ruangla se krawi ta mang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:22">Efraim krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Amihud kowh chapa Elisama chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Manase krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Pedazur kowh chapa Gamaliel chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Gideawni kowh chapa Abidan chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dan thumchak lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Achur nowm nowm kowi kowh krawi ta mang miuüa dow Dan thumchak chekhai. Amatni paw amatni thumchak kowh tamkhuown ruangla se krawi ta mang büah khai. Amatni dow akeng mih thumchakuüa kowh mingkhet mih iawng hai krawi ta mang mih chekhai. Amatni dow kung hownia ransu-uüa uang krawi ia sen dowi pat pami rakowi ta mang mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:25">Dan krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Amisadai kowh chapa Ahizer chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Aser krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Okran kowh chapa Pakiel chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Naptali krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Enan kowh chapa Ahira chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Naiawng hai Israeluüa dow athum athumchow mang büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anai Hobab kowi Mosi hawla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Mosi pu Jethraw kowh chapa Hobab pami Midian prenchak uowi lowk ia. Nami kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Nai ow, CHAKRAMANG nape anging kownkow kham anging mih pren prakowi anging tarü mih chowbowt chaw. En paw anging hown tawi snow. Anging Israeluüa kowi ahuma nape anging iungra kownkow CHAKRAMANG takham khowk. En che tawi hanow en kowi paw anging napela en iungra kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Mosi kowi Hobab tek pe mih, “Ang tawi dowi tham ba, nai. Anging pren kowi ang kimchakuüa tut-e ang kowplan kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Mosi tek pe mih, “Nai, naiawng nadowi. Sakrauma hown hauang towla anging hüah diah. Süngrüp süngkangma kowi tawng mih re-e chow khup tangbung e iung kown mih en tuk. En dow anging kowh tiama tüng mih naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Anging hown che en tawi now CHAKRAMANG pe anging mih iungra maten hownia en kowi paw anging bakla en kown taih,” pape khai. <verse eid="NUM 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Naiawng rakowi Hobab paw amatni hown tawi kown mih nauta khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:33">Israeluüa dow Sinai hungh uowi mih süngrüp süngkangma hownia lawt hanow sum ni mang rawng mowr mang büah khai bowt. Uangnim cham iowng rah kowi narik thik tanaira kownkow nami sum ni mowr dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt miuüa amatni pur kowi rik mang khai. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Naiawng Israeluüa cham mang mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh uangnim dow amatni luk kowi tawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt miuüa tarowng mang towng Mosi tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, awr rü bowt! En kowh ransu-uüa kowi setta plawt bowt! Sui en miuüa kowi en pur hownia henta bowt!” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Now tanaira kowi cham ting towng atowk rah kowi sangbowk laitawm tawkpla towta kung kowi Mosi tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, athawng aiawng mih Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi uang plan bowt!” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kamcheah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Israeluüa dow amatni kawmkrat mih lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr kamche khai. Naiawng Israeluüa awr kamcheah mih tata hanow CHAKRAMANG dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. Now aia dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi iu chin pe maih khai. Nami maih dow Israeluüa kowh tangbung khup rah kharia pra kowh maru-uüa kowi kamla ne khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa dow Mosi tut-e kar se kowlü khowng khai. Now nami lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e Mosi awr phowk pe hanow nami maih dow mit khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Nami arah kowi dow CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh maih Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi uang kam khai rakowi nami arah ming dow Tebera pahai Mosi chap pe khai. (Tebera pami dow “Maih kamah mih arah” pami chekhai).<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa dow nacha chaknga kown mih nau büah khai. Now Israeluüa paw Mosi tut-e plan kamche khai iawk. Amatni tek pe mih, “Pe anging chaknga! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Aigupta pren kowi aiawng hown nau mowr chi anging ka cha dam kan mih dow anging ka tuak khai. Nami klen kowi sawsa uih, fre uih, iowu rik, iowu kaw hai iowu ram ün anging ka cha mih paw anging ka tuak khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow anging kowh kür khowk bowk khowk; <char style="w">manna kawm</char> klen kowi tawngpaw anging khi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />(Manna kawm dow bakkawr nuk powm iawng, now arawng dow akawma chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8-9" />Iak-e <char style="w">nang</char> uang kla khe nami manna dow amatni kowh tangbung khup rah kowi uang tawi dowh reng chekhai. Now maru kawmuüa dow naiawngün krawi lümah hanow sum kowi hai aküara kowi cham tungah hai cham küaah khai. Naiawngün dow atung ia chepaw, aküa ia chepaw puh kowi butah now thawpla kawm büah khai. Naiawngün kawm chak sowr dow kanrawn sau hown kowh ngaiah mih kawmpah chak sowr iawng chekhai).<verse eid="NUM 11:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Chowlowkkow kimchakuüa kowh tangbung plawt re-e Israeluüa kamcheah mih Mosi ta khai. Nami tata hanow CHAKRAMANG dow lainowmma kunmarau khai, now Mosi paw sak-hiah khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Mosi tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “CHAKRAMANG, en kowh nar kowi tawngplawng kowchow en tuk peah akrat khai? En sak-ih dowi mih lup tawng chow ang changta khai? Tawngplawng kowchow maiawngün maru kawmuüa kowh kurdik en tuk pe ang khai? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Maiawngün maru-uüa kowi ang matia thawpah mih nadowi; amatni dow ang muah mih paw nadowi, now ang penah mih paw nadowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw achah kowi a-u paiah iawng amatni kowi naming nakhetah kown mih tawngplawng kowchow en tuk tek ang khai? Amatni pipu-uüa kowi napeah pren kown mih en khamah khai. Nachenganchepaw tawngplawng kowchow amatni kowi nakowpawla kown mih kurdik en tuk pe ang khai? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Amatni dow ‘Pe anging chaknga’ pahai kamche ang khai. Maiawngün maru-uüa vüi tawng kowi chow ang cham ka pe chaknga kown? <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />Maiawngün maru-uüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik ang lowk iachow dow ia kur dowi chekhai! Mami kurdik dow lainowmma dih khai! <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Maiawng che en chang ang reng kown hanow kawmat mat saita ang diah! En che saksing sana ang khai hanow maiawng hauang towk ang kawm tham bowt!” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lawngtang aluchowuüa 70 ia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ringkawra uowima mih aluchowuüa kowi ang tut-e uang pawla 70 ia diah. Now taklowp taklangra te re-e amatni kowi dow en hown katsang pe iowngah diah. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Nami re-e dow ang nauang dowm hanow en hown ang nauang taklang kown. Now ang pe en mih lümla amatni kowi paw ang napela ne kown. Nahanow amatni dow maru-uüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik natawi khowng kur en kown towbowt. Now maru-uüa kowh kurdik en lowk iachow akur takla dowi bowt tham.<verse eid="NUM 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />“Maru-uüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Tharau kowh vüi kowmatia kowi tachim tasai büa diah. Tharau khe dow enni naka cha chaknga kown towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow chaknga rakowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni awr kar khai. Enni dow maiawng awr kar khai, ‘Kawmat kowh lak-e Aigupta pren kowi uowi khe lang iung chowdiah. Aigupta pren hownia tawngplawng kowchow anging uang tuk lawt khai?’ padow aia tut-e enni awr tek khai. Naiawng enni awr kamcheah mih dow CHAKRAMANG ta khowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG nape enni chaknga kown. Nami chaknga enni nacha reng kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Nami chaknga dow panichow, pre nichow, tanga nichow, hamüt nichow, pirmi nichow enni nacha kown mih nadowi; <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />nami dow pala mowr enni nacha kown. Nakhowk khe dow chaknga du lai bowt rakowi enni nadua bowt kown. Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih CHAKRAMANG kowi enni nuaah khai rakowi naiawng aia nachang enni kown mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “Tasen uang mih kachakuüa nget khowm padow ang tut-e uowi 600,000 ia chekhai. Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa kowi pala mowr en nape chaah chaknga kown mih en tek khai! <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Amatni kowh chia hai ruapur maten ngenta bowk chepaw nalawk büah kown nadowi! Sata kowi kowh dam maten uang pawla bowk chepaw nalawk büah kown nadowi!” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “CHAKRAMANG nowng changah dowi mih lup uowi khai bow? Ang laiklow ching chow ching dowi chow mih khaleng dow en nakhi bowt kown!” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Now Mosi dow taklowp taklangra te hownia lawt hanow aia kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih srui prang kowi kowh maru kawmuüa kowi kowtek pe khai. Aia dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi ruiah 70 ia khai, now naiawngünuüa kowi dow taklowp taklangra te tapat lut pe iowngah khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow uangnim dawng kowi uang dowm hanow Mosi hown uang taklang khai. Now Mosi kowi kowh aia peah mih lümla dow lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi paw aia pela ne khai. Now amatni luk kowi lümla uang ting hanow amatni dow <char style="w">risi</char> iawng tek lai khai. Nachenganchepaw nami kung kowi dow risi iawng hai katpaw tek lai büah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Eldad hai Medad iüah paw Mosi ruiah mih lawngtang aluchowuüa 70 ia pungmadawng kowi kowh maru chekhai. Taklowp taklangra te re-e akeng mih aluchowuüa takua talawm khe amatchi dow tangbung khup rah kowi ta uowi phülü khai. Nachenganchepaw nami lümla dow amatchi luk kowi paw uang uowi khai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi paw tangbung khup rah kowi risi iawng tek lai khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Now klanguüa lowk ia dow kowiowmah hanow Mosi kowi kowtek pe mih, “Eldad hai Medad iüah tangbung khup rah kowi risi iawng tek lai khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Nakhowk khe Nun kowh chapa Josua tek pe Mosi mih, “Aw ang kowh <char style="w">chakramang</char>, kowiüah kowi hangta diah,” pape khai. Josua dow uown klanguüa hownia Mosi kowh akhowng mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Mosi tek pe Josua mih, “Maru kawmuüa ringkaw ang dowi bowt tham pami kowi en tawi taprüala ang bow? CHAKRAMANG kowh maru maten naphaw risi kown mih hai aia maru-uüa luk kowi aia kowh lümla nauowi kown mih ang nau,” pape khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Nami kung kowi Mosi hai Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa dow tangbung khup rah kowi plan büah khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamuk nga hai makowng hawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG dow uang chin pe li khai. Nami li dow sata hownia uang rownla uamuk khai. Naiawngün uamuk dow tangbung khup rah kowi tapat lut pani mang rawng mowr krawi hing tauet khai. Naiawngün dow atat pre muk mowr krawng kowi awr talüp khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Nami ni kowi maru-uüa dow ni chut uar prowt krawi kua uamuk büah khai. Nami klen kowi auai ni paw ni chut krawi kua uamuk büah khai. Amatni dow lowk ia kowi e pra 1,800 set chi kuala khai. Now naiawngün uamuk nga dow tangbung khup rah kowi tapat lut keuah büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Nachenganchepaw nami uamuk nga cha kowh ia iawn dowi krowngchow tak khe CHAKRAMANG dow amatni luk kowi kunmarauah khai. Aia dow amatni pungmadawng kowi makowng hawi akraingma uang chin pe khai, now amatni dow lainowmma kowng khai. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow Kibrawt-Hatava pahai chap pe khai. (Kibrawt-Hatava pami dow “Lawphama miuüa kowh tadupra” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami arah kowi dow lawphama miuüa kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="NUM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Kibrawt-Hatava hownia lawt hanow Hazerawt marow kowi kowuowi büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Mosi kowi Miriam hai Arawn iüah kingküaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Mosi kowh dow Kus chenchap masiuüa paw masi uowi ama tak chekhai. Nami masiuüa hown <char style="w">tachawng</char> rakowi Miriam hai Arawn iüah mih Mosi kowi kingküaah khai. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />Amatchi tatek mih, “Mosi hown krowngchow taih bow CHAKRAMANG tek lai? Achi hown dow CHAKRAMANG tek lai dowi bow?” paiüah khai. Naiawng amatchi tatek mih dow CHAKRAMANG ta khai. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />(Mosi dow mapaw bawri dowi mih maru chekhai. Aia iawng bawri dowi mih maru lusa kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt).<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Arawn hai Miriam iüah kowh laiklow tata hown akrowksang CHAKRAMANG mih Mosi, Arawn hai Miriam büah kowi hawah khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Tangbung hownia uang lawt hanow taklowp taklangra te re-e enni sum ia uang büa diah,” pakhai. Nami tata hanow Mosi, Arawn hai Miriam büah mih taklowp taklangra te re-e kowkowi büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5-6" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow uangnim iowng chunglung mih kowi taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e uang iowng khai, now Arawn hai Miriam iüah kowi hawah khai. Now amatchi dow CHAKRAMANG re-e kowtatawn khai. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe amatchi mih, “Ang laiklow sünta iüa diah. Enni pungmadawng kowi che akeng mih risiuüa uowi khai e dow <char style="w">mukmang</char> kowi ang CHAKRAMANG nauang tatüng pe kown taih diah, now amatni tut-e mang kowi ang nauang klangah kown taih diah. <verse eid="NUM 12:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Tawkche ang kowh nar Mosi kowi dow naiawng ang changah dowi chekhai. Aia dow ang kowh maru Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ang kaah sakowm mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Naiawng rakowi aia hown dow tatingtangah klowk now ang klangah reng, aia kowi dow laiuat hown ang klangah dowi chekhai. Aia tut-e dow ching kowi ang uang tatüng pe reng chekhai. Naiawng chepaw ang kowh nar Mosi kowi nakingküaah kown mih mapaw enchi kram dowi chekhai!” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Arawn hai Miriam iüah luk kowi lainowmma kunmarauah khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow amatchi hownia powt khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Taklowp taklangra te hownia aluk prakowi nami uangnim iowng chunglung mih awr pün hanow Miriam buk kowi nang iawng akawma par uang phaw khai. Nami par rawka dow Miriam prakowi Arawn haimü hanow khita khai. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Nahanow Arawn tek pe Mosi mih, “Aw, ang kowh chakramang, smuma mih maru iawng angching changta lup ngak khai. Angching kowh angak lawtta angching diah. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />U mu lak hownia akowngma mih ngiachow uang dia khe kowh pik tanir mih iawng Miriam kowi hangkow towta hüah diah” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Now atün atünma CHAKRAMANG tut-e Mosi lü prasi mih, “Aw Thurai, sakrauma hown Miriam kowh par rawka iungta pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “A-pa che thawk pe aia kowh lumowr khai e dow ranit ni mowr aia narukrai kown. Aia kowi mih ranit ni mowr tangbung khup rah uat kowi cham lang pe uowiah diah. Now nami ranit ni kung kowi par rawka iung khowk khe chiang aia kowi mih tangbung khup rah kowi nauang ia pawla kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Naiawng rakowi ranit ni mowr Miriam kowi tangbung khup rah uat kowi cham lang pe uowiah khai. Now aia kowi uang plan pawla dowi mowr akeng mih arah kowi Israeluüa cham süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Hazerawt hownia lawt hanow Paran pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kowkumü Kanan pren mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Paran pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Israel laipre chen kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi pachen e lowk ia chi Kanan pren kowi kowchinah <char style="w">dumiow</char> diah. Amatni dow ang nape enni kown mih Kanan pren tawng iawng chow uowi mih pakowku mü lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Naiawng rakowi Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG ana iawng rowprowp chang khai bowt. Aia dow Israel aluchow laipre ia kowi Paran pami süngrüp süngkangma hownia kowchinah khai. Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Reuben krungchak hownia Zakur kowh chapa Samua; <verse eid="NUM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />Simiawn krungchak hownia Hori kowh chapa Safat; <verse eid="NUM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />Juda krungchak hownia Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb; <verse eid="NUM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />Isakar krungchak hownia Josef kowh chapa Igal; <verse eid="NUM 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />Efraim krungchak hownia Nun kowh chapa Hosea; <verse eid="NUM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />Benjamin krungchak hownia Rafu kowh chapa Palti; <verse eid="NUM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />Zebulun krungchak hownia Sodi kowh chapa Gadiel; <verse eid="NUM 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />Josef kowh chapa Manase krungchak hownia Susi kowh chapa Gadi; <verse eid="NUM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />Dan krungchak hownia Gemali kowh chapa Amiel; <verse eid="NUM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />Aser krungchak hownia Mikael kowh chapa Sethur; <verse eid="NUM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />Naptali krungchak hownia Vofsi kowh chapa Nabi; <verse eid="NUM 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />Gad krungchak hownia Maki kowh chapa Geuel büah chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Kanan pren kowmü kownkow Mosi kowchinah mih dumiowuüa dow naiawngün aluchowuüa chekhai. Nun kowh chapa Hosea kowi Mosi rük pe mih ming dow Josua chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Kanan pren kowi kowchinah mih khin khe Mosi krawi tek pe dumiowuüa mih, “Negeb iawng kowrik kowiah büah hanow hungma mawngma süng iawng kowkupah büa diah. <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />Kanan pren tawng iawng chow uowi mih kowkrawi kumü büa diah. Nakowi kowh maru-uüa akürma bow kür dowi bow, now maru iun akawmma bow kawm dowi bow, <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />now tawng iawng mih süng kowi chow uowi büah mih, nami süng dow iung bow iung dowi bow mih enni namüla kown. Amatni uowiah mih marow maten dow akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim uowi bow uowi dowi bow? <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Nakowi kowh krawng kowi luprak iung bow iung dowi bow? Nakowi dow singh kau uowi bow uowi dowi bow? Nakowi kowh uih-ak küklük enni nauang pawla ne kown,” pakhai. Kowbüah kowkowi mih khin khe grep uih klek khin uown thüm chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Nami laipre ia aluchowuüa dow Zin pami süngrüp süngkangma hownia kowuown kowiah hanow Hamat marow re-e kowh Rahab marow mowr kowkrawi müla büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Amatni dow Negeb iawng tarü hanow Hebrawn marow kowi kowtowm büah khai. (Hebrawn marow dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh Zoan marow lak-e lang ta 7 ning chekhai). Hebrawn marow kowi uowi miuüa dow Anak kowh chuprek chaprek Ahimanuüa, Sesaiuüa hai Talmaiuüa chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Amatni dow Eskawl <char style="w">lawngrawi</char> kowi kowkowiah büah hanow nakowi kowh grep uih klekla papawt büah khai; amatni dow amia hailawm rowila büah khai. Nami grep uih pawt dow dih lai rakowi cham tu pe akawtlawng hanow kawtla pre ia khai. Nami klen kowi amatni dow <char style="w">dalim</char> uih hai uidut uih paw pawla ne khai. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Nami re-e Israeluüa klekla grep uih papawt khai rakowi nami lawngrawi ming dow Eskawl pahai chap pe khai. (Eskawl pami dow “Pawt” pami chekhai).<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanan pren lawnguan kowi küa dai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Now 40 ni mowr krawi kumüla pren kung kowi dow Israel aluchowuüa mih uang plan khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Nami aluchowuüa dow Mosi, Arawn hai Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi uang plan mang khai bowt. Nami khin khe amatni uowi mih dow Paran pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Kades marow kowi chekhai. Amatni dow khila mih srui Mosi, Arawn hai Israeluüa maten kowi uang lawp pe khai, now amatni uang pawla mih uih-ak paw tüng pe büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Amatni dow Mosi kowi tek pe mih, “En kowchin anging mih pren kowi anging kowkowi khowk. Nami pren kowi iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi nowm pami mami uih-ak kowi müah now tuk mih towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Tawkche nami pren kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow akürma kangowh chekhai. Amatni kowh marow paw aiukma kangowh, now <char style="w">tap</char> uowi bowk chekhai. Nami klen kowi lang ngah nowm nowm mih dow Anak kowh chuprek chaprekuüa kowi paw nami pren kowi anging khila chekhai. (Amatni dow aiuk akroma kangowh chekhai). <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Amalekuüa uowi mih dow Negeb kowi chekhai. Hituüa, Jebusuüa hai Amawruüa uowi mih dow hungma mawngma süng kowi chekhai. Now Kananuüa uowi mih dow Mediteranean sata riaret kowi hai Jawrdan aw riaret kowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Nami laiklow tata now maru kawmuüa dow kram kowh Mosi pur kowi pawpanla ur khai. Nakhowk khe Kaleb tek pe mih, “Chu, nami pren a-i kowpowng madiah sik. A-i naia powng ngengche kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Nachenganchepaw Kaleb hown kowh kowkowi mih akeng miuüa tek mih, “Paimi pren kowi kowh maru-uüa hown tasen kown mih mapaw a-i nowng dowi tham. Kowbüah dow a-i lak-e lang kür chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Kaleb hown kowh kowtawi mih akeng mih dumiowuüa dow Israeluüa tut-e Kanan pren lawnguan kowi küa dai mih, “Anging kowmüah mih pren dow aia prenchakuüa kowi iawnah reng chekhai. Nakowi kowh anging khila mih maru maten abawlima kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Nephilimuüa kowi paw nakowi anging khila chekhai. Anak krungchakuüa dow Nephilimuüa kowh chuprek chaprek chekhai. Kowbüah kowi khita now plawng khowt chow anging matia kowi anging tatuak khai, now kowbüah paw naiawng khowt chowtaih tuakla anging khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Thurai kowi Israeluüa kamcheah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Nami laiklow tata now Israeluüa dow uar prowt kar sawmlawm khai. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Amatni dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi lainowmma kamcheah khai. Amatni tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren kowi chepaw, mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi chepaw anging kowng panü dow lang iung tak diah. <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Tasen hown Kanan pren kowi nakowngta anging kownkow tawngplawng kowchow Aigupta pren hownia CHAKRAMANG uang tuk pawla anging khai? Kanan prenchakuüa dow anging kowh masi chauüa kowi narupta anging kown towbowt. Nami lak-e dow Aigupta pren kowi kowplan mih anging vüi lang iung nadowi bow?” pabüah khai. <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Amatni dow lowkkowlowk tatek büah mih, “Chu, a-i thawp aluchow lowk ia now Aigupta pren kowi a-i kowplan lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Nami lawnguan tukta hanow Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow Israeluüa pur kowi krawng kowi tabawkah krawm khai. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6-7" />Nakhowk khe kowkumü Kanan pren mih dumiowuüa pungmadawng hownia Nun kowh chapa Josua hai Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb iüah dow amatchi kowh tawnguat sekla se Israeluüa kowi tek pe mih, “Anging kowmüah mih pren dow lainowmma klangiung. <verse eid="NUM 14:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />CHAKRAMANG che sak-ih a-i khai hanow aia dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi mih pren kowi napawla a-i kown taih. Nami pren dow aia nape a-i kown taih. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowi hang <char style="w">kingküa</char> büa diah. Kanan pren kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi hangkow kram büah; amatni kowi dow kra dowi kowi a-i nowngta kown taih. Amatni dow tawng iawng paw ia plai dowi bowt tak. CHAKRAMANG tawi uowila a-i kown taih. Hangkow kram büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa dow Josua hai Kaleb iüah kowi hua hown kuakah now kowngta kown mih tatek büah khai. Nachenganchepaw nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow taklowp taklangra te hownia Israeluüa pur kowi uang tatüng khai. <verse eid="NUM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Mün khowt tak chow maru kawmuüa nasui ang kown? Amatni kowi dow awdara lup ahuma ang tüng pe khowk. Nachepaw tawngplawng kowchow owm ang büah dowi reng tak? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Amatni luk kowi ang nauang pawla pe makowng hawi kown. Amatni dow ang kowh maru nachowng kown nadowi bowt. Nachenganchepaw en hownia dow kowbüah lak-e lang kür hai lang kawm mih chenchap ang nathawpah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Nami laiklow tata hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Mami maru kawmuüa kowi dow Aigupta pren hownia en matia kür hown en uang pawla mih chekhai. Naiawng che amatni kowi en ripah khai hanow nami lawnguan dow Aigupta prenchakuüa natawi ta kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />Aiguptauüa dow ta hanow Kanan prenchakuüa kowi paw natek pe kown towbowt. Aw CHAKRAMANG, Israeluüa kowi en tawi uowila reng pami kawmat mowr dow mami prenchakuüa tuk chekhai. Aw CHAKRAMANG, ni-e dow uangnim iowng chunglung mih iawng, now uar-e dow maih lün iowng chunglung mih iawng en tawi uowila anging reng pami Kanan prenchakuüa tawi ta khowk chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Naiawng rakowi mami maru kawmuüa kowi che amaisang en kowngta bowk hanow en lawnguan kowi kowh tawi ta khowk mih chenchapuüa natek kown mih, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‘Napeah kownkow aia khamah mih pren kowi Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG nowng pawla dowi bowt kowh süngrüp süngkangma kowi saita bowk khowk,’ napa kown.<verse eid="NUM 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />“Naiawng rakowi Aw CHAKRAMANG, kawmat en kowh kür tüng anging diah, now en kham anging iawng chang anging diah. <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />En tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG dow kunmarau naklak dowi. Aia kowh sakraura dow achur uowi dowi chekhai. Aia dow atawi ama ün, angak ün lawt reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aprek uowi mih maru kowi dow aia ripah reng. Aia dow u-pa kowh angak sung chauüa luk kowi sum tali chowng mowr peah ripra reng chekhai,’ pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Aigupta pren hown uang lawt hownia kawmat mowr en pe anging alawt reng chekhai. Nami powm iawng dow en kowh sakraura achur uowi dowi mih mami maru kawmuüa kowi tüng pe iawk diah, now amatni kowh angak lawtta pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En tek iawng amatni kowh angak dow ang lawtta pe khowk. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow sing uowi reng pami hai ang kowh kraingra dow palusama kowi atekma uowi reng pami anowm chekhai, nami powm iawng dow mami laiklow paw anowm chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22-23" />Amatni pipu-uüa tut-e kowh ang khamah mih Kanan pren dow mami maru-uüa lowk iachow paw nakhi kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren kowi hai süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh ang kowh awdara lup hai ang kowh kraingra khi büah reng khowk chepaw nuata ang büah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow plan plan chaing ang büah khai. Sui ang miuüa dow miapaw natawi khi Kanan pren kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 14:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Nachenganchepaw ang nar Kaleb kowh saktuak dow naiawng nadowi. Aia dow ang kowh lai chün reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowkowiah mih pren kowi dow aia kowi ang nakowpawla kown, now aia krungchakuüa dow nami pren kowi natawi ka dawngthawnguan kown. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Kanan pren kowi kowh <char style="w">lawngrawi</char> kowi kawmat dow Amalekuüa hai Kananuüa uowi reng tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tharau khe mih kung prakowi plan büah hanow sata Rik pra kowh mangla mih tiama iawng süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkowi büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Thurai ripah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi hai Arawn iüah mih, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Israeluüa kamche ang mih laiklow ang ta chekhai. Mün khowt tak chow mami maru ngak chenchapuüa nakamche ang kown? <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe iüa diah: Ang sak lüklau hown ang tek khowk, ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Enni tekah iawng enni luk kowi ang nachang kown. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh rüala khowk mih maru maten dow mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi nakowng bowk kown. Kamche ang büa khai rakowi amatni kowi dow ang nakowngta bowk kown. <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Enni nauowiah kownkow ang kham enni mih pren kowi Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb hai Nun kowh chapa Josua iüah klen kowi dow miapaw natawi ia kup kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Nami klen kowi enni kowh chauüa kowi chowtaih enni nuata khowk mih Kanan pren kowi ang nakowpawla kown. Enni kowh chauüa lawnguan maiawng enni tek khai, ‘Kanan prenchakuüa dow narupta anging chauüa kown chekhai,’ pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Enni kowh uak dow mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi natakuak hüah kown. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Enni chowng kowi kowh maru kowng bowk dowi mowr enni kowh chauüa mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi nakrawi mang panglang kown. Kaah sakowm iawng enni uowi dowi rakowi 40 ning mowr mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi enni kowh chauüa nakham ngare kown. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Kowkrawi kumü Kanan pren khe 40 ni lakke büah khai. Nami pani mih kowi paning chi ang nadowk enni kown. Enni kowh angak rakowi 40 ning mowr enni nakham ngare kown. Nakhowk khe chiang <char style="w">kingküa</char> ang now tawng iawng chow own mih enni natuk kown. <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Mami angakma mih chenchapuüa kowi kowh kingküa ang miuüa dow mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi nakowng bowk kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Kowkrawi kumü Kanan pren kownkow Mosi chinah mih dumiowuüa uang plan hanow pathum mih dow uang küa dai khai, now Mosi kowi nakamcheah kownkow maru kawmuüa kowi chükah büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />Naiawng küa dai miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi makowng hawi hown kowng bowk khai. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Nun kowh chapa Josua hai Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb iüah chowtaih ta sing khai.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Mosi mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow maten Israeluüa kowi uang phuang pe khai. Nami satang tata hanow maru kawmuüa dow sak piak khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Now auai rau murpa amatni dow Kanan pren kowi kowh hungma mawngma süng prakowi awr mang kownkow kamrüt khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Mosi kowi tek pe büah mih, “Mow, anging tarü mih chowbowt chaw. Anging changta angak khai nowm. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG kham a-i mih pren prakowi anging tarü mih chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe mih, “Süngrüp süngkangma prakowi naplan kownkow CHAKRAMANG pe enni ana mih tawngplawng kowchow enni chün dowi? Enni kowh nami lup dow nachawn kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />CHAKRAMANG tawi uowila enni dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi hangkow tarü büa diah. Ransu-uüa rut kowi enni nasum kown taih. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Amalekuüa hai Kananuüa hown enni nacham takrum now amatni dow nadowk enni tasen kown towbowt. CHAKRAMANG kowi enni powtta khai bowt rakowi aia dow tawi uowila enni dowi bowt. Naiawng rakowi tasen hown enni nacham kowng kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow Mosi hai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih towla hüah now hungma mawngma süng prakowi awr mang büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Israeluüa kowi khita hanow hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh uowi mih Amalekuüa hai Kananuüa dow tadowk tasen kownkow uang dowm khai, now amatni dow Hawrma marow mowr Israeluüa kowi kawikrawiah khai.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Phuchua chang rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1-3" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Enni nauowiah kownkow ang pe enni kown mih pren kowi enni kowting mih khin khe ang naawmrawmla enni reng kownkow tawncher hown tikah mih uanap enni nachang reng kown takla. Takhamta mih rakowi chepaw, kowmatia sak nau hown chepaw, khowmta bowkta mih pawi kowi chepaw tikah mih uanap enni nachang reng kown. Tikah mih uanap chang müa dow chia chepaw, rua chepaw, ruapur chepaw enni nauang ia pawla kown. <verse eid="NUM 15:1-3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4-5" />Now phuchuala ang kownkow enni uang pawla tawncher towng kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap paw enni nauang pawla reng kown takla. Phuchuala ang mih tawncher che ruapur chah chekhai hanow nami tawncher hown dow kawmdi lang iung mih aset hown 400 gram kowi kanrawn sau pathun kowi changah tali bak kowi pabak hown lawkah mih enni nauang pawla kown, now khamah mih uanap vüi dow grep tui aset enni nauang pawla kown.<verse eid="NUM 15:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />“Phuchuala ang mih tawncher che ruapurla chekhai hanow nami tawncher hown dow kawmdi lang iung mih pre set hown 800 gram kowi kanrawn sau aset hown 300 gram lawkah mih enni nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />Now khamah mih uanap vüi dow grep tui aset hown 300 gram enni nauang pawla kown takla. Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG naawmrawm enni kownkow naiawngün mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni naphuchua kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />“Now CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap chepaw, takhamta mih uanap chepaw, taking tasangra uanap chepaw chiala hown che enni chang kown nau khai hanow <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />nami chiala hown dow kawmdi lang iung mih tali set hown 200 gram kowi kanrawn sau pre set lawkah mih enni nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />Nami klen kowi khamah mih uanap vüi paw grep tui pre set enni nauang pawla kown. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />“Chiala chepaw, ruapurla chepaw, ruapur chah chepaw, ruala chepaw tawncher maten hown dow naiawng enni naphuchuala ang kown. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Enni chang phuchua towng mami ri kowi uowi iawng enni naphuchua ang kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />Israeluüa maten dow chakkham uanap chang towng ari kowi uowi iawng nachang reng kown takla. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Now enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa chepaw, uang tawi chang lup mih maru-uüa chepaw CHAKRAMANG naawmrawmla kownkow chakkham uanap tawi chang kown nau khai hanow amatni paw enni chang iawng natawi chang kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Nami dow katpaw taklowi dowk mih rirow chekhai. Nami rirow dow enni hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa vüi katsang naown kown. Ang tut-e dow enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa paw enni hown katsang chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Nami ari arow hai ari aiang dow enni hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa vüi akat sang naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18-19" />“Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Ang nape enni kown mih pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe nakowi kowh enni kaah mih luprak hownia CHAKRAMANG vüi enni naphuchuaah ne kown. <verse eid="NUM 15:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Üa hai laih hownia kowh uih müng dow natungah hanow nathawpla kawm apah kown takla. Nami kawmpah dow kawmdi uanap iawng hai enni naap-ah kown. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Rik kuaah mih luprak hownia naiawng mih uanap dow chowngchowng saksakma CHAKRAMANG vüi enni nachang reng kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tamata kowh changta angak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />“Enni che rut tawi khawk tawi rakowi changta angak khai, ang pe en mih ana maten enni che chün dowi, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />ang pe en ana mih ni hownia pur prakowi enni kowh chuprek chaprekuüa paw tawita mata khai hanow <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />CHAKRAMANG naawmrawmla enni kownkow Israel pachenma hownia chiala apum hown tikah mih uanap pawi enni nachang kown takla. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. Nami uanap hown dow kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap paw enni nauang pawla kown. Now angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi ruala paw enni naphuchuala papum kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Israel pachenma kowh angak CHAKRAMANG nalawtla kownkow nami uanap dow uamow nachang enni kown. Nahanow enni kowh angak dow CHAKRAMANG nalawtta enni kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni tamata kowh changta angak mih dow enni plan tuk mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap enni changta khowk chekhai, now angak lawt lük müa uanap paw enni uang pawla khowk chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Naiawng hai enni Israeluüa hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa kowh atawi dow ang nalawtta enni kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün angak changta mih dow enni bowkbowk chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />“Tawkche tawita mata kowh chang angak mih che lowk iachow taih hanow nami maru dow angak lawt lük müa uanap nachangla kownkow paningchow mih rua iia nauang pawla papum kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Tawita mata kowh naiawng chang angak mih maru kowi dow nalawtta pe angak kownkow uamow mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nachang pe uanap kown. Now aia kowh angak dow nalawtta pe kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Enni Israeluüa chepaw, enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa chepaw, tawita mata kowh changta ngak mih maru kowh rirow dow akat sang naown kown.<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />“Nachenganchepaw aia sak nau hown chang angak mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG kowi nü dowi klowk dowi mih chekhai. Nami dow enni matia chepaw, enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa chepaw naiawng chang mih maru kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia nabatta kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow nü dowi klowk dowi mih hai aia kowh ana pek chün dowi mih maru kowi dow nabatta ngengche kown takla. Aia kowh angak sung dow aia naka ripra kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tanai Ni chün dowi mih maru kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Süngrüp süngkangma kowi Israeluüa uowi mih khin khe amatni dow Tanai Ni kowi cham paw sawp mih maru khi lowk ia khai. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Nami cham paw sawp mih maru kowi khi miuüa dow Mosi, Arawn hai Israeluüa tut-e kowpawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />Naiawng chang mih maru kowi tawng chow changah kown mih tuk büah dowi rakowi amatni dow nami maru kowi tawmta hüah khai. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Nami maru kowi dow nakowngta kown takla. Aia kowi dow tangbung khup rah uat kowi pawla now huaklu hown kowng pat enni Israeluüa maten nakuakah kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa maten dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng nami maru kowi mih tangbung khup rah uat kowi cham pawla hanow huaklu hown kowng pat kuakah khai.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uanpowngchow kowi nachawp pe amawm kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37-38" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Enni kowh uanpowngchow kowi anui towng chawp pe amawm büa lowk chi diah. Nami amawm dow aruama mih la iang hown uanpowngchow nui kowi enni nasükah kown. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma enni nachangah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 15:37-38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Naiawngün uanmawm che uanpowngchow kowi tabat mih enni khi hanow ang kowh ana pek maten enni natuakah kown, now chün paw enni nachünah kown. Nahanow enni kowh mik ir iawng hai sak nau iawng enni nauowi kown nadowi bowt; enni dow ang kaah sakowm iawng nauowi kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Naiawng hai nami uanmawm mih ang kowh ana maten nachün kown mih hai Thurai vüi chimsaima nauowi kown mih nape ka tuak enni kown. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Enni kowh Thurai nachowngla kownkow Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni mih chekhai. Ang CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Kora kingküa Mosi hai Arawn iüah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1-2" />Akat khe Ishar kowh chapa Kora dow Dathan, Abiram hai Awn büah hown takrüpah hanow Mosi kowi kingküaah khai. (Ishar dow Levi chapa Kohat kowh chah chekhai. Dathan, Abiram hai Awn büah dow Reuben krungchak chekhai. Dathan hai Abiram iüah kowh pa dow Eliab chekhai. Now Awn kowh pa dow Pelet chekhai). Nami tali ia klen kowi Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh aming anang uowima kangowh mih aluchowuüa paw amatni hown tawi takrüp 250 ia khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Amatni dow ahawmsang uangah now Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi uang tek pe mih, “Lainowmma enchi chang lowchow khai! Israel pachenma dow chimsaima kangowh towbowt nadowi bow, now anging hown paw CHAKRAMANG uowi nadowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa luk kowi enchi lang chang lowchow rengreng tak?” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Mosi mih krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se chup Thurai khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Now Kora hai athumchakuüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Mia chow aia kowh maru, mia chow <char style="w">chimsai</char> mih hai mia chow aia pur kowi kowia kowi kown mih tharau khe CHAKRAMANG nauang tüng a-i kown. CHAKRAMANG kloah mih kowi chowtaih aia pur kowi aia nape kowiah kown. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6-7" />Kora, en hai en kowh thumchakuüa hown maiawng enni nachang kown: Tharau khe maikhük towk müa puh kowi enni natow pe mairing hanow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than enni nathe pe kown, now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nami nam iungma mih maikhük enni natowkah kown. Nami khin khe mia kowi chow CHAKRAMANG kloah mih a-i natuk kown taih. Lang lowchow mih dow enni Leviuüa chowbowt!” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 16:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Kora kowi Mosi plan tek pe mih, “Enni Leviuüa ang laiklow sünta büah! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Thurai dow taklowp taklangra te kowi aia tut-e enni nanowng kowila kownkow lang klo enni khai. Now Israeluüa maten vüi lakke takla mih lup enni nanowng chang pe kownkow aia klo enni khai. Naiawng Israeluüa maten pungmadawng hownia Israeluüa kowh Thurai lang klo enni mih pankri dowi pabow enni ka tuak? Nami klen kowi tawng chow enni nau tak? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Kora, en hai enni Leviuüa maten kowi amülüngma hown CHAKRAMANG pe enni kurdik khowk nadowi bow? Nachenganchepaw tawngplawng kowchow enni tawi takhün uamow rah reng tak? <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Arawn kowi enni kingküaah mih dow aia kowi kowh enni kingküa mih nadowi; CHAKRAMANG kowi kowh enni kingküa mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tawngplawng kowchow Arawn kowi enni tuk kingküaah khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Nami kung kowi dow Eliab kowh chapa Dathan hai Abiram iüah kowi uang hawla kownkow Mosi kowchin maru khai. Nachenganchepaw kowiüah krawi tek pe mih, “Angching uang dowi tham! <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi mih pren hownia en uang lawtla anging khai. Now mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi nakowngta anging kownkow en uang pawla anging khai. Naiawng en chang chepaw en sak ta-ih dowi tak bow? Now kawmat dow anging luk kowi nachang alow kown mih paw en nau khai iawk! <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi mih pren kowi en pawla anging dowi, now krawng bawn hai grep rawng paw en pe powng anging dowi! Hauang kuan anging tham bowt! En tut-e mapaw angching uang kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Mosi dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. Mosi tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, kowbüah kowh uanap hangkow paw pe diah. Kawmat mowr dow kowbüah luk kowi ang tawita mata mih tawngpaw uowi dowi tak, now <char style="w">kawrngaramchük</char> lowkchow khowm padow kowbüah hownia ang paw dowi tak chekhai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow kingküa ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Nami kung kowi Mosi tek pe Kora mih, “Tharau khe en hai en thumchakuüa mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nakowkowi ngengche kown takla. Now Arawn paw nakowi natawi uowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Enni bowkbowk maikhük towk müa puh kowi tow pe mairing hanow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than enni nathe pe kown, now nami dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi natowkah kown. 250 ia mih aluchowuüa hailawm Arawn enchi paw naiawng natawi chang kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Naiawng rakowi auai rau dow Mosi laiklow iawng chowlowkkow kowh maikhük towk müa puh kowi tow pe mairing hanow the pe nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than khai. Nami pawla hanow Mosi hai Arawn iüah hailawm taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e kowiowng büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Now Kora dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi kingküaah kownkow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e aia thumchakuüa kowi kuaah khai bowt. Nakhowk khe amatni bowkbowk pur kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow uang tatüng khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi amaisang ang saita bowk bowt kown. Naiawng rakowi kowbüah hownia lang tahen iüa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Nachenganchepaw Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm now chup Thurai khai. Amatchi tek mih, “Aw Thurai, en dow asak uowi mih chap maten kowh singra chekhai. Chang ngak mih dow lowk iachow taih; lowk iachow ngak rakowi Israeluüa pachenma luk kowi en nakunmarauah kown bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kora hai aia thumchakuüa kowi Thurai ripah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />“Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Kora, Dathan hai Abiram büah kowh tangbung ria hownia pacham tahen büah lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Mosi dow Dathan hai Abiram iüah kowh tangbung kowi kowkowi khai, now Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa paw aia kung tawi krawi khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Israeluüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Maiawngün maru ngakuüa tangbung hownia lang tahen büa diah. Kowbüah kowh uanh tawng mih paw hangkow kak büah; enni che kak hanow kowbüah kowh angak rakowi enni kowi paw nakowngla enni kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Nami laiklow tata hanow maru kawmuüa dow Kora, Dathan hai Abiram büah kowh tangbung hownia lang tahen khai. Nakhowk khe Dathan hai Abiram iüah dow amatchi kowh masi chauüa hailawm uang lawt hanow tangbung plawt re-e uang iowng büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Sünta büah, ang changah mih lup srui ang matia sak nau hown kowh ang changah mih nadowi; CHAKRAMANG uang chin ang kowh ang chang mih chekhai. Ang kowh laiklow nowm bow nowm dowi bow mih maiawng enni natuk kown: <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Maiawngün maru-uüa che maru kowng iawng tawi kowng khai, now kowng khe paw lang taklowi dowi hanow CHAKRAMANG uang chin ang mih nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG che amatni luk kowi alangma changah khai, now krawng che awr talak phak now amatni kowh uowi mih srui kowi hai amatni kowi singlingma iawnta bowk khai hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi nü büah klowk büah dowi rakowi chekhai pami enni natuk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Now Mosi kowh lai chur hown akrowksang Dathan hai Abiram iüah kowh kimchakuüa iowngra kowi kowh krawng dow awr talak phak khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />Nami krawng dow Kora kowh thumchakuüa maten kowi hai amatni kowh uowi mih srui kowi iawnta bowk khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Amatni dow amatni kowh uowi mih srui hailawm krawng dawng kowi tama rim khai. Now amatni luk kowi nami krawng dow kutplan taplim khai. Amatni dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia hing tama rim khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Amatni kowh plak klow tata now aria aret kowi kowh Israeluüa maten dow hekla plala se powt büah khai. Amatni dow, “A-i kowi paw krawng iawnta a-i kown chowbowt le,” pahai tekla se iowm büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Now 250 ia mih aluchowuüa kowi paw CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh maih uangah now uang kamta bowk khai. Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Uamow Arawn kowh chapa Eleazar kowi kowtek pe diah: Aluchowuüa kam rah re-e kowh maikhük towk müa puh pauang cham pawla lah, now maivia dow alak sangrum re-e pacham kuakah lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maikhük towk müa puh dow chimsaima chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />Maikhük towk müa puh dow chang ngak rakowi kowng miuüa kowh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün puh dow ang pur kowi uang pawla khai bowt rakowi chimsaima chekhai. Naiawngün maikhük towk müa puh dow apachow phengah hanow bawmla phuchuara diah. Nami dow Israeluüa vüi tarip müa amatra pacham chowng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Now maih kamta mih maru-uüa uang pawla mih kri hown kowh maikhük towk müa puh srui dow uamow Eleazar mih krawi pe kuaah khai bowt. Now nathawpla phuchuara bawm müa kownkow naiawngün dow apachow aia pe phengah khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />Naiawng hai aia dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng chang khai bowt. Naiawng chang mih dow Arawn krungchakuüa klen kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi miapaw nam iungma mih maikhük ia towk dowi chekhai pami Israeluüa natukla reng kownkow chekhai. Arawn krungchakuüa klen kowi nam iungma mih maikhük kowtawi towk mih che uowi khai hanow nami maru dow Kora hai athumchakuüa iawng naown kown.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Nami auai ni khe Israeluüa maten dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi plan kamcheah khai iawk. Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi tek pe büah mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa kowi kowngta mih enchi chowtaih,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 16:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Nachenganchepaw Mosi hai Arawn iüah re-e kowh Israeluüa maten dow taklowp taklangra te prakowi haidang pache taklowp taklangra te luk kowi amaisang uangnim uang tamum klum mih khi büah khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra paw uang tatüng mih khi büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Nakhowk khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow taklowp taklangra te pur kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Naiawngün maru-uüa hownia lang tahen iüa diah. Amatni kowi dow kawmat mat ang namitta kown,” pakhai. Nami laiklow tata hanow Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah khai.<verse eid="NUM 16:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Nami kung kowi Mosi tek pe Arawn mih, “En kowh maikhük towk müa puh kowi tow pe mairing hanow the pe nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than diah, now alenma kowkowi hanow maru kawmuüa kowh angak nalawtta pe kownkow kowchang pe lup diah. CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow uang tatüng khai bowt; makowng hawi dow uown tarowng khai bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47-48" />Now Arawn dow Mosi tek iawng aia kowh maikhük towk müa puh kowi tow pe mairing hanow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than the pe khai, now maru kawmuüa prakowi kowiowm khai. Nami takra kowi makowng hawi dow maru kawmuüa pungmadawng kowi tarowng tüng khowk chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow sing reng tak miuüa hai kowng khowk miuüa takra kowi kowiowng khai. Now amatni kowh angak nalawtta pe kownkow Arawn dow nam iungma mih maikhük kowap khai. Nami kung kowi dow makowng hawi mih taing khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 16:47-48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Kora rakowi kowh kowng miuüa klen kowi paw 14,700 ia tak makowng hawi hown maru kawmuüa tawi kowng khai. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Now makowng hawi taing kung kowi dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e Mosi tut-e Arawn kowplan khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Arawn kowh raitua pau mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Israeluüa kowi mami laiklow kowtek pe diah, ‘Laipre chen hownia chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa pauang pawla raitua lowk chi lah. Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow chowlowkkow raitua kowi amatni chowlowkkow kowh ming pacham ruiah lah. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Levi krungchak kowh raitua kowi dow Arawn kowh ming pacham ruiah lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa vüi dow lowk ia e lowk chi raitua nauowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Naiawngün raitua dow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi enni natowah kown. Nami re-e dow enni hown CHAKRAMANG uang takrum reng chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Now uamow pahai CHAKRAMANG lang kraah mih maru kowh raitua kowi dow aram naawm kown,’ pape diah. Nahanow Israeluüa kamche en mih dow ang nataingta kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Naiawngün laiklow maten dow Mosi mih Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe khai. Now laipre chen kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa dow Mosi kowi uang peah raitua lowk chi khai. Naiawngün raitua pungmadawng kowi dow Arawn kowh raitua paw tawi uowi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Mosi dow naiawngün raitua pawla now taklowp taklangra te lak kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowtowah khai.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Now auai ni Mosi dow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowkup khai. Now Levi krungchak hownia Arawn kowh raitua kowi madam ram awr awm mih dow kowkhi khai. Aia dow Arawn kowh raitua kowi aram awr awm mih krowngchow nadowi kowi awr mum, awr pau hai awr uih mih paw khi khai. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Naiawngün raitua dow CHAKRAMANG hownia uang lawtla hanow Israeluüa pur kowi Mosi uang tüng pe khai. Now Israel aluchowuüa dow amatni chowlowkkow raitua pawta khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Arawn kowh raitua dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla ria kowi kowplan towah iawk diah. Nami raitua dow kamche ang miuüa vüi tarip müa amatra naown kown. Nahanow amatni dow nakamche ang kown nadowi bowt, now kowng paw nakowng büah kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng chang khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Naiawngün khi hanow Israeluüa tek pe Mosi mih, “Anging kowng kown towbowt! Anging piak bowk kown towbowt! <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />CHAKRAMANG kowh taklowp taklangra te re-e kowkowi mih maru maten kowng now anging paw nakowng bowk kown towbowt!” pabüah khai.<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowh lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Arawn mih, “Taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh lup chang lawnguan kowi atawi ama uowi mih srui dow en, en kowh chapauüa hai enni Levi krungchakuüa kowi ang natang enni aprek kown. Nachenganchepaw uamowuüa kowh lup chang lawnguan kowi kowh atawi ama uowi mih srui dow en hai en kowh chapauüa kowi chowtaih ang natang enni aprek kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />En matia krungchak Leviuüa kowi uang pawla diah. Amatni dow en hai en kowh chapauüa kowi taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh lup srui pacham tawi khowng enni lah. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Amatni dow en nimkrüa kowi nauowi büah hanow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh lup srui nachang büah kown. Tawkchedow chimsaima mih uanh hai phuchuara re-e tawi ia tatawn büah kown nadowi. Amatni che naiawngün re-e tawi tatawn khai hanow amatni hailawm enni kowi paw nakowngta enni bowk kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Amatni dow natawi khowng en lup chang reng kown; taklowp taklangra te naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow amatni luk kowi nauowi kown. Tawkche Levi chenchap klen kowi dow miapaw nauang ia tawi khowng en kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Israeluüa luk kowi ang kowh kunmaraura naplan tatüngla dowi bowt kownkow taklowp taklangra te hai phuchuara naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow enni luk kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Leviuüa kowi dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia ang lang ruita enni mih chowbowt. Now amatni kowi dow awmrawm sung iawng hai ang peta enni mih chowbowt. Taklowp taklangra te kowi naia changla lup kownkow amatni kowi dow ang tut-e apta khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Nachenganchepaw taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh Lang Chimsai Mih Arah kowi hai phuchuara kowi kowh lup dow en hai en chapauüa chowtaih naia chang kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow uamowuüa kowh lup chekhai. Uamow rah dow ang pe enni mih chowbowt. Uamow klen kowi chimsaima mih uanh re-e uang mih maru kowi dow nakowngta kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowh vüi bak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Arawn mih, “Ang kowi kowh Israeluüa uang pe ang mih chimsaima mih uanap maten luk kowi achang takla iawng nachang kown mih kurdik ang peta en mih chowbowt. Naiawngün chimsaima mih uanap maten en hai en krungchakuüa kowi chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang peta mih chowbowt. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Kawmdi uanap, angak lawt lük müa uanap, aprek sung uanap vüi kowi kowh Israeluüa uang pawla mih uanh srui dow achimsaima chekhai. Naiawngün uanap hownia maih kowi tikla dowi mih srui dow enni kowh vüi bak naown kown. Naiawngün dow en hai en krungchakuüa vüi chowngchowng saksakma vüi bak chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Naiawngün uanh dow arah chimsaima mih kowi enni nacham chaah kown. Tawkchedow kachakuüa ngetchow taih naiung cha kown. Naiawngün dow achimsaima pahai enni natuakah kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />“Amülüngma mih uanap kowi kowh Israeluüa uang pawla mih uanh srui paw en vüi chekhai. Naiawngün dow en hai en krungchakuüa vüi chowngchowng saksakma vüi bak ang peta enni mih chowbowt. Naiawngün uanh dow en hai en kimchak kowi kowh masiuüa kachakuüa bowkbowk naiung cha kown. Tawkche naiawngün uanh dow enni pungmadawng kowi kowh asürlawkma nadowi miuüa chowtaih naiung cha kown.<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />“Israeluüa mih amatni chowlowkkow kheti bakan hownia uih müng pau müng kowi kowh kanrawn sau, grep tui sar hai uih-ak maten ang tut-e nauang pawla kown. Naiawngün kowi kowh lang iung mih srui dow ang nape en kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Ang tut-e kowh Israeluüa uang ap-ah mih luprak müng maten dow enni kowh naown kown. En kimchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh chimsaima uowi miuüa chowtaih naiawngün uanh naiung cha kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia CHAKRAMANG kowi apta mih uanh srui dow en kowh naown kown.<verse eid="NUM 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowh Israeluüa uang ap-ah mih chapa ta maten hai tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala maten dow en kowh naown kown. Nachenganchepaw chapa ta maten kowi mih amatni kowh u-pa kowi en nape klanah ngengche kown takla. Now sürlawkma mih tawncher hownia kowh rik pen mih ala maten kowi paw tawncher iah kowi en nape klanah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Chapa ta kowi dow uang dia kung kowi ala chih khowk hanow khowmta bowkta khowk iawng tai tanga iun hown en nape klanah kown. Tai paiun dik dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah now hamüt gram chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />Nachenganchepaw tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala chah dow chia chepaw, ruapur chepaw, rua chepaw en nape klanah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dow ang vüi lang krata khowk chekhai. Naiawngün tawncher vi dow phuchuara luk kowi en nathetah kown, now asau dow chakkham uanap en nachangla kown. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Amülüngma mih uanap kowi kowh sakowuh nga hai hawmlawm thung nga iawng naiawngün tawncher nga dow en kowh kakbak naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />Ang CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh Israeluüa uang pawla mih chimsaima mih uanap srui dow en hai en krungchakuüa vüi chowngchowng saksakma vüi bak ang peta enni mih chowbowt. Nami dow en hai en krungchakuüa hown kowh chowngchowng saksakma vüi katpaw taklowi dowi bowt mih ang kowh sangbowk laitawm chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Arawn mih, “Israeluüa pren kowi en natawi ka powng dawngthawnguan kown nadowi, now krawng bawn paw en natawi ka powng kown nadowi. Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi ang towbowt en kowh kakbak; ang towbowt en kowh dawngthawnguan.<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />“Lowra chap hamüt bak kowi pabak Israeluüa pe ang mih dow Leviuüa kowi ang peta mih chowbowt. Naiawngün dow taklowp taklangra te kowi chang lup büah mih takcha naka büah kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Kawmat hownia bowt now taklowp taklangra te re-e akeng mih Israeluüa uang ia uang kown nadowk. Amatni che uang khai hanow amatni kowh ngak sung dow amatni nakur kown, now nakowng büah kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi nachang lup kown mih dow Leviuüa chowtaih, now nami lup kowi atawi ama uowi mih sung paw amatni chowtaih naka ripra kown. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi ari arow naown kown. Akeng mih Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi Leviuüa dow natawi ka powng dawngthawnguan kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />Nami takcha dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia kowh hamüt bak kowi pabak uang ap ang mih uanh naka büah kown. Nami dow amatni kowh vüi bak ang peta mih chowbowt. Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, Leviuüa dow akeng mih Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi natawi ka powng dawngthawnguan kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamüt bak kowi pabak Leviuüa nape kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25-26" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami laiklow Leviuüa kowi kowtek pe diah, ‘Hamüt bak kowi pabak CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh Israeluüa uang ap-ah mih dow CHAKRAMANG peta enni mih chowbowt. Naiawng enni ka kung kowi enni kaah mih hownia changah hamüt bak kowi pabak mih dow CHAKRAMANG vüi enni nauang ap kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 18:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Nami uanap dow enni matia kowh üa hai laih hownia kowh luprak iawng, now enni matia küaah mih grep tui iawng CHAKRAMANG nadowk enni kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Akeng mih Israeluüa hownia hamüt bak kowi pabak enni naka kown mih hownia enni paw hamüt bak kowi pabak mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni nauang ap-ah kown takla. Nami enni uang ap ang mih dow uamow Arawn rut kowi enni napeah kown. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Lowra chap enni kaah mih hownia lang iung mih dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kakbak kowi enni napeah kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />“‘Lang iung mih uanh enni peta CHAKRAMANG mih dow enni matia üa hai laih hownia kowh uanh iawng hai kowmatia küaah mih grep tui iawng CHAKRAMANG nadowk enni kown. Now peta kung kowi kowh ta lat mih maten dow enni matia vüi towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Naiawngün dow enni hai enni kowh kimchakuüa lowra re-e naiung cha kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow taklowp taklangra te kowi enni chang lup mih sung chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Naiawngün dow naiawng enni cha chepaw enni kowh aprek nauowi kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow lang iung mih hai lang chimsai mih dow CHAKRAMANG kowi enni peta khowk chekhai. Tawkche naiawng enni rik peah mih dow lowra re-e enni cham chata khai hanow Israeluüa uang ap-ah mih uanap chimsaima mih kowi piakta rakowi enni naka aprek kown, now enni nakowng kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Tachim tasai müa tui thawp krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />“Mami dow ang kowh rirow hownia kowh ana pek chekhai: Aser auowk uowi dowi mih arikchow mih chia iia nauang pawla enchi papum kownkow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe iüa diah. Nami chia iia dow katpaw tang pe laithawn tim dowi tak mih naown kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />Nami chia iia dow uamow Eleazar kowi enchi napeah kown. Now tangbung khup rah uat kowi cham pawla hanow aia pur kowi nami chia iia dow nangenah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Now nami chia vi kowi aia kowh rutchawk nachimah hanow taklowp taklangra te pur prakowi nathetah ranit kat kown. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Nami chia kowh apik, anga, avi hai akih dow aia pur kowi natikah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Naiawngün kam thüm khe mih sidar singh klowk lowk, lawngthow singh kre pakre hai aringma mih lasin sangrum mih maih kowi uamow nawmah kown. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Nami kung kowi dow uamow mih aia kowh khupdip tawngklai nachuta hanow nalu kown takla. Nami kung kowi chiang aia mih tangbung khup rah kowi naia kup kown. Nachenganchepaw aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi tak kown. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Apik, anga, avi hai akih tik mih maru paw ki tikla now aia kowh khupdip tawngklai mih nachuta hanow nalu kown takla, now sat kup dowi mowr aia paw asür alawkma hai nauowi tak kown. <verse eid="NUM 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />Nami kung kowi dow tasür talawk dowi mih maru lowk ia tikla chia pik, anga, avi hai akih mih plawi nakowpaw kown, now nami plawi mih tangbung khup rah uat kowi kowh asaichow mih rah kowi nacham towah kown. Nami plawi dow Israeluüa tachim tasai müa tui nathawpla kownkow natowah kown. Tasür talawk khowk mih kowi nachimsaila kownkow nami tui mih enni natawngah kown. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Tikla chia nga mih plawi kowpaw mih maru paw cham ki towla plawi kung kowi aia kowh khupdip tawngklai mih nachuta kown takla, now sat kup dowi mowr aia paw asür alawkma hai nauowi kown. Nami dow Israeluüa hai Israeluüa tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa vüi chowngchowng saksakma vüi ari arow chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tachim tasai krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />“Cham kakta maru uak mih maru dow ranit ni mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Tasür talawk khowk mih maru dow aia tasür talawk mih hownia sum ni mih ni hai ranit ni mih ni khe tachim tasai müa tui hown natachim tasai kown takla, nahanow aia dow nachimsai kown towbowt. Tawkchedow tasür talawk mih hownia sum ni khe hai ranit ni khe aia che tachim tasai dowi hanow aia mih asür alawkma hai nauowi tak kown. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Cham kakta uak kung kowi kowmatia kowi chimsaiah dowi mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG kowh taklowp taklangra te kowi sürlawkah mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawng mih maru kowi dow Israel chenchap hownia enni nabatta kown takla. Aia dow tachim tasai müa tui hown tachim tasai dowi rakowi asür alawkma nauowi tak kown.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />“Tangbung lak kowi maru kowng khe nakowi kowh uowi miuüa hai kowkup miuüa dow asür alawkma hai ranit ni mowr nauowi kown. Mami rirow dow enni nachünah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Nami tangbung lak kowi kowh puh bia aikam srui paw kümah dowi mih maten dow natasür talawk kown.<verse eid="NUM 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />“Maru saiah mih maru uak chepaw, iawngpa kowng mih uak chepaw krawng kowi takuak hüah mih uak kowi kak mih maru dow ranit ni mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi kown. Now tadupra hai maru hut cham kakta chepaw kak mih maru dow ranit ni mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi kown.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tachim tasai müa tui tawngkeng krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />“Tasür talawk miuüa kowi nachimsaila kownkow tikla chia nga mih plawi puh kowi natowah hanow tuilowng tui mih nathe pe kown. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Nami kung kowi dow chimsaima mih maru nacham paw pe lawngthow singh kre sangrum hanow nami tui kowi nachimah kown, now nami tui dow maru kowng mih tangbung kowi, tangbung lak kowi kowh uowi mih uanh maten hai maru maten luk kowi nakrawi thetah kown. Tadupra, maru hut, maru saiah mih maru uak hai iawngpa kowng mih uak cham kakta mih maru kowi paw nami tui mih enni nathet pe kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Tasür talawk mih maru kowi dow sum ni mih ni hai ranit ni mih ni khe tasür talawk dowi mih maru nami tui nathet pe kown. Now ranit ni mih ni khe tasür talawk mih maru dow aia kowh khupdip tawngklai nachuta hanow nalu kown takla. Nahanow nami ni sat kup hownia dow aia mih nachimsai kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />Tasür talawk kung naiawng tachim tasai dowi mih maru kowi dow Israel chenchap hownia enni nabatta kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kowmatia kowi chimsaiah dowi mih dow CHAKRAMANG kowh taklowp taklangra te kowi sürlawkah mih chekhai. Aia luk kowi dow tachim tasai müa tui thet pe dowi rakowi aia dow asür alawkma chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma pat Israeluüa vüi ari arow naown kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 19:21">“Nami tachim tasai müa tui krawi thet mih maru paw ki thet kung kowi aia kowh khupdip tawngklai mih nachuta kown takla. Nami tachim tasai müa tui kowi kak mih maru paw sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Asür alawkma mih maru krawi kakah mih uanh srui paw natasür talawk kown. Now nami maru kakah mih uanh kowi kak mih maru paw sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Miriam kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt mih 40 ning kowi kowh la uown khe Israeluüa mih Zin pape mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowtowm khai bowt, now nakowi kowh Kades marow re-e kowuowi büah khai. Nakowi uowi khe Miriam dow kowng khai, now aia kowi dow nakowi dupah khai.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Huamang hownia kowh tui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Nakowi dow tui uowi dowi rakowi Israeluüa mih takrüpah hanow Arawn hai Mosi iüah kowi kamcheah khai. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Amatni dow Mosi kowi nangah se tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG pur kowi anging kowh tainau-uüa kowng khe anging paw tawi kowng bowt panü dow iung diah! <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa kowi mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi en uang tuk pawla khai? Anging hailawm anging kowh tawncher hawmh pacham kowng bowk lah pakowh bow? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Aigupta hownia uang lawtla anging hanow tawngplawng kowchow maiawng mih angakma mih arah kowi en uang tuk pawla anging khai? Makowi dow luprak paw uowi dowi, uidut uih paw uowi dowi, grep rui paw uowi dowi, now dalim uih paw uowi dowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi khamah kown mih tui khowm padow uowi dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Naiawng rakowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah mih maru kawmuüa hownia powt khai. Now taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e kowkowiah hanow krawng kowi tabawk krawm iüah khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow amatchi pur kowi uang tatüng khai. <verse eid="NUM 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Mosi, sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi kowh uowi mih raitua kowpawla diah. Now en hai en taimow Arawn enchi mih Israeluüa kowi arasang kowkua kowlawmah diah. Pai iow, paimi re-e huamang uowi lowk. Paimi huamang hownia tui nauang towkla kownkow maru kawmuüa pur kowi huamang kowi dow peah ana diah. Nahanow paimi huamang hownia tui nauang towk kown towbowt. Naiawng hai maru kawmuüa hown amatni kowh tawncher hawmh nakhamah kown mih tui dow huamang hownia en nauang pe lawtah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Now CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng rowprowp Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG pur hownia nami raitua pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow nami huamang re-e maru kawmuüa kowi arasang kuaah khai. Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe mih, “Kingküa dawma miuüa low, sünta büah. Tawngplawng kowchow enni nakhamah kown mih tui mami huamang hownia angching uang pe lawtah kown takla khai?” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Now Mosi mih aia kowh raitua hown nami huamang kowi tupah pre kat khai; nahanow tui dow ahuma uang lawt iualua khai. Now Israeluüa mih amatni kowh tawncher hailawm nami tui kham büah khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Nachenganchepaw Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang luk kowi enchi neplawng nesak dowi chekhai, now ang dow chimsaima pami Israeluüa pur kowi enchi tüng pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi ang napeah kown mih pren kowi naiawngünuüa kowi enchi kowia pawla kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Nami re-e kowh arah dow Meriba tuikuam pahai chap pe ming khai. (Meriba pami dow “Tanang” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami re-e Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG hown tanang khai, now CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh chimsaira amatni kowi uang tüng pe khai.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Edawmuüa pe mangah dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Kades marow re-e Israeluüa uowi reng tak khe Mosi dow Edawm pren kowi kowh mang tut-e kowchin maru khai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, “Anging dow en kowh tainau Israeluüa chekhai. Anging kowh akawm akrat lawnguan dow enni tuk. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Anging kowh pipu-uüa dow Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi khai, now nakowi dow ning akrama anging kowuowi khai. Aigupta prenchakuüa dow anging hai anging kowh pipu-uüa luk kowi chang anowng apowng khai. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />Naiawng rakowi aprüa aiiama hai CHAKRAMANG tut-e anging lü khowng khai. Aia dow anging awr lü mih ta hanow aia kowh <char style="w">kramamu</char> kowi uang chin anging khai, now Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla anging khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 20:16">“Kawmat dow en kowh pren sünghi re-e Kades marow kowi anging uowi. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Sakrauma hown en kowh pren iawng pe mang anging diah. Enni kowh üa, laih hai grep krum iawng anging cham mangla kown nadowi, now tuikuam hownia tui khowm padow anging khamla kown nadowi. En kowh pren klen dowi mowr dow tiama rowkrowk taih anging namang kown; akeng prakowi anging cham mangla kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Nachenganchepaw Edawm kowi kowh mang krawi klangah mih, “Anging kowh pren iawng enni uang ia mang kown nadowi. Enni che uang mang hanow anging nahawt dowk enni tasen kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Israeluüa krawi plan tek pe iawk mih, “Tiama rowkrowk taih anging mang kown. Anging hai anging kowh tawncher hawmh che en kowh pren hownia khamla tui hanow asung dow anging napela enni kown taih. En kowh pren iawng mang krowngchow kown mih taih anging nau. Nami klen kowi tawngpaw anging nau dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Edawmuüa krawi plan tek pe iawk mih, “Anging kowh pren iawng enni naia mang kown nadowi,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 20:20">Nami kung kowi Edawmuüa dow Israeluüa kowi nauang dowkah tasen kownkow amatni kowh <char style="w">siphai</char> akürma miuüa hown uang lawt khai. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Edawmuüa dow amatni kowh pren iawng pe mangah dowi rakowi Israeluüa dow akeng prakowi cham mang büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arawn kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Israeluüa dow Kades marow hownia lawt hanow Hawr hungh kowi kowtowm büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Hawr hungh dow Edawm pren sünghi re-e chekhai. Nakowi uowi reng tak khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Arawn dow nakowng hanow aia pipu-uüa tut-e nauowi kown takla. Israeluüa kowi kowh ang peah mih pren kowi aia natawi ka kup kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Meriba tuikuam lawnguan kowi ang kowh ana pek enchi chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Arawn hai achapa Eleazar kowi pawla now Hawr hungh luk kowi kowpün diah. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Nakowi dow Arawn kowh uamow tawnguat klüpta pe hanow achapa Eleazar kowi khup pe diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Arawn dow kowng hanow aia kowh pipu-uüa tut-e nauowi kown takla; aia dow nami hungh luk kowi nakowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng chang khai. Israeluüa pur kowi amatni sum ia trui Hawr hungh kowi awr pün khai. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Nakowi dow Arawn kowh uamow tawnguat Mosi klüpta pe hanow achapa Eleazar kowi khup pe khai. Now Arawn dow nami hungh chut kowi kowng khai bowt. Nami kung kowi Mosi hai Eleazar iüah dow hungh hownia uang dowm khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Arawn kowng khai bowt pami satang tata hanow Israel pachenma Arawn vüi 30 ni mowr <char style="w">uowila uiting uangtak</char> khai.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Arad marow mang kowi nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Arad marow dow Kanan pren mrawkphak prakowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma kowi chekhai. Nami marow kowi kowh mang dow Atharim kua pra kowh tiama iawng Israeluüa uang haimang mih satang ta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Israeluüa kowi kowkrawi senah hanow khümla sangrum khai. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tut-e takham se Israeluüa tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, en che Arad marowchakuüa kowi anging rut kowi apta anging khai hanow amatni hai amatni kowh marow maten asaima anging napiakta pe kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow naiawng Israeluüa awr lü khowng mih hawt sünta pe khai, now Kananuüa kowi nanowngta kownkow aia mih Israeluüa kowi tawi khowngah khai. Nahanow Israeluüa dow Kananuüa hai marow maten asaima piakta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow Hawrma pahai chap pe khai. (Hawrma pami dow “Piakra” pami chekhai).<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kri hown kowh rua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4-5" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Edawm pren iawng nakowpat kownkow Hawr hungh hownia lawt hanow sata Rik pra kowh tiama iawng mang büah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow kowplan tapat iawk kown mih nau dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nowng town sak dowi bowt kowh tiama rawng kowi chowreng tak khe Thurai hai Mosi iüah kowi kamcheah khai. Amatni tek mih, “Aigupta pren hownia tawngplawng kowchow enchi uang tuk lawtla anging khai; mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi anging pakowng lah pakowh bow? Mami re-e dow kawm paw uowi dowi, tui paw uowi dowi! Mami manna kawm anging silik khi khai bowt!” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 21:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow akru uowima mih rua Israeluüa tut-e uang chin pe khai. Naiawngün rua chawtra hownia Israeluüa mih ahuma kowng khai. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tut-e maru kawmuüa kowkowiah now tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG hai en luk kowi kingküala mih lai anging tek mih hown anging changta angak khai nowm. Kawmat mih maiawngün rua nahenta anging kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü anging diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Mosi dow maru kawmuüa vüi CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü khai.<verse eid="NUM 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Kri hown thawp rua rup lowk diah, now phük pe achüng lowk hanow achüng chem kowi nami rua rup towah diah. Rua chawtah mih maru dow nami rua rup prakowi pacham mü lah, nahanow aia dow nasing kown taih,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Now Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG tek iawng chang khai bowt. Aia dow kri hown thawp rua rup lowk hanow achüng luk kowi towah khai. Nami hownia bowt now rua chawtah mih maru mih nami rua rup prakowi haimü hanow kowng dowk chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moab pren prakowi tarowng mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih nami süngrüp süngkangma hownia lawt hanow Awbawt pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Nami kung kowi dow Awbawt pami arah hownia lawt büah hanow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Ie-Abarim pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. Ie-Abarim dow Moab pren satlawt pra kowh süngrüp süngkangma kowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Nami kung kowi dow Abarim hownia lawt büah hanow Zered lawngrawi kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Nami kung kowi dow Zered lawngrawi hownia lawt büah hanow Arnawn aw paipra pown kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. Arnawn aw uowi mih dow Amawruüa pren hownia kowh haitachawn mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi chekhai. Arnawn aw mapra pown kowi uowi mih dow Amawruüa pren, now paipra pown kowi uowi mih dow Moabuüa pren chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14-15" />CHAKRAMANG Kowh Tasen Bowih kowi arui uowi mih, “Arnawn aw hai nami kowi kowh uang mawr mih aw ün, aw ria kowi kowh rak ün, Ar marow prakowi kowh uowi mih Sufa süng kowi kowh Vaheb marow ün dow Moab pren sünghi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 21:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Arnawn aw pang hownia plan lawt hanow Israeluüa mih Beer pami tuikuam re-e kowting büah khai. Nami tuikuam re-e uowi khe Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Maru kawmuüa kowi arasang kuaah diah; amatni kowi ang napeah tui kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa dow maiawng tek meng khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">“Aw tuikuam, tui atekma uang awr uowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:17">Israeluüa low, mami tuikuam vüi kowi tek meng büa diah.<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Mami tuikuam dow pren kruitown miuüa ana hown kowh thaiah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">mami dow maru iukuüa tawk pe raitua kowh pe thawpah mih chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih nami arah hownia lawt hanow Matana pami arah kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19-20" />Nami arah hownia Nahaliel pami arah kowi kowkowi büah khai, now nami hownia Bamawt pami arah kowi kowkowi büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Moab pren kowi kowh lawngrawi kowi kowkowi büah khai. Nami lawngrawi re-e kowh Pisga hungh lang lowng mih hownia dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Jesimawn pape mih arah haikhi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 21:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amawruüa hai Basanuüa kowh mang kowi nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Moab pren kowi kowh lawngrawi hownia lawt büah khe Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun tut-e Israeluüa kowrik phowng pe satang khai. Mang Sihun kowi Israeluüa krawi tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“En kowh pren iawng pe mang anging diah. Enni kowh üa, laih hai grep krum iawng anging cham mangla kown nadowi, now tuikuam hownia tui khowm padow anging nakhamla kown nadowi. En kowh pren klen dowi mowr dow tiama rowkrowk taih anging namang kown; akeng prakowi anging cham mangla kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Nachenganchepaw mang Sihun dow aia pren iawng Israeluüa kowi pe mangah dowi chekhai. Aia dow aia kowh siphai maten kowi pawla now Israeluüa kowi kowhawt senah kownkow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkowi khai. Aia dow Jahaz marow kowi kowkowiah now Israeluüa hown kowdowk tasen khai. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Nami tasen kowi aia kowi dow Israeluüa nowngta khai, now aia kowh pren dow tawngphak pra kowh Arnawn aw hownia mrawkphak pra kowh Jabawk aw mowr Israeluüa powngta pe khai. Nachenganchepaw Amawnuüa kowh pren dow Israeluüa nowng powngla dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Amawnuüa dow amatni kowh pren sünghi mih akhawtma chawngah khai. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Israeluüa dow Amawruüa kowh marow maten, marow kri Hesbawn pami hailawm ariaret kowi kowh kua maten powngta pe bowk khai, now nakowi dow uowi büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Hesbawn marow dow Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun kowh marow kri chekhai. Naiawngün pren maten dow Arnawn aw mowr alai kowh Moabuüa mang kowi dowkah tasen kowh mang Sihun powngah mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Naiawng rakowi meng sarauüa tekla mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">“Hesbawn kowi uangah now uang thawp marow büah iawk diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:27">mang Sihun kowh marow dow pacham uowi iawk lah.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />Hesbawn marow hownia maih uang lawt hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">Moab pren kowi kowh Ar marow kowi uang kamta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">Arnawn aw pang kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi paw kamta khai.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Uh Moab! En kowh piakra dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Aw Kemaws thurai kowh maru-uüa, enni chum mih chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">Kemaws kowh chapauüa dow cham powt khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">aia kowh chamauüa dow mang Sihun tut-e takhang khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />Nachenganchepaw anging dow Amawruüa kowi nowngta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">Hesbawn hownia Dibawn mowr anging piakta khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:30">Amatni kowi dow Medeba hownia Nawfa mowr anging krawi senah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">amatni kowh marow maten dow anging piakta pe bowk khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow Amawruüa pren kowi uowi büah khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Jazer marow kowi krawi kumü kownkow Mosi kowchin dumiow kung kowi nami marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten dow Israeluüa powngta bowk khai, now nakowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa maten kowi dow prütta büah bowk khai.<verse eid="NUM 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Basan pren pra kowh mangla mih tiama iawng kowmang büah khai. Nami khin khe Basan pren kowi kowh mang Awk dow aia kowh siphai maten pawla now Israeluüa kowi nauang senah kownkow Edrei marow kowi uang hawt uowi khai.<verse eid="NUM 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mang Awk kowi hangkow kram diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh pren hai aia kowh siphaiuüa hailawm aia kowi dow en rut kowi ang apta khowk chekhai. Hesbawn marow kowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun kowi en changah iawng dow mang Awk kowi paw en nachangah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow mang Awk hai achapauüa hown aia kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi saita bowk khai; amatni dow lowk iachow paw ta lat dowi chekhai. Israeluüa dow mang Awk kowh pren paw hing powngta khai.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Mang Balak kowkrawi haw Balam mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Moabuüa kowh dowm kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. Nami dow Jeriko marow hown tatang klowk chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Amawruüa kowi tawng iawng chow Israeluüa changah mih maten dow Zipawr kowh chapa mang Balak khi bowk chekhai. Balak dow Moab kowi kowh mang chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Israeluüa kowh maru iun ahuma mih khita hanow Moabuüa dow lainowmma takrow hai kram büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4-5" />Amatni dow Midian prenchak lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Dowm kowi chia cha pram khe kowh iawng a-i kowh uowi mih maten Israeluüa dow napiakta a-i nak kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:4-5">Naiawng rakowi Balak dow Beur kowh chapa Balam kowi nauang hawla kownkow Moab hai Midian prenchak lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi kowchinah khai. (Nami khin khe Balam dow aiamat maru-uüa uowiah mih pren kowi kowh Pethawr marow kowi uowi khai. Nami dow Iufratis aw pang kowi chekhai). Amatni kowi Balak krawi tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren hownia thumchak aiukma mih uang lawt pathum. Amatni dow paprenma kowi krawi tauet plawt khowk, now kawmat dow ang pur kowi uang uowi büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Amatni dow ang lak-e lang kür khai. Naiawng rakowi uangah hanow kowbüah kowi en uang peah piati dit. Nahanow amatni kowi nasenah hanow pren hownia ang nowng prütta tarawng. En peah prasi mih maru dow ka prasi reng, now en peah piati mih maru dow ka piati reng pami ang tuk,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Nahanow Moab hai Midian prenchak lawngtang aluchowuüa dow tarü khai bowt. Israeluüa kowi Balam napeah piati kown mih sung amatni dow Balam vüi pawla pe tangka khai. Amatni dow nakowi kowting hanow Balak krawi tek pe mih maten Balam kowi kowtek pe büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Nakhowk khe Balam tek pe kowbüah mih, “Makowi iak büa diah. CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih tharau khe ang tek enni kown taih,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Moabuüa kowh aluchowuüa dow Balam kim kowi iak khai.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Now Balam tut-e Thurai uangah hanow lüntaah mih, “Naiawngün en tut-e kowh maru-uüa mia chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Balam tek pe Thurai mih, “Moab pren kowi kowh Zipawr kowh chapa mang Balak uang phowng ang satang kownkow uang chinah mih maru-uüa chowbowt. Aia krawi tek ang mih, <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />‘Sünta diah, Aigupta pren hownia thumchak aiukma mih uang lawt pathum hanow paprenma kowi krawi tauet plawt khai. Kawmat en uangah hanow maiawngün maru-uüa kowi uang peah piati diah. Nahanow amatni kowi ang nadowkah tasen hanow ang nowng prütta tarawng,’ pah ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai tek pe Balam mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa hown hangkow tawi diah, now Israeluüa kowi paw hangkow pe piati diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa dow ang peah prasi mih maru chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Auai rau khe Balam awr rü hanow Balak uang chinah mih aluchowuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Enni matia pren kowi plan büah towbowt. Enni tut-e CHAKRAMANG pe tawi ang dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Naiawng rakowi Moab pren kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow kowplan hanow kowtek pe Balak mih, “Anging tut-e Balam uang tawi kown mih nau dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Nami kung kowi Balak dow kowplan chin aluchowuüa khai iawk. Nami leng dow kowrik kowi miuüa lak-e maru iun paw lang kawm khai, now ringkawra lang uowi miuüa chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Balam tut-e kowkowiah hanow kowtek pe mih, “Zipawr kowh chapa Balak krawi tek mih, ‘Sakrauma hown ang tut-e uang diah. Ang tut-e nauang kown mih tawngpaw hang pacham town en lah. <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />Ahuma ang nape en tangka kown taih, now en tek iawng ang nachang en kown taih. En uangah hanow Israeluüa kowi uang peah piati dit,’ pa anging khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Nachenganchepaw Balam tek pe mih, “Kuh hai tai atekma mih aiamat kowh mang kim Balak pe ang khowm padow CHAKRAMANG ana pek klen kowi tawng lup paw ang nowng chang kown nadowi. Aiukma mih lup chepaw, asowmchow mih lup chepaw CHAKRAMANG pe ang ana dowi matchang tawngpaw ang nowng chang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Tawkchedow enni paw makowi iakla büa diah; tawng chow CHAKRAMANG tek ang kown mih ang müah tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Nami iak-e Thurai dow uangah hanow tek pe Balam mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa uang haw en khowk chedow kowtawi pe diah. Tawkchedow ang natek en kown mih krowngchow taih en nachang kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balam hai aia kowh kawrngaramchükma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Auai rau khe dow Balam mih aia kowh kawrngaramchükma luk kowi dau pe uan hanow Moabuüa kowh aluchowuüa hown kowtawi khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Aia dow kawrngaramchükma luk kowi chowm hanow Moab pren prakowi tarü khai bowt, now aia kowh nar paw tawi pre ia khai. Nachenganchepaw aluchowuüa hown Balam tawi mih khita hanow CHAKRAMANG dow kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi Balam kowi nahang pe tiama kownkow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu dow tiama kowi hawt iowng khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Tiama kowi saidawng dowkma hown CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu iowng danglang mih kawrngaramchükma khita khai. Nami khita hanow kawrngaramchükma dow tiama hownia dowm pra cham tapleng khai. Naiawng rakowi tiama iawng nape mangah iawk kownkow Balam dow kawrngaramchükma kowi bawpah khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu dow grep krum pre buk mih takra kowi kowh tiama abiuchow mih kowi hawt iowng khai. Nami tiama pre prakowi dow khah uowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu kowi khita hanow kawrngaramchükma dow khah riaria haimang khai. Naiawng rakowi Balam kowh apra mih klowng dow khah kowi tahik khai. Nakhowk khe Balam dow kawrngaramchükma kowi plan bawpah khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu dow haimang hanow tiama lang biu mih re-e kowiowng khai. Naiawng rakowi kawrngaramchükma dow hing ka mangra dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu kowi khita hanow kawrngaramchükma dow Balam hailawm iu mawk pup khai. Naiawng rakowi Balam dow kunmarau kowh aia kowh raitua hown kawrngaramchükma kowi bawpah khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow kawrngaramchükma kowi lai tek müa kür peah khai. Kawrngaramchükma tek pe Balam mih, “Tawng chow ang changta en khai? Tawng rakowi chow mami hown sum kat en tuk bawp ang khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Balam tek pe kawrngaramchükma mih, “En rakowi abualama mih maru iawng ang phaw khai bowt! Ang tut-e saidawng uowi e dow kawmat mat ang saita en prang bowt diah!” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Kawrngaramchükma tek pe Balam mih, “Sowm hownia kowh en awr chowmla mih kawrngaramchükma nadowi bow ang? Kawmat kowh ang chang en iawng ang rik chang en kakat khowk bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">Balam tek pe mih, “Chang dowi tak,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Nami kung kowi saidawng dowkma hown tiama kowi kramamu hawt iowng mih Balam kowi CHAKRAMANG pe khi-ah khai. Nahanow aia dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm khai.<verse eid="NUM 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tek pe aia mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en kowh kawrngaramchükma kowi en tuk bawpah sum kat khai? En dow nacham kingküa ang kownkow en cham kowi mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nauang hang en kownkow mami re-e ang uang mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Kawrngaramchükma cham süt sum kat mih dow khita ang kowh chekhai. Kawrngaramchükma che cham süt dowi e dow ang kowngta en prang bowt diah. Tawkche kawrngaramchükma kowi dow ang towah sing kown chowdiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Nakhowk khe Balam tek pe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih, “Ang changta ngak khai. En nauang hang ang kownkow tiama kowi en uang hawt iowng mih ang tuk dowi chekhai. Ang kowtawi kown mih che en sak-ih dowi hanow kim kowi ang naplan kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tek pe Balam mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa hown kowtawi taih. Tawkchedow ang pe tek en mih krowngchow taih en nakowtek kown,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Balak kowh aluchowuüa hown Balam mih kowtawi khai.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Balak hawt chum Balam mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Balam uang tawi mih satang tata hanow aia kowi nahawt chumah kownkow Balak dow Arnawn aw pang kowi kowh Moabuüa kowh marow kowi kowkowi khai. Nami marow dow Moab pren sünghi chur kowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Balam hown takrum hanow Balak tek pe mih, “Alenma en nauang kownkow ang uang krawi phowng en satang khowk nadowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow en uang rowi dowi? Ahuma ang nowng pe en tangka dowi tham pabow en ka tuak?” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Balam tek pe Balak mih, “Sünta diah, kawmat dow en tut-e ang uang khowk. Nachenganchepaw ang matia low hown tawng laiklow paw ang nowng tek dowi tham. Thurai pe tek ang mih krowngchow taih ang natek kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Nami kung kowi dow Balam mih Balak hown Kiriat-Huzawt marow kowi kowtawi khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Balak dow chiala sangrum hai rua sangrum hown chang phuchua khai, now aia kowh aluchowuüa hai Balam büah kowi dow pe pe chaknga sangrum khai. <verse eid="NUM 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Auai rau khe dow Balak mih Balam kowi pawla now Bamawt-Baal hungh kowi kowpün khai. Balam dow nami hownia Israeluüa kowi haikhi sangrum khai.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="s">1. Israeluüa luk kowi Balam kowh prasi laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Nami kung kowi Balam tek pe Balak mih, “Mami re-e nachangla phuchua kownkow ang vüi thawp phuchuara ranit klüng diah. Now chiala hai ruapurla ranit pum chi kamrüt ang diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="NUM 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Balak dow Balam tek pe mih iawng rowprowp chang khai. Amatchi dow phuchuara towng kowi chiala hai ruapurla apum chi phuchua iüah khai.<verse eid="NUM 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Nami kung kowi Balam plan tek pe Balak iawk mih, “Changla tikah mih uanap mih tawncher re-e ta uowi diah ba; paipra kowi ang kowkowi tak. Paipra kowi ang kowkowi now ang hown CHAKRAMANG uang takrum chepaw naia. CHAKRAMANG tek ang iawng ang uang tek en kown taih,” pape khai. Nami laiklow tekla pe now Balam dow singh kau uowi dowi mih hungh kowi kowpün khai.<verse eid="NUM 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Nakhowk khe Thurai mih Balam hown uang takrum khai. Balam tek pe Thurai mih, “Ang thawp pe phuchuara ranit klüng hanow naiawngün phuchuara kowi chiala apum, ruapurla apum chi ang changla phuchua khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow Balak tut-e nakowtekah kown mih laiklow Balam kowi sangah khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Balak tut-e kowplan now ang sang en mih laiklow maten kowtek pe diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Naiawng rakowi Balam dow Balak tut-e kowplan khai. Now Balak hown Moab pren kowi kowh aluchowuüa maten tikah mih uanap re-e hawt iowng mih aia kowkhi khai. <verse eid="NUM 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Nakhowk khe Thurai peah mih laiklow dow maiawng Balam uang tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">“Siria pren hownia mang Balak dow uang pawla ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">satlawt pra kowh hungh hownia Moab mang dow uang hawla ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">Aia tek mih, ‘Ang vüi Jakawb kowi peah piati diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">Israeluüa kowi uang tek pe piakra laiklow diah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Amatni kowi tawng iawng chow ang napeah piati kown chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">Amatni dow Thurai peah piati mih maru nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">Amatni kowi tawng iawng chow ang natek pe piakra laiklow kown chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">Amatni dow Thurai tek pe piakra laiklow mih maru nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Pai iow, hungh chut hownia amatni kowi dow ang haikhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">amatni kowi dow hungh luk hownia ang tang müah thüm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">Amatni dow akeng chenchap hownia alakma uowi mih chenchap chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">amatni dow amatni chowtaih Thurai maru pami tuk büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Jakawb kowh krungchakuüa dow sema iawng ahuma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">amatni kowi nowng rüa mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Israel chuprek chaprekuüa dow lainowmma kawm chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">amatni kowi dow tali bak kowi pabak khowm padow nowng rüaah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Pai iawngün maru iunguüa iawng ang pacham kowngah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">kowbüah kowh chowng chur iawng ang kowh chowng pachurah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Nami laiklow tata now Balak tek pe Balam mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang ang khai? Ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi napeah piati kownkow ang uang pawla en mih nadowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow ang ransu-uüa kowi en tuk peah prasi khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Nakhowk khe Balam tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG sang ang mih laiklow tek dowi kowi ang nowng uowi dowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">2. Israeluüa luk kowi Balam kowh prasi laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Nami kung kowi Balak tek pe Balam iawk mih, “Arah sar kowi achi cham kowi diah sik. Nami hownia Israeluüa kowi en nakhi kown. Amatni bowkbowk kowi dow en khi dowi tham. Nachenganchepaw sangrum dow en nakhi kown taih. Nami hownia ang takcha amatni kowi en napeah piati kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Nami laiklow tek pe now Pisga hungh chut kowi kowh Zufim pape mih dowm kowi Balak dow Balam kowi kowpawla khai. Nakowi amatchi dow thawp phuchuara ranit klüng hanow phuchuara towng kowi chiala hai ruapurla apum chi phuchua khai.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Nami kung kowi Balam tek pe Balak mih, “Tikah mih uanap chang rah re-e ta uowi diah ba. Paipra kowi CHAKRAMANG hown ang kowtakrum tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow Balak tut-e nakowtekah kown mih laiklow Balam kowi sangah khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Balak tut-e kowplan now ang sang en mih naiawngün laiklow maten kowtek pe diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Naiawng rakowi Balam dow Balak tut-e kowplan khai. Now Moab pren kowi kowh aluchowuüa maten hown tikah mih uanap re-e Balak büah hawt iowng mih dow aia kowkhi khai. Balam kowi Balak lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow CHAKRAMANG tek en?” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Nakhowk khe Thurai peah mih laiklow dow maiawng Balam uang tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">“Aw mang Balak, awr rü diah, sünta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:18">Aw Zipawr kowh chapa, ang laiklow sünta diah.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Thurai dow lusa maru nadowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">aia dow tek dai lai dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Thurai dow lusa maru hownia kowh uang dia mih nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">aia kowh saktuak dow taklowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Thurai dow tekta iawng chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">aia dow aia takhamta mih iawng chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Israel kowi napeah prasi kown mih ana ang ka khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">Thurai pe ang mih ana dow ang ia klowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />Thurai dow pur prakowi Jakawb ngare kown mih khi pe dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">aia dow Israel vüi kowi akrat pusara natowla pe kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow Israeluüa tut-e tawi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowh mang pahai amatni phuang reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Amatni kowi dow Aigupta pren hownia CHAKRAMANG uang lawtla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:22">CHAKRAMANG dow amatni vüi chiarowngla akürma mih iawng natasen pe kown.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Jakawb kowh maru-uüa luk kowi dow tawng iawng mih piati paw nadowk kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">Israeluüa luk kowi dow tawng iawng mih mantan paw nachang lup kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">Amatni lawnguan kowi dow kawmat maiawng maru natek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">‘Amatni vüi CHAKRAMANG chang pe mih sam mü madiah!’ napa kown.<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Israeluüa dow krangsima iawng lainowmma kür chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">amatni dow mak chak kown chowbowt khe kowh krangsila iawng iowng khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">Amatni dow krangsi iawng makah mih chaknga ki cha dowi mowr tanai dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">makah mih chak vi ki khamta dowi mowr tanai kown nau dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Balak tek pe Balam mih, “Taingta diah. Israeluüa kowi hangkow pe prasi tham bowt, piati paw pek kla dowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Balam tek pe Balak mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek ang iawng ang uang tek en kown taih pami ang tek en khowk nadowi bow?” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">3. Israeluüa luk kowi Balam kowh prasi laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Nami kung kowi Balak tek pe Balam mih, “Chu, arah sar kowi achi cham plan kowi iawk diah sik. Nami rah kowi dow Thurai naawmrawm tarawng, now nami rah hownia dow Israeluüa kowi nape pe en piati tarawng,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Nami laiklow ki tek pe now Balak mih Balam kowi Peur pami hungh luk kowi kowpünla khai. Nami hungh hownia dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Israeluüa uowi rah haiia khi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Nakhowk khe Balam tek pe Balak mih, “Mami re-e nachangla phuchua kownkow ang vüi thawp phuchuara ranit klüng diah, now chiala hai ruapurla ranit pum chi kamrüt ang diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Now Balak dow Balam tek pe mih iawng rowprowp chang khai. Amatchi dow phuchuara towng kowi chiala hai ruapurla apum chi phuchua iüah khai.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG peah prasi kown nau mih Balam tuk hanow aia dow akeng ni khe kowh iawng chang mantan dowi chekhai. Aia dow kung prakowi taplan hanow süngrüp süngkangma prakowi haimü khai. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Now Israeluüa dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchak iawng khup tangbung mih Balam haikhi khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow ka Thurai Lümla khai. <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />Now aia dow Thurai peah mih laiklow maiawng tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">“Mami dow Beur kowh chapa Balam tekah mih laiklow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:3">mami dow achima ang khi-ah mih lawnguan kowi kowh ang tekah mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />Mami laiklow dow Thurai hownia kowh uang ting mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">mami dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai hownia kowh ang taah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:4">Aia kowi dow tabawkah krawm now ang chupah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">now aia dow Israeluüa lawnguan kowi uang tüng ang mukmang khai.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Aw Jakawb, en kowh tangbung dow klangiung lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:5">Aw Israel, en kowh uowi rah dow klangiung lai kowbow!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />Naiawngün tangbung dow alaingma mih thaing singh iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">aw pang kowi kowh bakan iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">Naiawngün tangbung dow CHAKRAMANG chowkah mih sasua singh iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">aw pang kowi kowh sidar singh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Enni dow nakhawr tui kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">enni sawtah mih liu dow ahuma naka tui kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">Enni kowh mang dow Agag mang lak-e nalang kri kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">enni kowh mang dow ringkawra nalang uowi kown.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />Enni kowi dow Aigupta pren hownia Thurai uang lawtla enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">aia dow akürma mih chiarowngla iawng tawi uowila enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">Amatni kowh hut dow aia nadita pe nek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">amatni kowi dow <char style="w">leba</char> sek hown taplawn pat aia naap-ah kown.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />Enni dow krangsila hai krangsima iawng natabawk hanow namawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">Nakhowk khe amia iawng mih chow nauam krüng enni kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">Pe enni prasi mih dow pacham ka prasi lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">pe enni piati mih dow pacham ka piati lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Naiawngün laiklow ta hanow Balak dow Balam luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Aia dow aia matia rut kowi tila se tek pe Balam mih, “Ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi napeah piati kownkow ang uang hawla en mih nadowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow kowbüah kowi en tuk peah prasi khai? Mami hown sum kat khowk Israeluüa kowi en peah prasi! <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Mami hownia kawmat mat kim kowi kowpowt prang! Ahuma ang pe en awmrawm sung kown mih ang tek en khowk chowdiah. Tawkchedow nami awmrawm sung dow CHAKRAMANG pe ka en dowi chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 24:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12-13" />Nakhowk khe Balam tek pe Balak mih, “Kuh hai tai atekma mih kim en pe ang chepaw ang matia low hown aiung angak lup ang ia chang dowi tham pami en uang chinah mih maru-uüa kowi ang krawi tek pe khowk nadowi bow? Now CHAKRAMANG kowh ana klen kowi tawng lup paw ang ia chang dowi tham; CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih chowtaih ang natek kown pami paw amatni kowi ang krawi tek pe khowk manow. <verse eid="NUM 24:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />Kawmat dow ang maru-uüa tut-e ang kowplan kown towbowt; tawkchedow ang plan dowi khowkchow tak khe Israel chenchapuüa mih pur prakowi tawng iawng chow en chenchapuüa kowi nachangah kown mih lawnguan ang tekla en tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">4. Israeluüa luk kowi Balam kowh prasi laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Now aia dow Thurai peah mih laiklow maiawng uang tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">“Mami laiklow dow Beur kowh chapa Balam tek mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:15">Mami dow achima ang khi-ah mih lawnguan kowi kowh ang tek mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />Mami laiklow dow Thurai hownia kowh uang ting mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai hownia dow ang ka <char style="w">prengia</char> khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">Aia kowi dow tabawkah krawm now ang chupah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">aia dow Israeluüa lawnguan kowi uang tüng ang mukmang khai.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />Mukmang kowi kowh ang khi-ah mih iawng kawmat naphaw kown nadowi tak.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Nachenganchepaw pur prakowi CHAKRAMANG nape phawah kown mih ang khi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Jakawb kowh krungchak hownia krek iawng nauang lawt lowk ia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Israel krungchakuüa hownia kruitown mih nauang uowi lowk ia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Aia dow Moabuüa kowh chauüa kowi napawkta pe lu nak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">aia dow Setuüa kowh chauüa kowi paw nadita pe lu nak kown.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Israeluüa dow Edawmuüa kowh pren napowngta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">Amatni dow Edawm pren kowi kowh Seir süng paw nakhünta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:18">Israeluüa dow tasen kiakma mih iawng nachang lup kown.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Jakawb kowh krungchak hownia dow kruitown mih nauang uowi lowk ia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:19">aia dow marow kowi kowh ta sing uowi mih Edawmuüa kowi nakowngta bowk kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">5. Israeluüa luk kowi Balam kowh prasi laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Balam dow Amalekuüa pra haimü hanow Thurai peah mih laiklow maiawng uang tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">“Chenchap maten lak-e Amalekuüa dow lang kür chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">Nachenganchepaw akung kowi dow nakowng büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Nami kung kowi Balam dow Kenisuüa prakowi haimü hanow Thurai kowh laiklow mih maiawng uang tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">“Kenisuüa low, enni dow huamang luk kowi kowh chang kim mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:21">enni kowh uowi rah dow thaulangma chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />Nachenganchepaw enni dow achur kowi napiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">Enni kowi dow Asuriauüa natow enni nar kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Nami kung kowi Balam dow Thurai kowh laiklow maiawng uang tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:23">“Uh! Maiawng Thurai nauang chang kown mih khin nauowi kown lowmow.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:23">Nami khin khe dow naia sing kown mih amia chow nauowi kown chow?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Kittim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kittim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow kawmat kowh Saipras süngdum chekhai.</char></note> hownia <char style="w">chawnlawng</char> ahuma nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">amatni dow Asuriauüa hai Eberuüa kowi nauang senah hanow nanowngta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">nachenganchepaw akung kowi dow Kittimuüa paw nachum bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Nami kung kowi dow Balam mih awr rü hanow kim prakowi mang khai, now Balak paw aiamat tiama prakowi mang khai bowt.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">Thurai hownia Israeluüa tala mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Sittim marow kowi uowi büah reng tak khe Moab prenchak masiuüa hown Israeluüa mih uown chang iang ne khai. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Naiawngün masiuüa maten dow amatni kowh <char style="w">arup aren</char> kowi tawncher hown chang pe phuchua reng chekhai, now uang tawi cha pawi kownkow amatni dow Israeluüa kowi hawla reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa paw tawi cha pawi reng chekhai, now kowbüah kowh arup aren kowi paw tawi chup tawi iia khai. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Naiawng hai Israeluüa dow Peur hungh kowi kowh Baal thurai rup kowi tawi chup tawi iia khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow lün pluplup khai. CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi uang chin pe makowng hawi khai.<verse eid="NUM 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowh aluchowuüa maten kowi uang pawla diah, now ang pur kowi ni-e khe kowngta bowk diah. Nakhowk khe chiang Israeluüa luk kowi kowh ang kowh kunmaraura akraingma mih naprowng kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa kowh tara chet miuüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Peur hungh kowi kowh Baal thurai rup kowi tawi chup tawi iia miuüa maten kowi enni nakowngta ngengche kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Now Mosi hai Israeluüa maten taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e kar hown nguk hown uowi büah khai. Nami khin khe amatni pur iawng Israel chenchap kachakuüa lowk ia mih Midian prenchak masiuüa lowk ia kowi aia kim kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7-8" />Nami dow Eleazar kowh chapa Finehas khita khai. Finehas kowh pu dow uamow Arawn chekhai. Nami khita hanow Finehas dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia lawt khai. Aia dow pawla reh apung hanow nami kachakuüa kowi kowkawi krawi khai, now tangbung lak kowi kowkup hown krowksang nami Israel chenchap kachakuüa hai Midian prenchak masiuüa kowi reh hown mu kowi kowsawtah khai. Nami hownia bowt now Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh makowng hawi mih taing khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 25:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Nachenganchepaw nami makowng hawi hown mih maru iun 24,000 ia kowng khai.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Eleazar kowh chapa Finehas mih Israeluüa luk kowi kowh ang kowh kunmaraura prowngta ang khai bowt. Ang <char style="w">khowrbown dawma</char> iawng aia dow ang vüi kowi khowrbown dawma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang dow khowrbown dawma chepaw amatni kowi ang piakah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Naiawng rakowi Finehas kowi tek pe diah: Aia vüi taking tasangra sangbowk laitawm ang towta pe khowk chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Aia hai aia kowh krungchakuüa dow chowngchowng saksakma naka uamow rah kown; nami dow aia kowi kowh ang tow pe mih sangbowk laitawm chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai khowrbown dawma mih iawng aia dow Thurai vüi kowi khowrbown dawma chekhai. Naiawng hai aia dow Israeluüa kowh angak nalawtta pe kownkow chang pe khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Midian prenchak masiuüa hailawm sawtah now kowngta mih Israel chenchap kachakuüa ming dow Zimri chekhai. Zimri dow Simiawn krungchak kowi kowh aluchow Salu kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Midian prenchak masiuüa ming dow Kawzbi chekhai. Kawzbi dow Midian prenchak Zur kowh chama chekhai. Zur dow aia krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Midian prenchakuüa kowi dow enni kowh ransu pahai enni natuakah reng kown, now amatni kowi dow nasenah hanow enni napiakah reng kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow prengia hown Peur hungh kowi kowh arup pe chupiia enni khai, now Kawzbi kowi paw pe paw enni khai. Kawzbi dow Midian prenchak aluchow mih kowh chama chekhai. Peur hungh kowi enni tawi chupiia arup rakowi enni pungmadawng kowi makowng hawi uang ting khe enni kowngta mih masiuüa dow nami Kawzbi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi plan rüaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Makowng hawi taing kung kowi Mosi hai uamow Arawn kowh chapa Eleazar iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh tasen uangh khowk mih kachakuüa nget kowi amatni kowh krungchak hai kimchak taken iawng akra akrachow rüaah iüa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa uowi mih dow Moab pren kowi kowh dowm nai kowi chekhai. Nami dowm nai dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Jeriko marow hown tatang klowk chekhai. Nakowi uowi khe Israeluüa kowh aluchowuüa kowi Mosi hai uamow Eleazar iüah tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />“Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana iawng pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa maten kowi rüaah büa diah,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:4">Naiawng rakowi aluchowuüa dow Mosi hai Eleazar iüah tek iawng Israeluüa kowi rüaah khai. Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawt mih Israel krungchakuüa ming dow maiawng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reuben kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5-6" />Jakawb kowh chapa ta Reuben hownia kowh krungchakuüa dow Hanawkuüa, Pallu-uüa, Hezrawnuüa hai Karmiuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Naiawngünuüa dow Reuben kowh krungchak chekhai. Reuben krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 43,730 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Pallu kowh chapa dow Eliab chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />Eliab kowh chapauüa dow Nemuel, Dathan hai Abiram büah chekhai. Dathan hai Abiram iüah dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ruiah mih aluchow chowdiah. Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi Kora hai aia thumchakuüa kingküaah mih khin khe amatchi dow tawi kingküaah khai. Amatchi dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküa mih thumchakuüa tut-e tawi tahum khai. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Krawng talak phak hanow Kora kowi iawnah mih khin khe Dathan hai Abiram iüah kowi paw iawnla khai. Now Kora kowh thumchak kachakuüa kowi dow maih kamta 250 ia chekhai. Naiawngün dow Israeluüa nataripla kown mih amat müa chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Nachenganchepaw Kora kowh chapauüa dow nami ni khe tawi kowng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simiawn kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12-13" />Simiawn kowh krungchakuüa dow Nemueluüa, Jaminuüa, Jakinuüa, Zerauüa hai Sauluüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Naiawngünuüa dow Simiawn kowh krungchak chekhai. Simiawn krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 22,200 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gad kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15-17" />Gad kowh krungchakuüa dow Zefawnuüa, Hagiuüa, Suniuüa, Awzniuüa, Eriuüa, Arawduüa hai Areliuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:15-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Naiawngünuüa dow Gad kowh krungchak chekhai. Gad krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 40,500 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19-20" />Juda kowh krungchakuüa dow Selauüa, Perezuüa hai Zerauüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:19-20">Kowbüah klen kowi paw Juda kowh dow Er hai Awnan pami chapa uowi pre ia tak chekhai. Kowiüah dow Kanan pren kowi uowi reng tak khe kowng khai.<verse eid="NUM 26:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Perez kowh krungchakuüa dow Hezrawnuüa hai Hamuluüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Naiawngünuüa dow Juda kowh krungchak chekhai. Juda krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 76,500 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isakar kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23-24" />Isakar kowh krungchakuüa dow Tolauüa, Puvauüa, Jasubuüa hai Simrawnuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Naiawngünuüa dow Isakar kowh krungchak chekhai. Isakar krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 64,300 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zebulun kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Zebulun kowh krungchakuüa dow Sereduüa, Elawnuüa hai Jaleluüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Naiawngünuüa dow Zebulun kowh krungchak chekhai. Zebulun krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 60,500 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manase kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28-29" />Manase hai Efraim iüah dow Josef kowh chapa chekhai. Maiawngün dow Manase kowh krungchakuüa chekhai. Manase kowh chapa dow Makir chekhai. Makir kowh chapa dow Gilead chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:28-29" /><verse number="30-32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30-32" />Gilead kowh krungchakuüa dow Izeruüa, Helekuüa, Asrieluüa, Sekemuüa, Semidauüa hai Heferuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:30-32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Hefer chapa Zelofehad kowh dow chama kangowh; lowk iachow paw chapa uowi dowi chekhai. Achamauüa dow Mala, Noa, Hawgla, Milka hai Tirza büah chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Naiawngünuüa dow Manase kowh krungchak chekhai. Manase krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 52,700 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efraim kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Efraim kowh krungchakuüa dow Suthelauüa, Bekeruüa hai Tahanuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Suthela kowh krungchak dow Eranuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Naiawngünuüa dow Efraim kowh krungchak chekhai. Efraim krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 32,500 ia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:37">Naiawngünuüa Manase hai Efraim krungchakuüa dow Josef kowh chuprek chaprek kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Benjamin kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38-39" />Benjamin kowh krungchakuüa dow Belauüa, Asbeluüa, Ahiramuüa, Sufamuüa hai Hufamuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:38-39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Bela kowh krungchakuüa dow Arduüa hai Namanuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Naiawngünuüa dow Benjamin kowh krungchak chekhai. Benjamin krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 45,600 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dan kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Dan kowh krungchak dow Suhamuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />Naiawngünuüa dow Dan kowh krungchak chekhai. Dan krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 64,400 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aser kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Aser kowh krungchakuüa dow Imnauüa, Isviuüa hai Beriauüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Beria kowh krungchakuüa dow Heberuüa hai Malkieluüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Aser kowh dow Sera pami paw chama uowi lowk ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Naiawngünuüa dow Aser kowh krungchak chekhai. Aser krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 53,400 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naptali kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48-49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48-49" />Naptali kowh krungchakuüa dow Jazeluüa, Guniuüa, Jezeruüa hai Silemuüa chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:48-49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Naiawngünuüa dow Naptali kowh krungchak, Naptali krungchak hownia kowh maru iun dow 45,400 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh maru iun mut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia rüaah mih kachakuüa nget dow bowkbowk kowi 601,730 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />“Chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowi kowh rüaah mih maru iun mut iawng Kanan pren kowi kowh krawng bawn dow nabak pe kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Krungchakuüa lang kawm miuüa kowi dow krawng bawn nalang bak pe hu kown takla, now krungchakuüa lang e miuüa kowi dow krawng bawn nalang e pe kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Nachenganchepaw amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa vüi dow nakuak pe plang hanow nakhowm bowk pe krawng bawn kown. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Krungchak kowi kowh maru iun akawmma chepaw, a-echow chepaw kuak pe plang hanow krawng bawn dow nakhowm bowk pe kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Levi krungchakuüa kowi paw Israel aluchowuüa mih rüala khai. Naiawngün krungchakuüa dow Gersawnuüa, Kohatuüa hai Merariuüa chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Naiawngün krungchakuüa hownia kowh uang uowi miuüa dow Libniuüa, Hebrawnuüa, Maliuüa, Musiuüa hai Korauüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:58">Kohat kowh chapa dow Amram chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Amram kowh masi ming dow Jokebed. Jokebed dow Levi chenchap maru chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh dia rah dow Aigupta pren kowi chekhai. Aia kowh chapa dow Arawn hai Mosi iüah chekhai, now achama dow Miriam chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Arawn kowh chapauüa dow Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar hai Ithamar büah chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Nachenganchepaw Nadab hai Abihu iüah dow ari arow nadowi iawng CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowphuchua nam iung mih maikhük khai rakowi kowng khai.<verse eid="NUM 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Levi krungchakuüa kowi kowh alachow hownia rüaah mih kachakuüa nget dow 23,000 ia chekhai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh ming dow Israeluüa kowh ming tang bowih kowi tawi tarui dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi tawngpaw tawi ka powng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Israeluüa kowi rüa mih khin khe Levi krungchakuüa kowi paw Mosi hai uamow Eleazar iüah rüala khai. Nami khin khe amatni uowi mih dow Moab pren kowi kowh dowm nai kowi chekhai. Nami dowm nai dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Jeriko marow hown tatang klowk chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Nachenganchepaw Sinai hungh uowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi Mosi hai uamow Arawn iüah rik rüa Israeluüa mih khin khe naiawngün maru-uüa dow miapaw tawi uowi dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Naiawngün Israeluüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Amatni dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi nakowng ngengche kown,” pakhai. Now CHAKRAMANG tek iawng uang phaw khai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi dow Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb hai Nun kowh chapa Josua iüah klen kowi miapaw sing dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Zelofehad kowh chamauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Zelofehad kowh chamauüa dow Josef kowh chapa Manase krungchak chekhai. Manase kowh chapa dow Makir, Makir kowh chapa dow Gilead, Gilead kowh chapa dow Hefer, Hefer kowh chapa dow Zelofehad chekhai. Now Zelofehad kowh chamauüa dow Mala, Noa, Hawgla, Milka hai Tirza büah chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Nami masiuüa hawmh dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e Mosi, uamow Eleazar, aluchowuüa maten hai Israeluüa maten pur kowi kowiowngah now tek mih, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />“Anging kowh pa dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi a-i uowi reng tak khe kowng khai bowt. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküa mih Kora kowh thumchakuüa tut-e tawi uowi dowi chekhai. Aia dow aiamat kowh angak rakowi kowng mih chekhai. Aia kowh dow lowk iachow paw chapa uowi dowi. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Anging kowh pa kowh dow chapa uowi dowi pache aia krungchakuüa hownia aming natama kown chekhai bow? Anging kowh pa krungchakuüa hown anging kowi paw pe powngla anging dawngthawnguan diah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Nakhowk khe Mosi mih nami lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi awr phowk pe khai. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />“Zelofehad kowh chamauüa tek mih tawi dowi chekhai. Amatni pa kowh krungchakuüa hown amatni kowi paw en nape powngla dawngthawnguan ngengche kown takla. Amatni mih amatni pa kowh dawngthawnguan bak naka powng kownkow en namüah kaneu kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Lowra maru kala chapa dowi kowi kowng khai hanow aia kowh dawngthawnguan mih aia kowh chamauüa nata powng kown. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Aia kowh che chama paw uowi dowi hanow aia kowh dawngthawnguan mih aia kowh tainau-uüa nata powng kown. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Aia kowh che tainau-uüa paw uowi dowi hanow aia kowh dawngthawnguan mih aia kowh pahi pamauüa nata powng kown. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Now aia kowh che pahi pama paw uowi dowi hanow aia krungchak kowi kowh aia hown lang tasin taken nowm nowm mih maru aia kowh dawngthawnguan nata powng kown. Mami dow Israeluüa nachünah kownkow ang pe en mih rirow chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josua kowi aia kowh arah Mosi ap pe mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami Abarim hungh kowi kowpünah now Israeluüa kowi ang peah mih pren kowmüla diah. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Israeluüa kowi ang peah mih pren khila kung kowi dow en taimow Arawn iawng en paw nakowng hanow en kowh pipu-uüa tut-e nauowi kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow chimsaima pami Israeluüa pur kowi enchi tüng pe dowi chekhai. Zin pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi tui rakowi Israeluüa kingküa ang khai. Nami khin khe tui nauang lawtla kownkow huamang kowi kowklowpah kown mih ang tek enchi chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw naiawng enchi chang dowi kowi huamang kowi enchi kowbawpah khai,” pakhai. (Nami dow Zin pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Kades marow kowi kowh Meriba tuikuam lawnguan chekhai).<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15-17" />Nami laiklow tata hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow maru maten kowh asak pek mih Thurai chekhai. Aia dow Israeluüa luk kowi pacham tow pe aluchow lowk ia lah. Nami aluchow dow maru kawmuüa cham tasen khe nowng kruitown mih pacham na lah. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa dow athing mih uowi dowi mih ruapur hawmh iawng nauowi kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 27:15-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Nun kowh chapa Josua luk kowi dow Thurai Lümla uowi chekhai. Aia kowi dow uang pawla hanow en kowh rut tang pe diah. <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />Aia kowi uamow Eleazar hai Israeluüa pur kowi uang pawla diah, now amatni pur kowi dow aia kowi thawpah aluchow diah. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Aia kowh laiklow Israeluüa maten nachün pe kownkow en kowi kowh ang pe en mih <char style="w">nowng changra</char> dow aia kowi peah ne diah. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Aia dow uamow Eleazar tut-e nakowkowi kown takla, now uamow Eleazar mih aia vüi kowi Urim pami hown CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek nalünta kown. Aia hai Israeluüa maten dow Eleazar tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng namang kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Now Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng rowprowp chang khai. Aia dow uamow Eleazar hai Israeluüa maten pur kowi Josua kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Now CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng Josua luk kowi tang pe rut hanow aia kowh kurdik ap pe khai.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Ni towng kowh uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />“Mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Chakkham uanap nam hown dow ang awmrawm reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi maih kowi tikah mih uanap nachangla kownkow ang khowm bowkta mih akhin kowi enni nauang pawla chakkham reng kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />CHAKRAMANG vüi ni towng kowh maih kowi tikah mih uanap nachangla kownkow paningchow mih ruapurla chah enni nauang pawla pre pum kown takla. Tawkchedow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Lowk mih ruapurla chah dow rau-e khe enni naphuchuaah kown, now alowk mih ruapurla chah dow sat kup khe enni naphuchuaah kown. <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />Nami klen kowi kawmdi uanap chang müa kawmdi lang iung mih aset hown 400 gram enni nauang pawla kown takla. Nami kawmdi kowi dow enni nalawk pe kanrawn sau aset kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Mami ni towng kowh maih kowi tikah mih uanap dow Sinai hungh kowi uowi khe kowh thawpah mih rirow chekhai. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Phuchua ruapurla chah towng khamah mih uanap paw arak aset ngia enni naapla reng kown takla. Nami khamah mih uanap kowi kowh uanh dow CHAKRAMANG vüi taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih viadawng kowi kowh phuchuara kowi enni nakhükah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Alowk mih ruapurla chah dow sat kup khe enni naphuchuaah kown takla. Nami enni phuchua mih khin khe paw rau-e khe kowh iawng kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap enni nachangla kown. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tanai Ni khe kowh uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />“Tanai Ni khe dow paningchow mih ruapurla chah enni naphuchua pre pum kown takla. Nami dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. Nami enni phuchua mih khin khe dow khamah mih uanap chang müa uanh hai kawmdi uanap chang müa kawmdi lang iung mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi paw pre set hown 800 gram enni naphuchuala kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Nami tikah mih uanap dow ni towng kowh uanap klen kowi paw enni nachangah kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lacher khe kowh uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />“Lacher towng kowh auown ni kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala pre pum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah ranit pum enni naphuchua kown takla. Naiawngün tawncher dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12-13" />Phuchua chiala towng kawmdi uanap chang müa kawmdi lang iung mih tali set hown 200 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni naphuchuala kown takla; phuchua ruapurla khe paw kawmdi lang iung mih sum set hown 600 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni naphuchuala kown, now phuchua ruapurla chah towng paw kawmdi lang iung mih aset hown 800 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni naphuchuala kown takla. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 28:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />“Phuchua chiala towng khamah mih uanap chang müa grep tui pre set enni nauang pawla kown takla; phuchua ruapurla khe paw aset hown 300 gram enni nauang pawla kown takla, now phuchua ruapurla chah towng paw aset chi enni naphuchuala kown takla. Nami dow lacher towng kowh tikah mih uanap chekhai. Nami uanap dow ning towng kowh lacher towng enni nachang kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />“Nami klen kowi paw angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi ruala enni nauang pawla apum kown takla. Naiawngün uanap dow ni towng kowh khowmta bowkta mih tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap klen kowi enni nachangah kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Takat Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />“Ning towng kowh la uown kowi lacher laitali ni mih ni khe CHAKRAMANG vüi enni nasun Takat Pawi kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Nami la lacher laitanga ni hownia bowt now The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi nauown bowt kown. Nakhowk khe dow ranit ni mowr the pe tuah dowi mih kawm enni nacha kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Nami The pe tua dowi mih kawm Pawi auown ni khe dow chimsaima mih takua talawm khin enni nasunah kown takla; nami ni dow tawng lup paw enni naia chang kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Nami ni kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chang müa dow chiala pre pum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah ranit pum enni nauang pawla kown takla. Naiawngün tawncher dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20-21" />Phuchua chiala towng kawmdi uanap chang müa kawmdi lang iung mih tali set hown 200 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni naphuchuala kown takla; phuchua ruapurla khe paw kawmdi lang iung mih pre set hown 800 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni naphuchuala kown, now phuchua ruapurla chah towng paw kawmdi lang iung mih aset hown 400 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni naphuchuala kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Nami klen kowi paw angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi ruala enni nauang pawla apum kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Naiawngün uanap dow rau towng kowh khowmta bowkta mih tikah mih uanap klen kowi enni nachangah kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Naiawng hai ranit ni mowr ni towng CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap enni nachang kown takla. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. Naiawngün uanap dow ni towng la towng kowh khowmta bowkta mih tikah mih uanap hai khamah mih uanap klen kowi enni nachangah kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Nami ranit ni mih ni kowi dow chimsaima mih takua talawm khin enni nasunah kown; nami ni dow tawng lup paw enni naia chang kown nadowi.<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chamüng Pawk Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />“Chamüng Pawk Pawi enni sun mih khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG vüi enni naphuchua luprak sar kown takla. Nami ni kowi dow chimsaima mih takua talawm khin enni nasunah kown takla. Nami ni dow tawng lup paw enni naia chang kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Nami ni dow chiala pre pum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah ranit pum hown CHAKRAMANG naawmrawmla enni kownkow tikah mih uanap enni nachang kown. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28-29" />Phuchua chiala towng kawmdi uanap chang müa kawmdi lang iung mih tali set hown 200 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni naphuchuala kown takla; phuchua ruapurla khe paw kawmdi lang iung mih pre set hown 800 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni naphuchuala kown, now phuchua ruapurla chah towng paw kawmdi lang iung mih aset hown 400 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni naphuchuala kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:28-29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Nami klen kowi paw angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi ruala enni nauang pawla apum kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Naiawngün uanap dow ni towng la towng kowh khowmta bowkta mih tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap klen kowi enni nachangah kown mih chekhai. Naiawngün uanap chang müa tawncher dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">Baw Tün Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />“Ranit la kowi kowh ni uown dow chimsaima mih takua talawm khin enni nasunah kown. Nami ni khe dow tawng lup paw enni naia chang kown nadowi. Nami ni dow enni vüi baw tum ni naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Nami ni dow chiala pre pum, ruapurla papum hai paningchow mih ruapurla chah ranit pum hown CHAKRAMANG naawmrawmla enni kownkow maih kowi kowh tikah mih uanap enni nachang kown. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. Naiawngün tawncher dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3-4" />Now kawmdi uanap chang müa paw lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi aiungma mih tali set hown 200 gram chiala hown katsang enni nauang pawla kown takla. Ruapurla hown paw pre set hown 800 gram, now ruapurla chah hown paw apum kowi aset hown 400 gram chi enni nauang pawla kawmdi uanap kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 29:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Nami klen kowi paw angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi ruala enni nauang pawla apum kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Naiawngün uanap dow ni towng la towng kowh khowmta bowkta mih tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap klen kowi enni nachangah kown mih chekhai. Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angak lawt lük müa ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />“Ranit la kowi kowh hamüt ni khe paw chimsaima mih takua talawm khin enni nasunah kown takla. Nami ni khe paw enni naia chang lup kown nadowi, now angak hownia tarip mih krang natüngla kownkow khang pe hawm khükhü enni nakham ngare kown. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Nami ni khe CHAKRAMANG naawmrawmla enni kownkow chiala apum, ruapurla apum, now paningchow mih ruapurla chah ranit pum hown tikah mih uanap pawi enni nachang kown. Naiawngün tawncher dow aser auowk uowi dowi mih naown kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9-10" />Now kawmdi uanap chang müa paw lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi aiungma mih tali set hown 200 gram chiala hown katsang enni nauang pawla kown takla. Ruapurla hown paw pre set hown 800 gram, now ruapurla chah hown paw apum kowi aset hown 400 gram chi enni nauang pawla kawmdi uanap kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 29:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Nami klen kowi paw angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi ruala enni nauang pawla apum kown takla. Naiawngün uanap dow ni towng la towng kowh khowmta bowkta mih angak lawt lük müa uanap, tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap klen kowi enni nachangah kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />“Ranit la kowi kowh lacher laitanga ni khe paw chimsaima mih takua talawm khin enni nasunah kown takla. Nami ni khe tawng lup paw enni naia chang kown nadowi. Nami pawi dow ranit ni mowr CHAKRAMANG vüi enni nasunah kown takla. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh <char style="w">Te Pawi</char> chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Nami ni khe paw CHAKRAMANG naawmrawm enni kownkow chakkham uanap pawi enni nachang kown takla. Nami pawi uown ni khe dow nachangla tikah mih uanap kownkow chiala laisum pum, ruapurla pre pum, now paningchow mih ruapurla chah laitali pum enni nauang pawla kown. Naiawngün tawncher maten dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14-15" />Now chiala maten vüi dow apum kowi kawmdi uanap chang müa kawmdi lang iung mih tali set hown 200 gram kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih enni nauang pawla kown takla. Now ruapurla pre pum mih vüi paw apum kowi pre set hown 800 gram chi, now ruapurla chah maten vüi paw apum kowi aset hown 400 gram chi enni nauang pawla kawmdi uanap kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 29:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />Nami klen kowi paw angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi ruala enni nauang pawla apum kown takla. Naiawngün uanap dow ni towng la towng kowh khowmta bowkta mih tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap klen kowi enni nachangah kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17-34" />“Naiawng hai pawi uown ni kowi kowh iawng ranit ni mowr enni nachang kown. Nachenganchepaw pani kowh pani chiala dow enni na-eta apum chi kown, nahanow pawi chur kowh ni, ranit ni mih ni khe dow chiala ranit pum towbowt enni nauang ap kown. Tawkchedow ruapurla pre pum hai ruapurla chah laitali pum mih dow pawi uown ni khe kowh khowt chi enni nauang ap kown takla. Nami hown dow kawmdi uanap, angak lawt lük müa uanap hai khamah mih uanap ni towng enni nauang pawla reng kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 29:17-34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />“Now raiat ni mih ni khe dow chimsaima mih takua talawm khin enni naplan sunah iawk kown. Nami ni khe paw enni naia chang lup kown nadowi. Nami dow pawi chur ni kowi kowh chimsaima mih takua talawm khin chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Nami ni khe paw CHAKRAMANG naawmrawm enni kownkow chakkham uanap pawi enni nachang kown takla. Nami ni khe dow chiala apum, ruapurla apum, now ruapurla chah ranit pum enni nauang ap kown. Naiawngün tawncher maten paw aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Now chiala, ruapurla hai ruapurla chah apum vüi kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap uang pawla kown takla mih dow pawi uown ni khe kowh khowmta bowkta mih iawng naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Nami klen kowi paw angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi ruala enni nauang pawla apum kown takla. Naiawngün uanap dow ni towng la towng kowh khowmta bowkta mih tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap klen kowi enni nachangah kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />“Takhamta mih rakowi hai kowmatia sak nau hown kowh tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap, khamah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap enni uang chang mih klen paw khowmta bowkta mih pawi ni kowi dow khowmta bowkta mih uanap CHAKRAMANG vüi enni nachangla reng kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Aia kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana maten Mosi mih Israeluüa kowi uang tek pe khai.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">Kham sawi mih kachakuüa kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Israel aluchowuüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng: <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />CHAKRAMANG vüi tawng chü nachang kown kham sawi mih kachakuüa che uowi khai hanow aia takhamta iawng nachang ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kham sawi mih masiuüa kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3-4" />“Cham mang dowi tak mih masiuüa che a-pa kim kowi uowi reng tak khe CHAKRAMANG vüi tawng chü nachang kown mih kham sawi khai hanow a-pa ta mih ni khe hangah dowi now aia takhamta mih iawng nachang ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 30:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Nachenganchepaw naiawng takham mih laiklow ta mih ni khe a-pa che hangah khai hanow aia takhamta mih dow aia chang kla dowi tham. A-pa hangah khai rakowi aia piakta sawi kham lai mih dow CHAKRAMANG nalawtah kown taih.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6-7" />“Now u-pa kim kowi uowi reng tak khe CHAKRAMANG vüi tawng chü nachang kown mih kham sawi mih masiuüa paw nauowi kown. Nachenganchepaw nami masiuüa cham mang kung kowi aia takhamta mih lawnguan ahua tukta mih ni khe hangah dowi hanow aia takhamta iawng nachang ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 30:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Tawkchedow aia takhamta mih ta mih ni khe ahua che hangah khai hanow nami dow aia chang kla dowi tham. Ahua hangah khai rakowi aia piakta sawi kham lai mih dow CHAKRAMANG nalawtah kown taih.<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />“Mamaimow hai ahua khuata mih masiuüa dow takhamta khai hanow aia takhamta iawng nachang ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10-11" />“Ahua uowi mih masiuüa che CHAKRAMANG vüi tawng chü nachang kown mih kham sawi khai chepaw ahua ta mih ni khe ahua hangah dowi hanow aia takhamta iawng nami masiuüa nachang ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 30:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Tawkchedow aia takham mih ni khe ahua che hangah khai hanow nami dow aia chang kla dowi tham. Ahua hangah khai rakowi aia piakta sawi kham lai mih dow CHAKRAMANG nalawtah kown taih. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Masi takhamta mih laiklow kowi pe changah kown mih hai pe changah dowi kown mih alow dow ahua kowh nauowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Amasi takhamta mih ahua tuk khowk chepaw lai dowi hanow amasi takham mih dow ahua tawi nauta pe mih iawng hai nadowkah kown. Amasi takham mih ta mih ni khe ahua che tawngpaw tek dowi hanow ahua tawi nauta pe mih iawng chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Nachenganchepaw amasi takham mih tukta mih ni khe lai dowi kowi pre sum ni kung kowi che ta hangah khai hanow amasi takhamta iawng chang dowi mih ripra dow ahua naka kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Mami dow kham sawi khe kowh vüi Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih rirow chekhai. Mami dow masi huaiu vüi, cham mang dowi tak mih masiuüa hai a-pa vüi kowi kowh rirow chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Midianuüa kowi Israeluüa sat klai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“En kowng dowi rawn khe Midianuüa kowh ripra dow pela diah. Israeluüa luk kowi kowh amatni changta angak mih klai dow peah diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Naiawng rakowi Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Midianuüa kowi kowdowk tasen kownkow enni pungmadawng hownia maru sangrum kowi tasen tawnguat hown tawngah diah. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi Midianuüa kowi pacham peah ripra lah. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia pakrungchak kowi maru iun 1,000 ia chi cham dowk tasen kownkow chinah büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Naiawng rakowi Israel laipre krungchak hownia pakrungchak kowi 1,000 ia chi bowkbowk kowi 12,000 ia uang pawla khai, now naiawngünuüa kowi dow tasen tawnguat hown tawngah khai. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Now Mosi dow 12,000 ia maru kowi cham chinah tasen khai bowt. Cham dowk tasen miuüa hown uamow Eleazar kowh chapa Finehas paw tawi tarü khai. Finehas dow dowk tasen kown chowbowt khe kowh natüngla aklow kown mih baw hai taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh uanh pawla ne khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Cham dowk tasen miuüa dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng rowprowp chang büah khai. Amatni dow Midianuüa hown tadowk tasen hanow kachakuüa maten kowi kowngta büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Amatni dow akeng miuüa kowi iawng Midianuüa kowh mang tanga ia kowi paw kowngla büah khai. Naiawngün manguüa ming dow Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur hai Reba chekhai. Nami klen kowi Beur kowh chapa Balam kowi paw saidawng hown saila büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Amatni dow Midian prenchak masiuüa hai ngeuüa maten kowi khümla now uang pawla büah khai. Nami klen kowi chia, rua, ruapur hai dawngthawnguan srui uang rupla büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Midianuüa uowiah mih marow maten hai marow uat kowi kowh tangbung khup rah maten paw towkla pe büah bowk khai. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11-12" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni khümla mih maru maten hai tawncher hown uanh srui pawla now Mosi, uamow Eleazar hai Israeluüa maten tut-e uang plan büah khai bowt. Nami khin khe Israeluüa uowi mih dow Moab pren kowi kowh dowm nai kowi chekhai. Nami dowm nai dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Jeriko marow hown tatang klowk chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 31:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Now Mosi, uamow Eleazar hai Israel aluchowuüa maten dow uang mang tasen miuüa hown kowtakrum kownkow tangbung khup rah uat kowi kowkowi büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14-15" />Israel siphai hawmh pungmadawng kowi dow 1,000 ia luk kowi hai 100 ia luk kowi aluchow uowi lowk ia chi chekhai. Tasenra hownia kowh uang mang mih naiawngün siphai aluchowuüa kowi dow Mosi kunmarauah khai. Mosi tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawngün masiuüa maten kowi enni saila dowi? <verse eid="NUM 31:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />Peur hungh kowi tawng chow own mih enni tamata khai bow? Balam kowh prengia hown naiawngün masiuüa hawmh chowbowt dow CHAKRAMANG hownia cham plengla enni mih; naiawngün masiuüa rakowi chowbowt dow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa luk kowi makowng hawi uang kla mih. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Naiawng rakowi taphua taiua khowk mih masiuüa maten hai kachakuüa chah maten kowi dow kawmat saita büa diah. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Nachenganchepaw taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa maten kowi dow enni matia vüi towah büah taih.<verse eid="NUM 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />“Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh sai maru mih maten hai kakta uak mih srui dow ranit ni mowr tangbung khup rah uat kowi nauowi kown takla tak. Now sum ni mih ni hai ranit ni mih ni khe enni matia hai enni uang khümla mih masiuüa hawmh kowi enni nachimsaiah kown. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Nami klen kowi enni uang kala mih dawnguan hai chak pik ün, singh hai rua pawi hown kowh thawpah mih uanh ün enni nachimsaiah bowk kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Now cham dowk tasen mih siphaiuüa maten kowi uamow Eleazar tek pe mih, “Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana maiawng chekhai: <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22-23" />Kuh, tai, kri, lawngha, saingpru, khema hai maih kowi kowh kam naklak dowi mih uanh srui dow enni nachimsaiah kownkow maih kowi enni naawpah kown. Now maih hownia khowngta kung kowi paw tachim tasai müa tui hown enni nachimsaiah kown takla. Now maih kowi kowh kam mih chap maten paw tachim tasai müa tui hown enni nachimsaiah kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 31:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Ranit ni mih ni khe dow enni kowh tawnguat enni nachuta kown, now enni chimsai kown towbowt. Nami kung kowi dow tangbung khup rah kowi enni uang nowng uang kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taret uanh mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26-27" />“Tasenra hownia kowh uang khümla mih maru iun hai uang kala mih tawncher maten uamow Eleazar hai Israel aluchowuüa enni mih rüaah hanow changah pre bak diah. Now pre bak mih kowi pabak dow cham dowk tasen mih siphaiuüa maten kowi pe pawah diah, now pabak mih dow tawi tarü tasen dowi miuüa maten kowi peah diah. <verse eid="NUM 31:26-27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Now cham dowk tasen mih siphaiuüa vüi bak kowi kowh maru hai tawncher maten dow 500 kowi lowk chi CHAKRAMANG vüi nalang towta kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />Now naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG vüi uamow Eleazar rut kowi en naap pe kown. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Now tawi tarü tasen dowi miuüa vüi bak kowi kowh maru hai tawncher maten dow 50 kowi lowk chi en nalang towah kown. Now naiawngün dow taklowp taklangra te mingkhet mih Leviuüa rut kowi en naap pe kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng rowprowp Mosi hai uamow Eleazar iüah dow lup maten changah khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Tasenra hownia kowh siphaiuüa uang khümla mih maten kowi rua hai ruapur dow 675,000 pum, <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33-35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33-35" />chia dow 72,000 pum, kawrngaramchük dow 61,000 pum, now taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa dow 32,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 31:33-35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36-40" />Cham dowk tasen mih siphaiuüa vüi bak kowi kowh rua hai ruapur dow 337,500 pum, chia dow 36,000 pum, kawrngaramchük dow 30,500 pum, now taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa dow 16,000 ia chekhai. Nami hownia CHAKRAMANG vüi bak lang towta mih rua hai ruapur dow 675 pum, chia dow 72 pum, kawrngaramchük dow 61 pum, now taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa dow 32 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 31:36-40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Aia kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi bak pawah hanow uamow Eleazar rut kowi ap pe khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42-43" />Tawi tarü tasen dowi miuüa vüi bak kowi kowh rua hai ruapur dow 337,500 pum, <verse eid="NUM 31:42-43" /><verse number="44-46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44-46" />chia dow 36,000 pum, kawrngaramchük dow 30,500 pum, now taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa dow 16,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 31:44-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Now tawi tarü tasen dowi mih Israeluüa vüi bak kowi kowh malauüa hai tawncher hownia paw 50 kowi lowk chi pawah now CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng taklowp taklangra te mingkhet mih Leviuüa kowi Mosi peah khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48-49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48-49" />Nami kung kowi siphai hawmh kowi kowh 1,000 ia luk kowi kowh aluchow hai 100 ia luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Mosi tut-e kowkowiah now kowtek pe mih, “Anging dow en kowh naruüa chekhai. Anging krüa kowi kowh siphaiuüa kowi anging rüaah pache lowk iachow paw tasenra kowi kowng dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 31:48-49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Naiawng rakowi tasenra hownia kowh anging uang kala mih kuh hown kowh harkowi, kuaiseh, <char style="w">mur</char> uowi mih rutbüt, ramseng hai kuh leng maten kawmat anging uang pawla khai. Maiawngün uanh dow anging kowh angak lawt lük müa CHAKRAMANG vüi ap-ah kown anging nau,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Nakhowk khe Mosi hai uamow Eleazar iüah mih siphai aluchowuüa hownia naiawngün kuh hown kowh tatawng müa uanh maten hawt paw iüah khai. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Siphai aluchowuüa hownia hawt pawah now CHAKRAMANG vüi Mosi hai uamow Eleazar iüah ap-ah mih kuh dow bowkbowk kowi adik 190 set chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Now cham dowk tasen mih siphaiuüa maten paw chowlowkkow vüi kuh hown kowh tatawng müa uanh uang rupla bowk chekhai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow amatni kowh uanh mih aluchowuüa iawng CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi apek kla dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Mosi hai uamow Eleazar iüah dow siphai aluchowuüa uang pawla mih kuh hown kowh uanh srui hawt paw iüah khai. Now aia kowh maru Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG natuakla reng kownkow naiawngün uanh dow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi towah iüah khai.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi kowh süng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1-2" />Jazer hai Gilead süng kowi kowh kaurawng dow tawncher thing rah lainowmma iung chekhai. Nami süng khita hanow Reuben hai Gad krungchakuüa dow nami süng kowi nauowi kown mih lainowmma nau büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh dow chia, rua hai ruapur tawn ahuma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Mosi, uamow Eleazar hai Israel aluchowuüa kowi tek pe mih, <verse eid="NUM 32:1-2" /><verse number="3-5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3-5" />“Atarawt, Dibawn, Jazer, Nimra, Hesbawn, Eleale, Sebam, Nebo hai Beawn pami marow maten dow CHAKRAMANG pe powng a-i khai. Maiawngün arah dow tawncher thing rah aiungma chedow makowi pe uowi anging towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging kowh dow tawncher hawmh ahuma chekhai. En che saksing sana anging khai hanow mami en naruüa kowi maiawngün arah dow dawngthawnguan iawng hai pe anging diah. Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi hauang pawla anging diah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:3-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Gad hai Reuben krungchakuüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Enni kowh tainau-uüa cham dowk tasen mih khin khe makowi enni ta uowi phülü kown tiah? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />CHAKRAMANG pe enni mih pren kowi nakowkowi kown mih sakkraingra enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi tawngplawng kowchow enni tuk piakta pe khai? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Kades-Barnea kowi uowi khe CHAKRAMANG pe a-i mih pren nakowkumü kownkow enni kowh pipu-uüa kowi ang kowchinah khai. Nami khin khe kowbüah paw kawmat kowh enni iawng rowprowp chang büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Amatni dow Eskawl lawngrawi mowr kowkrawi kumüla hanow uang plan büah khai. Amatni dow uang ting now CHAKRAMANG pe a-i mih pren kowi nakowkowi kown mih sakkraingra Israeluüa kowi uang piakta pe khai. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow nami ni khe amatni kowi lainowmma kunmarauah khai. Now aia dow takham se tek mih, <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‘Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah kowi napeah kownkow ang khamah mih pren dow Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawt miuüa pungmadawng kowi 20 ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh maru maten natawi ka khi kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang laiklow achima chün ang büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Keniz krungchak Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb hai Nun kowh chapa Josua iüah chowtaih nami pren dow naka khi kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kowiüah dow ang kowh laiklow achima chün iüah khai,’ pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi towta a-i hüah khai. Aia mik kowi kowh angakma miuüa kowng bowk dowi mowr aia dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi 40 ning mowr krawi pe len a-i panglang khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />“Enni dow maru ngak chekhai. Enni paw enni pipu-uüa changla mih lup ngak iawng enni plan chang khai iawk. Israeluüa luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kunmaraura dow enni pe huah ngamlam khai. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Enni che aia laiklow chün dowi hanow khaleng paw mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi CHAKRAMANG natowta a-i hüah iawk kown chaw. Maiawngün maru-uüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow enni rakowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Nakhowk khe Reuben hai Gad krungchakuüa mih Mosi re-e kowtatawnah now tek pe mih, “Anging kowh tawncher uowi rah kim hai anging kowh masi chauüa uowi rah marow krowngchow taih makowi thawpla kown anging nau. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Nachenganchepaw anging matia dow Israeluüa maten chowlowkkow uowi rah kowi ting dowi mowr tasen tawnguat khupma hown amatni pur kowi rik mang hanow natawi saah kown taih. Amatni kowi naiawng anging tawi sa mih khin khe anging kowh kimchakuüa kowi mami prenchakuüa uang nowng senla dowi kownkow tap uowi mih marow kowi towla krowngchow kown anging nau. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Israeluüa maten chowlowkkow dawngthawnguan bak ka dowi mowr dow makowi anging nauang plan kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow satlawt prakowi che en pe uowi anging hanow Jawrdan aw satkup prakowi dow Israeluüa hown anging tawi paw dawngthawnguan bak dowi bowt tham,” pabüa khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20-21" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Mosi tek pe mih, “Enni che tasen tawnguat khupma hown Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi tawi khai, now CHAKRAMANG pur hownia aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi prütta bowk dowi mowr enni tawi khowng tasen khai hanow <verse eid="NUM 32:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh pren CHAKRAMANG pe powngta a-i bowk kung kowi dow makowi enni nauang ia plan kown taih. Nakhowk khe dow CHAKRAMANG hai Israeluüa vüi kowi kowh enni kowh kurdik nachur kown towbowt. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG alow hown mami pren dow enni kowh dawngthawnguan bak nachowng kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />Nachenganchepaw naiawng che enni chang dowi hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak enni chang mih chekhai. Nami angak sung dow enni naka ngengche kown pami tukah büa diah. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Enni kowh tawncher uowi rah kim hai enni kowh masi chauüa vüi marow enni ia thawpla pe kown taih. Tawkchedow enni takhamta iawng enni nachang ngengche kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Nakhowk khe Reuben hai Gad krungchakuüa tek pe Mosi mih, “En dow anging kowh chakramang chekhai; anging dow en kowh nar chowtaih. En pe anging mih ana maten anging nachün kown taih. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Anging kowh masi chauüa hai anging kowh tawncher hawmh chowtaih mami Gilead süng kowi kowh marow maten kowi nata uowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Nachenganchepaw anging dow en tek anging iawng tasen tawnguat khupma hown natawi dowk tasen kownkow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi Jawrdan aw natawi pown kown taih,” pabüa khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Nakhowk khe Mosi mih uamow Eleazar, Nun kowh chapa Josua hai Israel chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi naiawngün maru-uüa lawnguan kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />Mosi tek pe mih, “Gad hai Reuben krungchakuüa kowi kowh kachakuüa nget tasen tawnguat khupma hown Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi natawi khowng enni tasen kown. Naiawng che amatni tawi khowng enni khai hanow enni ia powngta pren mih khin khe dow mami Gilead süng mih nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow amatni kowi peah büa diah. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Nachenganchepaw amatni che naiawng chang büah dowi hanow Kanan pren kowi chowtaih enni hown natawi ka dawngthawnguan bak kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Gad hai Reuben krungchakuüa tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek iawng en naruüa nachang kown taih. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Tasen tawnguat khupma hown CHAKRAMANG pur kowi Jawrdan aw anging natawi pown hanow Kanan pren kowi natawi kown taih. Nachenganchepaw anging kowh dawngthawnguan dow Jawrdan aw mapra pown kowi nata uowi kown,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="NUM 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Nakhowk khe Mosi dow Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun kowh pren hai Basanuüa kowh mang Awk kowh pren mih Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten, now Josef kowh chapa Manase krungchak dawnglang vüi tow pe khai. Marow hai aria aret kowi kowh süng maten dow kowbüah vüi kowi Mosi tow pe khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34-36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34-36" />Gad krungchakuüa dow Dibawn, Atarawt, Aroer, Atarawt-Sofan, Jazer, Jawkbeha, Bet-Nimra hai Bet-Haran pami marow kowi kowh tapat lut mih tap krawi plan raw büah khai, now amatni kowh tawncher uowi rah khah paw kawmla büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:34-36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37-38" />Reuben krungchakuüa dow Hesbawn, Eleale, Kiriathaim, Nebo, Baal-Meawn hai Sibma pami marow kowi kowh tapat lut mih tap krawi plan raw büah khai, now amatni rawah mih Nebo hai Baal-Meawn marow ming dow chapla pe ming sar büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:37-38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Manase kowh chapa Makir krungchakuüa dow Gileaduüa kowi kowsenah now nami süng dow kowpowngta khai. Now nakowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa maten kowi dow nami pren hownia prütta büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Naiawng rakowi Manase chapa Makir kowh krungchakuüa vüi Gilead süng mih Mosi tow pe khai. Makir krungchakuüa dow nami pren kowi uowi büah khai bowt. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Now Manase chapa Jair kowh krungchakuüa dow Amawruüa kowh marow kowkrawi powng khai, now naiawngün marow ming dow “Jair Marow” pahai chap pe ming sar khai. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Now Manase chapa Noba pami dow Kenat marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua kowkrawi powng khai, now aiamat ming iawng dow nami marow ming Noba Marow pahai chap pe ming sar khai.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa krawi uowila mih arah ming</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Israeluüa dow siphai hawmh iawng Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt hanow arah huma kowi cham krawi uowila khai. Amatni kowi kruiah mih dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Aia kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng Mosi dow tiama rawng kowi kowh amatni cham krawi uowila mih arah ming maten chabowih kowi ruila khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Israeluüa uown lawt mih dow Rameses marow hownia chekhai. Amatni lawt mih ni dow Takat Pawi kung kowi kowh auai ni khe chekhai. Nami dow ning uown kowi kowh la uown cher mih laitanga ni khe chekhai. Nami ni khe dow Aigupta maru-uüa maten pur hownia tasen awng khe kowh iawng Israeluüa uang lawt khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />Nami khin khe Aigupta maru-uüa dow dup amatni kowh chapa ta uak thüm chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh chapa ta kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowngta pe bowk chekhai, now amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi paw peah ripra khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Rameses marow hownia lawt hanow Israeluüa dow Sukawt pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Sukawt hownia lawt büah hanow amatni dow süngrüp süngkangma ria kowi kowh Etham pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Etham hownia lawt büah hanow Baal-Zephawn satlawt pra kowh Pi-Hawhirawt kowi kowplan büah khai, now Mikdawl re-e kowkhup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />Pi-Hawhirawt hownia lawt büah hanow sata Rik paipra pown kowi kowh Etham pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkowi büah khai, now nami süngrüp süngkangma kowi sum ni mang rawng krawi mang büah kung kowi dow Mara pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Mara hownia lawt büah hanow Elim pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. Elim pami arah kowi dow tuikuam uowi laipre kuam, now chekmarawng singh uowi 70 singh chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Elim hownia lawt büah hanow sata Rik re-e kowkhup tangbung büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Nami kung kowi dow sata Rik ria hownia lawt büah hanow Sin pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Sin pami süngrüp süngkangma hownia lawt büah hanow Dawpka pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Dawpka hownia lawt büah hanow Alus pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Alus hownia lawt büah hanow Refidim pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. Nakowi dow akham müa tui uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Refidim hownia lawt büah hanow Sinai pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Sinai pami süngrüp süngkangma hownia lawt büah hanow Kibrawt-Hatava kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />Kibrawt-Hatava hownia lawt büah hanow Hazerawt kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Hazerawt hownia lawt büah hanow Ritma kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Ritma hownia lawt büah hanow Rimawn-Perez kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Rimawn-Perez hownia lawt büah hanow Libna kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Libna hownia lawt büah hanow Rissa kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Rissa hownia lawt büah hanow Kehelatha kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />Kehelatha hownia lawt büah hanow Sefar hungh kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Sefar hungh hownia lawt büah hanow Harada kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Harada hownia lawt büah hanow Makhelawt kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Makhelawt hownia lawt büah hanow Tahat kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Tahat hownia lawt büah hanow Tera kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Tera hownia lawt büah hanow Mitka kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Mitka hownia lawt büah hanow Hasmawna kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Hasmawna hownia lawt büah hanow Mawserawt kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Mawserawt hownia lawt büah hanow Bene-Jakan kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Bene-Jakan hownia lawt büah hanow Hawr-Hagidgad kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Hawr-Hagidgad hownia lawt büah hanow Jawbatha kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Jawbatha hownia lawt büah hanow Abrawna kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Abrawna hownia lawt büah hanow Eziawn-Geber kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />Eziawn-Geber hownia lawt büah hanow Zin pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Kades marow kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Nami kung kowi dow Edawm pren sünghi re-e kowh Hawr hungh kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai.<verse eid="NUM 33:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt mih 40 ning kowi kowh tanga la kowi lacher pani khe CHAKRAMANG peah ana rakowi Hawr hungh luk kowi Arawn dow kowpün khai, now nami hungh kowi aia dow kowng khai. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Hawr hungh kowi Arawn kowng khe aia kowh ning dow 123 ning chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Nami hungh kowi Israeluüa uowi mih khin khe Arad marow kowi kowh Kananuüa mang dow Israeluüa uaimang mih satang ta khai. Nami mang uowi rah dow Kanan pren mrawkphak prakowi kowh Negeb süng kowi chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41-47" />Hawr hungh hownia lawt büah hanow Israeluüa cham krawi uowila mih dow auown khe Zalmawna kowi, nami kung kowi dow Punawn kowi, nami kung kowi dow Awbawt kowi, nami kung kowi dow Moab pren sünghi kowi kowh Ie-Abarim kowi, nami kung kowi dow Dibawn-Gad, nami kung kowi dow Almawn-Diblathaim kowi, now nami kung kowi dow Abarim hungma mawngma kowi kowh Nebu marow re-e chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 33:41-47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Nami kung kowi dow Abarim kowi kowh hungh hownia lawt büah hanow Moab pren kowi kowh dowm nai kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. Nami dowm nai dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Jeriko marow hown tatang klowk chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa khup tangbung mih dow Jawrdan aw pang kowi kowh Moab pren dowm nai Bet-Jesimawt pami hownia Abel-Sitim pami mowr chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50-52" />Jeriko marow hown kowh tatang klowk mih Jawrdan aw pang kowi kowh Moab pren dowm nai kowi Israeluüa uowi khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Jawrdan aw haipown hanow Kanan pren kowi enni kowkup mih khin khe nakowi kowh maru maten kowi enni naprütta kown. Hua kowi kowh amatni herah mih arup maten hai sawnah mih arup maten enni napiakta pe kown. Nami klen kowi arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara maten paw enni napiakta pe kown.<verse eid="NUM 33:50-52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />“Nami kung kowi dow nami pren mih enni napowngta pe hanow nakowi enni nauowi kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni napowngah kownkow nami pren dow ang pe enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Nami pren kowi kowh süng maten mih krungchak ahuma mih kowi dow süng paw ahuma enni napeah kown, now krungchak a-echow mih kowi dow süng paw a-echow enni napeah kown. Now chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh kimchakuüa uowi rah dow kuak pe plang khe kowh tatawng mih süng kowi nauowi kown takla. Now chowlowkkow krungchakuüa uowi rah süng kowi krungchakuüa naka uowi bowk kown.<verse eid="NUM 33:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />“Nachenganchepaw enni che nami pren kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi prütta bowk dowi hanow amatni dow natowk enni ngare kown. Amatni dow enni vüi hut hown taowng khe kowh iawng hai mikpüi khe kowh iawng naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Nakhowk khe dow amatni kowi ang napiakah kownkow ang kamrütta hüah mih enni luk kowi ang nauang pawla enni kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Kanan pren sünghi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1-2" />Israeluüa kowi mami ana nakowtek pe kownkow CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Enni nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow ang pe enni mih Kanan pren kowi enni kowuowi khe enni kowh pren sünghi dow maiawng naown kown: <verse eid="NUM 34:1-2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3-4" />Mrawkphak prakowi kowh enni kowh rihi dow satlawt prakowi kowh Sata Kowng hownia nauown kown. Nami hownia mrawkphak pra kowh Akrabim hungh mowr naown kown. Nami hownia dow Zin pape mih süngrüp süngkangma iawng panow satkup pra kowh Kades-Barnea mowr naown kown. Nami hownia dow Hazar Adar iawng panow Azmawn mowr naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 34:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />Azmawn hownia awr takui hanow Aigupta aw ret iawng panow Mediteranean sata kowi nakowchur kown.<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />“Satkup prakowi kowh enni kowh pren sünghi dow Mediteranean sata mowr naown kown.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />“Tawngphak prakowi kowh enni kowh pren sünghi dow Mediteranean sata hownia nauown kown, now nami hownia dow satlawt pra kowh Hawr hungh mowr naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />Nami hungh iawng panow Hamat mowr naown kown. Nami Hamat hownia Zedad mowr naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />Nami Zedad iawng panow Zifrawn mowr naown kown, nami hownia dow Hazar-Enan kowi nakowchur kown. Nami dow tawngphak prakowi kowh enni kowh pren sünghi naown kown.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />“Satlawt prakowi kowh enni kowh rihi dow Hazar-Enan hownia nauown kown, nami hownia dow tawngphak pra kowh Sefam mowr naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Now Sefam hownia Ai marow satlawt prakowi kowh Ribla marow mowr naiu dowm kown. Nami hownia dow Galili sata mowr naiu dowm kown. <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />Nami hownia Jawrdan aw ret iawng panow Sata Kowng kowi nakowchur kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 34:12">“Enni kowh pren dow nami tavir lut mih rihi lak kowi naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Nami kung kowi Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Kuak pe plang hanow pren kowi kowh krawng bawn tabakah büa diah. Nachenganchepaw taku krungchakuüa kowi hai Manase krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ta lat dawnglang miuüa kowi chowtaih enni nabak pe krawng bawn kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Reuben krungchakuüa hai Gad krungchakuüa dow rik kata krawng bawn khowk chekhai. Nakhowk khe Manase krungchakuüa hownia paw tawi ka krawng bawn mih uowi dawnglang khowk chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown rik kata krawng bawn khowk chekhai. Nami krawng bawn dow Jeriko marow hown tatang klowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bak krawng bawn kown mih aluchowuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />“Enni napowngah kown mih krawng bawn nabak enni kown mih dow uamow Eleazar hai Nun kowh chapa Josua iüah chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Bak krawng bawn mih khin khe natawi khowng kowiüah kownkow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow kowi napawah lowk ia chi kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow Juda krungchak hownia Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb, <verse eid="NUM 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Simiawn krungchak hownia Amihud kowh chapa Selumiel, <verse eid="NUM 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Benjamin krungchak hownia Kislawn kowh chapa Elidad, <verse eid="NUM 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Dan krungchak hownia Jawgli kowh chapa Bukki, <verse eid="NUM 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Josef kowh chapauüa pungmadawng kowi kowh Manase krungchak hownia Efawd kowh chapa Hanniel, <verse eid="NUM 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Josef kowh chapauüa pungmadawng kowi kowh Efraim krungchak hownia Siftan kowh chapa Kemuel, <verse eid="NUM 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Zebulun krungchak hownia Parnak kowh chapa Elizafan, <verse eid="NUM 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Isakar krungchak hownia Azzan kowh chapa Paltiel, <verse eid="NUM 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Aser krungchak hownia Selawmi kowh chapa Ahihud, <verse eid="NUM 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Naptali krungchak hownia Amihud kowh chapa Pedahel büah chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Naiawngün aluchowuüa kowi dow Kanan pren kowi kowh krawng bawn mih Israeluüa kowi nabak pe kownkow CHAKRAMANG ruiah mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Leviuüa vüi kowi kowh marow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Jeriko marow hown tatang klowk mih Jawrdan aw pang kowi kowh Moab pren dowm nai kowi Israeluüa uowi reng tak khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Leviuüa nauowiah kownkow enni kaah mih dawngthawnguan hownia amatni kowi enni napela marow ne kown takla. Naiawngün marow riaret kowi tawncher thing rah dowm paw enni napela kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Nahanow naiawngün marow dow amatni kowh uowi rah nachowng kown towbowt. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh dowm paw amatni kowh chia, ruapur, rua hai akeng mih tawncher thing rah nachowng kown towbowt.<verse eid="NUM 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />“Amatni kowi kowh enni napeah kown mih tawncher thing rah dowm dow marow tap hownia 250 lam mowr naown kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Nami tawncher thing rah dowm dow marow tap uat kowi enni nakhai pe kown. Nami dowm dow marow tap uat kowi satlawt hownia satkup mowr 500 lam, now tawngphak hownia mrawkphak mowr 500 lam chi naown kown. Now naiawngün tadawnglang kowi dow marow nauowi kown. Naiawngün dowm dow amatni kowh tawncher thing rah nachowng kown.<verse eid="NUM 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6-7" />“Leviuüa kowi dow bowkbowk kowi 48 marow enni napeah kown. Naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw enni napela kown takla. Naiawngün marow maten hownia 6 marow mih dow tatung tanimra marow enni nachangla kown. Nakowngta kown mih tuak uowi dowi kowi cham saita maru khai hanow nami maru dow naiawngün marow kowi naia powt kown. <verse eid="NUM 35:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchakuüa ka dawngthawnguan iawng Leviuüa kowi enni napeah marow kown takla. Krungchak akawmma miuüa dow ahuma nape marow kown, now krungchak a-echow miuüa dow nalang e pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tatung tanimra marow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10-11" />“Mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Jawrdan aw pownla hanow Kanan pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe enni vüi tatung tanimra marow enni nakhowm nabowkta sangrum kown. Nakowngta kown mih tuak uowi dowi kowi cham saita maru khai hanow nami maru dow naiawngün marow kowi naia powt kown. <verse eid="NUM 35:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Kowng mih maru kowh tainau-uüa lu klai pawkra hownia aia naia plaila kownkow nami marow kowi napowt kown. Nakowi che aia kowpowt hanow Israeluüa chetah tara dowi mowr aia kowi dow naka saiah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Leviuüa kowi enni napeah kown mih marow hownia 6 marow mih dow enni kowh tatung tanimra marow naown kown. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Naiawngün taruk klüng mih marow hownia sum buk mih marow dow Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi nauowi kown, now sum buk mih dow Kanan pren kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Naiawngün taruk klüng mih marow dow enni Israeluüa, enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa hai akeng prenchak uang tawi chang lup miuüa vüi tatung tanimra naown kown. Kowngta kown mih tuak uowi dowi kowi cham saita maru khai hanow nami maru dow naiawngün marow kowi naia powt kown.<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16-18" />“Nachenganchepaw nakowngta kown mih saktuak hown lawngha uanh hown chepaw, aiukma mih huaklu hown chepaw, singh dung hown chepaw cham kowngta maru khai hanow nami chang miia dow sai sak mih chekhai. Aia kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 35:16-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Napaw lu klai kown mih maru dow sai sak mih maru kowi nasaiah ngengche kown takla; nami sai sak mih maru kowi dow takrum hown krowksang aia nakowngta ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 35:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20-21" />Ransu saktuak hown nawtah chepaw, kuakah chepaw, thawngah chepaw cham kowngta maru khai hanow naiawng chang mih dow sai sak mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Napaw lu klai kown mih maru dow sai sak mih maru kowi krum hown krowksang nakowngta ngengche kown.<verse eid="NUM 35:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22-24" />“Nachenganchepaw ransu saktuak uowi dowi kowi rut tawi khawk tawi kowh cham saita maru mih chekhai hanow sai sak mih maru vüi ari arow kowi uowi iawng aluchowuüa nachang pe kown. <verse eid="NUM 35:22-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Aia kowi dow lu klai pawk mih maru rut hownia nalawngah kownkow tatung tanimra marow kowi aluchowuüa nasata iawk kown. Nami maru dow chimsaima mih sau hown kowh nümnapah mih uamow lang kri mih kowng dowi mowr nakowi nauowi kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 35:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26-27" />Tawkchedow tatung tanimra marow hownia nami maru cham ia lawt kown nadowi. Aia che cham lawt khai hanow lu klai pawk mih maru hown takrum kowh aia kowi kowngta khai chepaw lu klai pawk mih luk kowi aprek nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 35:26-27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Nami sai sak mih maru dow uamow lang kri mih kowng dowi mowr tatung tanimra marow kowi nauowi kown takla. Tawkche uamow lang kri mih kowng kung kowi dow aiamat kim kowi aia mih naia plan bowt kown taih. <verse eid="NUM 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />Lowra kowi enni cham uowi chepaw maiawngün ari aiang dow chowngchowng saksakma enni nachünah kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />“Sai sak mih maru luk kowi thuak saksi mih che uowi pre sum ia hanow nami maru kowi dow naia kowngta kown. Tawkche thuak saksi mih che lowk iachow taih hanow nami sai sak mih maru kowi naia kowngta kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />Kowng tataing mih aprek ka mih maru kowi dow tangka hown naia klanah kown nadowi. Aia kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />Tatung tanimra marow kowi kowh kowpowt mih maru kowi dow uamow lang kri mih kowng dowi tak khe tangka hown naia klanah kown nadowi, now aia kowi dow aiamat kim kowi naia pe planah kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />Sai maru sak now pren dow tasür talawk khai. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh pren dow enni nasürlawkah kown nadowi. Sai sak mih maru kowi saita dowi matchang pren dow natachim natasai kown nadowi. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Ang CHAKRAMANG dow enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi reng chekhai. Enni cham uowiah mih pren kowi ang paw natawi uowi reng kown. Naiawng rakowi pren dow enni naia sürlawkah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s1">Zelofehad chamauüa kowh krawng bawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Gilead dow Makir kowh chapa chekhai. Makir kowh pa dow Manase, Manase kowh pa dow Josef chekhai. Gilead krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Mosi hai akeng mih Israel krungchak aluchowuüa tut-e nakowtalawp kownkow kowkowi khai. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />Now amatni tek pe Mosi mih, “Kuak pe plang hanow Israeluüa kowi nabak pe krawng bawn kown mih CHAKRAMANG pe en ana khai. Now anging kowh tainau Zelofehad kowh krawng bawn dow achamauüa kowi napeah kown mih ana paw CHAKRAMANG pe en khai. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün Zelofehad kowh chamauüa dow Israel pungmadawng kowi kowh akeng mih krungchakuüa tut-e cham mang mih paw nauowi kown. Now anging pipu-uüa hownia amatni kaah mih krawng bawn dow amatni huauüa kowh krungchak vüi nachowng kown towbowt. Naiawng hai anging krungchakuüa kowh krawng bawn dow na-e kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Now amatni cham sumta krawng bawn khai hanow <char style="w">Jubili</char> ning uang ting chepaw nami krawng bawn mih anging krungchakuüa naka kown nadowi bowt. Nami dow amatni huauüa kowh krungchakuüa napowngta pe kown. Naiawng hai anging pipu-uüa hownia kowh anging kaah mih krawng bawn dow napraita anging kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Josef krungchakuüa tekah mih na nowm chekhai. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Naiawng rakowi Zelofehad kowh chamauüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG pe ana mih, ‘Enni nauah mih tut-e enni cham ia mang kown taih. Tawkchedow enni matia krungchakuüa tut-e enni nacham mang ngengche kown takla,’ pakhai. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Israel pungmadawng kowi chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowh krawng bawn dow akeng mih Israel krungchakuüa kowi naia pe kown nadowi. Amatni chowlowkkow pipu-uüa hownia kowh kaah mih krawng bawn dow amatni natownah reng kown takla. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi plungrak uowi dowi kowh dawngthawnguan powng takla mih masiuüa dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa tut-e nacham mang kown takla. Nahanow amatni chowlowkkow pipu-uüa hownia kowh kaah mih krawng bawn dow amatni krungchakuüa tut-e nauowi reng kown towbowt. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Israel pungmadawng kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowh krawng bawn dow akeng mih Israel krungchakuüa kowi naia pe kown nadowi. Amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowh krawng bawn dow amatni natownah reng kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10-11" />Nahanow Zelofehad kowh chama Mala, Tirza, Hawgla, Milka hai Noa büah dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana iawng rowprowp chang büah khai. Amatni dow amatni krungchak kowi kowh pahi pamauüa kowh chapauüa tut-e cham mang khai. <verse eid="NUM 36:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Amatni dow Josef kowh chapa Manase krungchakuüa tut-e cham mang büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni krungchakuüa kowh krawng bawn dow amatni krungchakuüa tut-e uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Maiawngün ana pek hai ari arow dow Israeluüa kowi nakowtek pe kownkow Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih chekhai. Nakhowk khe amatni uowi mih dow Moab pren dowm nai kowi chekhai. Nami dowm nai dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Jeriko marow hown tatang klowk chekhai.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>